: the speed and hitstops (`timeScale`, `hitstop()`). */\"},{\"line_number\":291,\"content\":\"    manual: boolean;\"},{\"line_number\":347,\"content\":\"    get timeScale(): number;\"},{\"line_number\":348,\"content\":\"    set timeScale(v: number);\"},{\"line_number\":385,\"content\":\"     * console. It runs in manual time from the start: advance it with `step()`, give it input with\"},{\"line_number\":429,\"content\":\"        timeScale: number;\"},{\"line_number\":481,\"content\":\"     * Tooling: switch to manual time and advance `n` frames of `dt` seconds (simulation,\"},{\"line_number\":486,\"content\":\"     * One manual frame (`step()`), its input live or from a recorded frame (`replay()`). A game\"},{\"line_number\":554,\"content\":\"     * without a transition), then every frame runs with the recorded input, in manual time\"},{\"line_number\":556,\"content\":\"     * early. Afterwards the level is where the recorded one was (`fingerprint()` matches if the\"},{\"line_number\":557,\"content\":\"     * game is deterministic) and stays in manual time: `step()` plays on from there, live, and\"},{\"line_number\":585,\"content\":\"     * the game's own (`Game.fingerprint`). Two runs that should be the same (a replay) compare equal. Not the `status()` line: a\"},{\"line_number\":588,\"content\":\"    fingerprint(): string;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/audio/index.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\"export { envelope, frequencyAt, noteFrequency, renderSound, soundDuration, type SoundDef, type Wave } from './synth';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/audio/synth.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"export declare function renderSound(def: SoundDef, sampleRate?: number, seed?: number): Float32Array<ArrayBuffer>;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/procgen/terrain.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":62,\"content\":\"export declare class Terrain {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/replay.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * one back frame for frame, and `engine.fingerprint()` hashes the state, so two runs that\"},{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\" *   engine.fingerprint() === fingerprintAtTheEnd;            // the same game, frame for frame\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/audio/AudioManager.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"/** Low-pass cutoff (Hz) for a muffle of 0..1: wide open to a dull thud. */\"},{\"line_number\":130,\"content\":\"    setVolume(channel: VolumeChannel, value: number): void;\"},{\"line_number\":134,\"content\":\"    resetVolumes(): void;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/index.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"export { AudioManager, attenuation, muffleCutoff, PLAYGROUND_SONG, SFX, noteFrequency, parseSong, renderSound, type AudioSettings, type Instrument, type PlayOptions, type SfxName, type Song, type SoundDef, spatialize, type Listener, type Spatial, type SpatialOptions, type Voice, type VoiceSettings, type VolumeChannel, type Wave, } from './audio';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/input.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":94,\"content\":\" * - Keys: held state, per-frame presses (`wasPressed`) and queued presses for fixed-step\"},{\"line_number\":203,\"content\":\"    wasPressed(...codes: string[]): boolean;\"},{\"line_number\":212,\"content\":\"    consumeAny(codes: readonly string[]): boolean;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/clock.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * Game time from real time: a speed (`engine.timeScale`: slow motion, fast forward, 0 to\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/texture/types.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\" * Rows of characters, one per texel, as `hud.sprite` draws them: each character is a legend key\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/physics/vehicle.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":44,\"content\":\"export declare class Vehicle {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/texture/convert.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * (no DOM canvas), and `hudSprite` rows for `hud.sprite`. A texture with problems throws a\"},{\"line_number\":37,\"content\":\" * One frame as `hud.sprite` rows and colours: a character per slot (a, b, c, … in palette order),\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\" *   const s = hudSprite('gem-icon'); hud.sprite(8, 8, s.rows, s.colors, { scale: 2 });\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/inspect/report.d.ts\