{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_13","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is an enormous game. I will implement it comprehensively but efficiently.\n\nI am reviewing the engine's key type signatures and harness checks to avoid API mistakes. The game will be simulation-heavy and leverage terrain, physics, vehicles, HUD, audio, and multiplayer hooks from day one.\n\nI am designing the test harness to run real gameplay code. To avoid slow headless engine startup on every test, I will reuse one engine per suite and reset it between cases where possible. Pure grid systems like fire may skip full terrain generation. The suites must still invoke the shipped game.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb0a8ba1-ff26-40a4-8141-5ec0df830871-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"CharacterController","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types","glob":"**/*.d.ts","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb0a8ba1-ff26-40a4-8141-5ec0df830871-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/physics/vehicle.d.ts","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb0a8ba1-ff26-40a4-8141-5ec0df830871-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/procgen/terrain.d.ts","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb0a8ba1-ff26-40a4-8141-5ec0df830871-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/Engine.d.ts","offset":60,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"ca