er button pressed or let go (`Input.buttonEvents`): its key, and where the pointer was (normalised device coordinates). */\"},{\"line_number\":94,\"content\":\" * - Keys: held state, per-frame presses (`wasPressed`) and queued presses for fixed-step\"},{\"line_number\":95,\"content\":\" *   code (`consumePress`). Queued presses expire after `pressWindow` s of game time.\"},{\"line_number\":96,\"content\":\" * - Gamepads (standard mapping): the left stick feeds `moveAxis()` (radial deadzone), the\"},{\"line_number\":108,\"content\":\"export declare class Input {\"},{\"line_number\":135,\"content\":\"    /** This frame's button presses and releases, in order (`buttonEvents`). */\"},{\"line_number\":136,\"content\":\"    private _buttonEvents;\"},{\"line_number\":170,\"content\":\"     * `setKey` / `setPointer` / `setButtons` / `addPointer` (touch buttons, scripts) and `send`\"},{\"line_number\":179,\"content\":\"    /** `target`: where keys are heard (the page's window); null listens to nothing (`Engine.headless`: input comes from `setKey`, `send`, a replay). */\"},{\"line_number\":203,\"content\":\"    wasPressed(...codes: string[]): boolean;\"},{\"line_number\":210,\"content\":\"    consumePress(...codes: string[]): boolean;\"},{\"line_number\":211,\"content\":\"    /** `consumePress` for a list of codes, without building a rest-argument array. */\"},{\"line_number\":225,\"content\":\"    moveAxis(): {\"},{\"line_number\":232,\"content\":\"    setKey(code: string, down: boolean): void;\"},{\"line_number\":246,\"content\":\"    get buttonEvents(): readonly ButtonEvent[];\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5c69e72a-c674-43c4-a733-ed57fd5e6a39-21","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,1