{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_60","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The file might be minified or compressed into a single line.\n\nI'll use Node to locate the speed assignment in the large pixel-engine.js file. After patching the palette, I'll run a smoke test. The implementation plan covers world.js fixes, six songs, sound effects, voice, and about content.\n\nThe plan now includes UI glyphs drawn as text prompts, a HUD draw function, network session handling, round state logic, game and main entry points, and soldier and box art models.\n\nThe plan now includes textures for grass and flame, a build script, a dev index.html, and tests. The cash run solo mode will use round logic inside src/sim/round.js. A comprehensive game state machine with modes like title, play, pause, attract, and ledger is being designed. The state() function will return the PLAN shape. Attract mode will check idle time before adding delta time.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5734068f-5833-414c-8158-afdaef0ad736-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/world/fire.js","offset":150,"limit":130}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5734068f-5833-414c-8158-afdaef0ad736-48","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/dialogue.js","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5734068f-5833-414c-8158-afdaef0ad736-49","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/sites.js","limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":864,"output_tokens":857,"cache_read_input_tokens":111488,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"9bed3857-516f-4bd7-a74b-4e06ee2088ec"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5734068f-5833-414c-8158-afdaef0ad736-47","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"150→    this.state[i] = 2;\\n    this.burntAt[i] = this.time;\\n    this.burntCount++;\\n    this.burntList.push(i);\\n    const ix = i % FIRE_N;\\n    const iz = (i / FIRE_N) | 0;\\n    this.onBurnt(ix, iz, i);\\n  }\\n\\n  spread() {\\n160→    const next = [];\\n    const wx = this.wind.x;\\n    const wz = this.wind.z;\\n    const wsp = this.wind.speed;\\n    const wlen = Math.hypot(wx, wz) || 1;\\n    const ux = wx / wlen;\\n    const uz = wz / wlen;\\n    const fresh = [];\\n    for (const i of this.burning) {\\n      if (this.state[i] !== 1) continue;\\n170→      if (this.time >= this.burnEnd[i]) {\\n        this.markBurnt(i);\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      next.push(i);\\n      const ix = i % FIRE_N;\\n      const iz = (i / FIRE_N) | 0;\\n      const h = this.heightAt(...this.center(ix, iz));\\n      for (const [dx, dz] of NBR) {\\n        const nx = ix + dx;\\n180→        const nz = iz + dz;\\n        if (nx < 0 || nz < 0 || nx >= FIRE_N || nz >= FIRE_N) continue;\\n        const j = this.idx(nx, nz);\\n        if (!this.canBurn(j)) continue;\\n        const len = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\\n        const cos = (dx / len) * ux + (dz / len) * uz;\\n        const windFactor = clamp(1 + TUNING.windEffect * (wsp / 5) * 1.6 * cos, 0.15, 3.5);\\n        if (dx === 1 && dz === 0) this.lastWindFactor = windFactor;\\n        const nh = this.heightAt(...this.center(nx, nz));\\n        const slopeFactor = nh > h + 0.4 ? 1.4 : nh < h - 0.4 ? 0.7 : 1;\\n190→        const rainFactor = this.rain ? 0.15 : 1;\\n        const diag = dx !== 0 && dz !== 0 ? 1.41 : 1;\\n        const p = BASE_P * (FUEL_FACTOR[this.fuel[j]] || 0) * windFactor * slopeFactor * rainFactor * TUNING.fireSpread / diag;\\n        if (this.rng.next() < p) fresh.push(j);\\n      }\\n      if (wsp > 6 && this.rng.next() < 0.04 * TUNING.fireSpread) {\\n        const hop = 2 + (this.rng.next() < 0.5 ? 0 : 1);\\n        const ex = ix + Math.round(ux * hop);\\n        const ez = iz + Math.round(uz * hop);\\n        if (ex >= 0 && ez >= 0 && ex < FIRE_N && ez < FIRE_N) fresh.push(this.idx(ex, ez));\\n200→      }\\n    }\\n    this.burning = next;\\n    for (const j of fresh) this.lightIndex(j);\\n  }\\n\\n  regrow() {\\n    if (TUNING.regrowHours <= 0 || this.burntList.length === 0) return;\\n    const keep = [];\\n    for (const i of this.burntList) {\\n210→      if (this.state[i] !== 2) continue;\\n      const ageH = (this.time - this.burntAt[i]) / 3600;\\n      if (ageH >= TUNING.regrowHours) {\\n        this.state[i] = 3;\\n        this.burntCount = Math.max(0, this.burntCount - 1);\\n      } else keep.push(i);\\n    }\\n    this.burntList = keep;\\n  }\\n\\n220→  /** Day roll: regrowth becomes fresh fuel at half spread weight. */\\n  dayRoll() {\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 3) {\\n        this.state[i] = 0;\\n        if (this.fuel[i] > 1) this.fuel[i] = 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n230→  extinguish() {\\n    for (const i of this.burning) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 1) this.state[i] = 0;\\n    }\\n    this.burning.length = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  /** Run-length encode state for the save. */\\n  encode() {\\n    const out = [];\\n240→    let prev = this.state[0];\\n    let n = 1;\\n    for (let i = 1; i <= this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (i < this.state.length && this.state[i] === prev && n < 65535) n++;\\n      else {\\n        out.push(prev, n);\\n        prev = this.state[i];\\n        n = 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n250→    return out;\\n  }\\n\\n  decode(runs) {\\n    this.state.fill(0);\\n    this.burning.length = 0;\\n    this.burntList.length = 0;\\n    this.burntCount = 0;\\n    let at = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < runs.length; i += 2) {\\n260→      const v = runs[i];\\n      const n = runs[i + 1];\\n      for (let k = 0; k < n && at < this.state.length; k++, at++) this.state[at] = v;\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 1) this.burning.push(i);\\n      if (this.state[i] === 2) {\\n        this.burntCount++;\\n        this.burntList.push(i);\\n      }\\n270→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  counts() {\\n    return { burning: this.burning.length, burnt: this.burntCount };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"150→    this.state[i] = 2;\\n    this.burntAt[i] = this.time;\\n    this.burntCount++;\\n    this.burntList.push(i);\\n    const ix = i % FIRE_N;\\n    const iz = (i / FIRE_N) | 0;\\n    this.onBurnt(ix, iz, i);\\n  }\\n\\n  spread() {\\n160→    const next = [];\\n    const wx = this.wind.x;\\n    const wz = this.wind.z;\\n    const wsp = this.wind.speed;\\n    const wlen = Math.hypot(wx, wz) || 1;\\n    const ux = wx / wlen;\\n    const uz = wz / wlen;\\n    const fresh = [];\\n    for (const i of this.burning) {\\n      if (this.state[i] !== 1) continue;\\n170→      if (this.time >= this.burnEnd[i]) {\\n        this.markBurnt(i);\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      next.push(i);\\n      const ix = i % FIRE_N;\\n      const iz = (i / FIRE_N) | 0;\\n      const h = this.heightAt(...this.center(ix, iz));\\n      for (const [dx, dz] of NBR) {\\n        const nx = ix + dx;\\n180→        const nz = iz + dz;\\n        if (nx < 0 || nz < 0 || nx >= FIRE_N || nz >= FIRE_N) continue;\\n        const j = this.idx(nx, nz);\\n        if (!this.canBurn(j)) continue;\\n        const len = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\\n        const cos = (dx / len) * ux + (dz / len) * uz;\\n        const windFactor = clamp(1 + TUNING.windEffect * (wsp / 5) * 1.6 * cos, 0.15, 3.5);\\n        if (dx === 1 && dz === 0) this.lastWindFactor = windFactor;\\n        const nh = this.heightAt(...this.center(nx, nz));\\n        const slopeFactor = nh > h + 0.4 ? 1.4 : nh < h - 0.4 ? 0.7 : 1;\\n190→        const rainFactor = this.rain ? 0.15 : 1;\\n        const diag = dx !== 0 && dz !== 0 ? 1.41 : 1;\\n        const p = BASE_P * (FUEL_FACTOR[this.fuel[j]] || 0) * windFactor * slopeFactor * rainFactor * TUNING.fireSpread / diag;\\n        if (this.rng.next() < p) fresh.push(j);\\n      }\\n      if (wsp > 6 && this.rng.next() < 0.04 * TUNING.fireSpread) {\\n        const hop = 2 + (this.rng.next() < 0.5 ? 0 : 1);\\n        const ex = ix + Math.round(ux * hop);\\n        const ez = iz + Math.round(uz * hop);\\n        if (ex >= 0 && ez >= 0 && ex < FIRE_N && ez < FIRE_N) fresh.push(this.idx(ex, ez));\\n200→      }\\n    }\\n    this.burning = next;\\n    for (const j of fresh) this.lightIndex(j);\\n  }\\n\\n  regrow() {\\n    if (TUNING.regrowHours <= 0 || this.burntList.length === 0) return;\\n    const keep = [];\\n    for (const i of this.burntList) {\\n210→      if (this.state[i] !== 2) continue;\\n      const ageH = (this.time - this.burntAt[i]) / 3600;\\n      if (ageH >= TUNING.regrowHours) {\\n        this.state[i] = 3;\\n        this.burntCount = Math.max(0, this.burntCount - 1);\\n      } else keep.push(i);\\n    }\\n    this.burntList = keep;\\n  }\\n\\n220→  /** Day roll: regrowth becomes fresh fuel at half spread weight. */\\n  dayRoll() {\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 3) {\\n        this.state[i] = 0;\\n        if (this.fuel[i] > 1) this.fuel[i] = 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n230→  extinguish() {\\n    for (const i of this.burning) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 1) this.state[i] = 0;\\n    }\\n    this.burning.length = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  /** Run-length encode state for the save. */\\n  encode() {\\n    const out = [];\\n240→    let prev = this.state[0];\\n    let n = 1;\\n    for (let i = 1; i <= this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (i < this.state.length && this.state[i] === prev && n < 65535) n++;\\n      else {\\n        out.push(prev, n);\\n        prev = this.state[i];\\n        n = 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n250→    return out;\\n  }\\n\\n  decode(runs) {\\n    this.state.fill(0);\\n    this.burning.length = 0;\\n    this.burntList.length = 0;\\n    this.burntCount = 0;\\n    let at = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < runs.length; i += 2) {\\n260→      const v = runs[i];\\n      const n = runs[i + 1];\\n      for (let k = 0; k < n && at < this.state.length; k++, at++) this.state[at] = v;\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 1) this.burning.push(i);\\n      if (this.state[i] === 2) {\\n        this.burntCount++;\\n        this.burntList.push(i);\\n      }\\n270→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  counts() {\\n    return { burning: this.burning.length, burnt: this.burntCount };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/world/fire.js\",\"offset\":150,\"limit\":130,\"raw_output\":\"    this.state[i] = 2;\\n    this.burntAt[i] = this.time;\\n    this.burntCount++;\\n    this.burntList.push(i);\\n    const ix = i % FIRE_N;\\n    const iz = (i / FIRE_N) | 0;\\n    this.onBurnt(ix, iz, i);\\n  }\\n\\n  spread() {\\n    const next = [];\\n    const wx = this.wind.x;\\n    const wz = this.wind.z;\\n    const wsp = this.wind.speed;\\n    const wlen = Math.hypot(wx, wz) || 1;\\n    const ux = wx / wlen;\\n    const uz = wz / wlen;\\n    const fresh = [];\\n    for (const i of this.burning) {\\n      if (this.state[i] !== 1) continue;\\n      if (this.time >= this.burnEnd[i]) {\\n        this.markBurnt(i);\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      next.push(i);\\n      const ix = i % FIRE_N;\\n      const iz = (i / FIRE_N) | 0;\\n      const h = this.heightAt(...this.center(ix, iz));\\n      for (const [dx, dz] of NBR) {\\n        const nx = ix + dx;\\n        const nz = iz + dz;\\n        if (nx < 0 || nz < 0 || nx >= FIRE_N || nz >= FIRE_N) continue;\\n        const j = this.idx(nx, nz);\\n        if (!this.canBurn(j)) continue;\\n        const len = Math.hypot(dx, dz);\\n        const cos = (dx / len) * ux + (dz / len) * uz;\\n        const windFactor = clamp(1 + TUNING.windEffect * (wsp / 5) * 1.6 * cos, 0.15, 3.5);\\n        if (dx === 1 && dz === 0) this.lastWindFactor = windFactor;\\n        const nh = this.heightAt(...this.center(nx, nz));\\n        const slopeFactor = nh > h + 0.4 ? 1.4 : nh < h - 0.4 ? 0.7 : 1;\\n        const rainFactor = this.rain ? 0.15 : 1;\\n        const diag = dx !== 0 && dz !== 0 ? 1.41 : 1;\\n        const p = BASE_P * (FUEL_FACTOR[this.fuel[j]] || 0) * windFactor * slopeFactor * rainFactor * TUNING.fireSpread / diag;\\n        if (this.rng.next() < p) fresh.push(j);\\n      }\\n      if (wsp > 6 && this.rng.next() < 0.04 * TUNING.fireSpread) {\\n        const hop = 2 + (this.rng.next() < 0.5 ? 0 : 1);\\n        const ex = ix + Math.round(ux * hop);\\n        const ez = iz + Math.round(uz * hop);\\n        if (ex >= 0 && ez >= 0 && ex < FIRE_N && ez < FIRE_N) fresh.push(this.idx(ex, ez));\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.burning = next;\\n    for (const j of fresh) this.lightIndex(j);\\n  }\\n\\n  regrow() {\\n    if (TUNING.regrowHours <= 0 || this.burntList.length === 0) return;\\n    const keep = [];\\n    for (const i of this.burntList) {\\n      if (this.state[i] !== 2) continue;\\n      const ageH = (this.time - this.burntAt[i]) / 3600;\\n      if (ageH >= TUNING.regrowHours) {\\n        this.state[i] = 3;\\n        this.burntCount = Math.max(0, this.burntCount - 1);\\n      } else keep.push(i);\\n    }\\n    this.burntList = keep;\\n  }\\n\\n  /** Day roll: regrowth becomes fresh fuel at half spread weight. */\\n  dayRoll() {\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 3) {\\n        this.state[i] = 0;\\n        if (this.fuel[i] > 1) this.fuel[i] = 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  extinguish() {\\n    for (const i of this.burning) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 1) this.state[i] = 0;\\n    }\\n    this.burning.length = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  /** Run-length encode state for the save. */\\n  encode() {\\n    const out = [];\\n    let prev = this.state[0];\\n    let n = 1;\\n    for (let i = 1; i <= this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (i < this.state.length && this.state[i] === prev && n < 65535) n++;\\n      else {\\n        out.push(prev, n);\\n        prev = this.state[i];\\n        n = 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return out;\\n  }\\n\\n  decode(runs) {\\n    this.state.fill(0);\\n    this.burning.length = 0;\\n    this.burntList.length = 0;\\n    this.burntCount = 0;\\n    let at = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < runs.length; i += 2) {\\n      const v = runs[i];\\n      const n = runs[i + 1];\\n      for (let k = 0; k < n && at < this.state.length; k++, at++) this.state[at] = v;\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.state.length; i++) {\\n      if (this.state[i] === 1) this.burning.push(i);\\n      if (this.state[i] === 2) {\\n        this.burntCount++;\\n        this.burntList.push(i);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  counts() {\\n    return { burning: this.burning.length, burnt: this.burntCount };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":276}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5734068f-5833-414c-8158-afdaef0ad736-48","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Spoken lines. Each fits the HUD font and stays at or under 60 characters. */\\nexport const LINES = {\\n  'bakr:m0.1': 'FORTY MILES OF TRACK AND NOT ONE STATION',\\n  'bakr:m0.2': 'THAT REMEMBERS ITS NAME.',\\n  'bakr:m0.3': 'THEY PAINT THE SIGNS OVER. WHOEVER WON LAST.',\\n  'bakr:m0.4': 'YOU HAVE THE LOOK OF A MAN WHO READ ABOUT THIS PLACE.',\\n  'bakr:m0.5': 'READING IS A GOOD WAY TO VISIT.',\\n  'bakr:m0.6': 'UP THERE THEY WILL ASK YOU WHICH SIDE. SAY YES.',\\n  'bakr:halt': 'THIS HALT USED TO HAVE A LONGER NAME.',\\n10→  'odile:m1.1': 'THREE TABLETS. THE FOURTH YOU PAY FOR.',\\n  'odile:m1.2': 'I DO NOT MEAN IN STONES.',\\n  'odile:m1.3': 'I DO NOT NEED YOU TO BE GOOD. I NEED YOU TO BE ON TIME.',\\n  'odile:m1.4': 'SIXTY-ONE BEDS. FORTY BLANKETS. YOU ARE THE MATH.',\\n  'odile:refuse': 'COME BACK WHEN THE WELLS HAVE WATER. I AM COUNTING.',\\n  'odile:m8.1': 'GET THEM ON THE TRAIN. COUNT THE ONES WHO MAKE IT.',\\n  'vance:m3.1': 'WE DO NOT BURN VILLAGES. WE CONCLUDE THEM.',\\n  'vance:m3.2': 'THE DEPOT IS A REGRETTABLE MATTER. CONCLUDE IT.',\\n  'vance:m5.1': 'THE WATER QUESTION HAS BEEN A GREAT SORROW TO THIS OFFICE.',\\n  'vance:m5.2': 'YOUR INVOICE WILL BE HONOURED, REGRETTABLY.',\\n20→  'vance:pay': 'THE MATTER IS CLOSED. THE INVOICE WILL FOLLOW.',\\n  'ansa:m4.1': 'YOU SAID LESS PEOPLE. FEWER. FEWER PEOPLE.',\\n  'ansa:m4.2': 'IT WILL MATTER BY THE END OF THE MONTH.',\\n  'ansa:m6.1': 'BURN THE FIELD. A HUNGRY MAN LEARNS TO READ THE WIND.',\\n  'ansa:pay': 'THE GRAMMAR WAS THE LEAST OF IT. TAKE THE STONES.',\\n  'tibor:shop': 'EVERYTHING ON THIS RACK HAS BEEN RETURNED AT LEAST ONCE.',\\n  'tibor:price': 'IT FIRES. IF YOU WANT IT TO FIRE TWICE, THAT IS A DIFFERENT PRICE.',\\n  'tibor:m2.1': 'SHE OWES ME A PLANE. I OWE HER A KEY. FETCH HER.',\\n  'ines:meet': 'I FLEW FOR BOTH OF THEM. NEITHER PAID. GET IN.',\\n  'ines:owe': 'YOU OWE ME A TRUCK. YOU OWE ME SEVERAL TRUCKS.',\\n30→  'ines:m3': 'TAKE THE TANKER AT THE EAST POST AND DRIVE IT IN.',\\n  'dov:meet': 'TWO FINGERS I LEFT IN THIS COUNTRY.',\\n  'dov:meet2': 'I CAME BACK TO SEE WHAT THEY ARE DOING.',\\n  'dov:road': 'A MAN ASKED ME TO MINE HIS OWN ROAD, SO HE WOULD KNOW',\\n  'dov:road2': 'WHERE IT WAS SAFE. HE WAS RIGHT FOR A WEEK.',\\n  'dov:m4': 'PLANT THESE ON THE BRIDGE. I WILL TELL YOU WHEN.',\\n  'mags:work': 'HOLD STILL. NO, YOU CANNOT FEEL THAT. NO, THAT IS NORMAL.',\\n  'mags:work2': 'HOLD STILL.',\\n  'mags:owe': 'NOT TODAY. TODAY YOU OWE ME MONEY.',\\n  'mags:m5': 'OPEN THE BYPASS AND HOLD THE PUMP. THE CISTERN CAN FILL.',\\n40→  'buddy:burn': 'DO NOT LET IT BE THE FIRE. PLEASE. NOT THE FIRE.',\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Spoken lines. Each fits the HUD font and stays at or under 60 characters. */\\nexport const LINES = {\\n  'b