{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_73","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"512 terrain builds completed successfully.\n\nSpeed and movement are working correctly. Forward movement at yaw 0 aligns with the -Z axis. The 1.6 ms per frame rate means a full playthrough takes about 59 seconds, which is acceptable for --all.\n\nFire grid coverage is confirmed. The next step is writing all game files, testing vehicle drive and collider toggling, and jamming or burning while the audio files are generated.\n\nVehicle controls are being tested alongside file writing. The full playthrough should finish in about two minutes without rebuilding terrain between missions. Key bindings for movement and fire are confirmed. Gun jamming will be tested next.\n\nWorld patches are being applied to fix dead buddy persistence across mission resets. The constructor will track dead buddies in a Set and store the current round. startMission will add passed dead IDs to that set. applySetup will merge deadIds with existing dead buddies instead of replacing them.\n\nBuddy death will add IDs to the persistent dead set. A downBuddy method is being added. tickPlayer input and tryUse extras are being wired up. announceStep spawns are being fixed. Surgery hurt already clears surgeryT. Drive will keep moving when the map is open. The map cursor needs fixing too. Round hooks in down() and a startRound method for round.js are planned.\n\nround.js will attach itself to world.round. The Round class implements downLocal. When hurt during an active round, down() sets seat bleed, drops the case, and keeps hero HP at 0 so state().hp reads 0 while downed. A flag may prevent double down calls.\n\ntickPlayer will return early when a round is active so downed players cannot move. Revive restores 40 HP. Fever ticks are enabled during rounds with feverT set to 99999 and blocksSim disabled. A world.toJSON() save snapshot is being added.\n\nThe save snapshot will encode guns, fire state, flags, buddies, hour, and position. completeStep will add dead buddy IDs to the persistent dead set. applySetup will merge passed dead IDs with existing dead buddies before rebuilding the buddy list.\n\napplySetup will zero out HP and mark dead buddies as alive false when rebuilding the buddy list. A potential issue was spotted: applySetup never resets the friends ledger, so isolated starts that pass dead IDs could accumulate duplicate friend counts across missions.\n\napplySetup will only increment the friends ledger for dead buddy IDs that are not already in the persistent dead set. This prevents duplicate counts during isolated tests. knockBuddy downs buddies without killing them; finish handles actual death.\n\napplySetup will only increment the friends ledger for dead buddy IDs passed in opts.dead, not for the initial persistent dead set. This prevents duplicate counts during isolated mission starts. The test expects the friends count to rise from 1 to 2 when dov is dead at start and then dies during m6. applySetup sets the sheet from setup, but startMission overrides it with opts.sheet.\n\nSoldiers will spawn for clear missions. Fuel tanks will be destructible with 40 HP. useContext and finishBuddy methods are being added. The map cursor will track mouseDelta while the map is open, and movement input will remain active.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Terrain boots at 512 cells and the player walks. I'm wiring actions, buddies, and the round into that simulation next."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ef3841d-faad-4fdd-8d54-0be595804317-67","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    this.sheet = null;\n    this.ending = null;\n    this.civilians = 12;\n    this.movedOnce = false;\n  }","new_string":"    this.sheet = null;\n    this.ending = null;\n    this.civilians = 12;\n    this.movedOnce = false;\n    this.deadBuddies = new Set();\n    this.round = null;\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ef3841d-faad-4fdd-8d54-0be595804317-68","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"  down() {\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && !b.down && (b.spentUntil || 0) <= this.clock);","new_string":"  down() {\n    if (this.round) {\n      this.round.noteDown();\n      return;\n    }\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && !b.down && (b.spentUntil || 0) <= this.clock);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ef3841d-faad-4fdd-8d54-0be595804317-69","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    this.guns = [];\n    for (const g of setup.guns || []) this.giveGun(g.id, g.cond);\n    if (!this.guns.find((g) => g.id === 'cane') && (setup.guns || []).length) this.giveGun('cane', 100);\n    this.buddies = (setup.buddies || []).map((id) => this.makeBuddy(id));\n    for (const id of deadIds) {\n      const b = this.buddies.find((x) => x.id === id);\n      if (b) {\n        b.alive = false;\n        b.down = false;\n        this.ledger.friends += 1;\n      } else this.buddies.push({ ...this.makeBuddy(id), alive: false, down: false, hp: 0 });\n    }","new_string":"    this.guns = [];\n    for (const g of setup.guns || []) this.giveGun(g.id, g.cond);\n    if (!this.guns.find((g) => g.id === 'cane') && (setup.guns || []).length) this.giveGun('cane', 100);\n    for (const id of deadIds) {\n      if (!this.deadBuddies.has(id)) {\n        this.deadBuddies.add(id);\n        this.ledger.friends += 1;\n      }\n    }\n    this.buddies = [];\n    const listed = new Set(setup.buddies || []);\n    for (const id of listed) {\n      const b = this.makeBuddy(id);\n      if (this.deadBuddies.has(id)) {\n        b.alive = false;\n        b.hp = 0;\n      }\n      this.buddies.push(b);\n    }\n    for (const id of this.deadBuddies) {\n      if (!listed.has(id)) this.buddies.push({ ...this.makeBuddy(id), alive: false, down: false, hp: 0 });\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ef3841d-faad-4fdd-8d54-0be595804317-70","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    this.sheet = setup.sheet || null;\n    this.ending = null;","new_string":"    this.sheet = setup.sheet || null;\n    this.ending = null;\n    if (deadIds.sheet) this.sheet = deadIds.sheet;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ef3841d-faad-4fdd-8d54-0be595804317-71","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    const dead = opts.dead || [];\n    this.applySetup(m.setup || {}, dead);","new_string":"    const dead = opts.dead || [];\n    this.applySetup(m.setup || {}, dead);\n    if (opts.sheet) this.sheet = opts.sheet;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ef3841d-faad-4fdd-8d54-0be595804317-72","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    if (s.do === 'buddy-down') this.knockBuddy();\n    if (s.do === 'fever-fall') {","new_string":"    if (s.do === 'buddy-down') this.knockBuddy();\n    if (s.do === 'clear') {\n      const site = siteById('ranger-post') || { x: this.feet().x, z: this.feet().z };\n      this.spawnSoldier({ id: s.tag, post: s.tag, x: site.x + 2, z: site.z, faction: 'concord' });\n    }\n    if (s.do === 'fever-fall') {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ef3841d-faad-4fdd-8d54-0be595804317-73","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"  knockBuddy() {\n    const b = this.buddies.find((x) => x.alive && !x.down);\n    if (!b) {\n      this.subtitle = line('buddy:burn');\n      this.completeStep();\n      return;\n    }\n    b.hp = 0;\n    b.down = true;\n    b.downLeft = 40;\n    b.burning = true;\n    b.x = this.feet().x + 1.2;\n    b.z = this.feet().z;\n    this.subtitle = line('buddy:burn');\n    this.speaker = b.name;\n  }","new_string":"  knockBuddy() {\n    const b = this.buddies.find((x) => x.alive && !x.down);\n    if (!b) {\n      this.subtitle = line('buddy:burn');\n      this.completeStep();\n      return;\n    }\n    this.downBuddy(b.id, { burning: true });\n    this.subtitle = line('buddy:burn');\n    this.speaker = b.name;\n  }\n\n  downBuddy(id, opts = {}) {\n    let b = this.buddies.find((x) => x.id === id);\n    if (!b) {\n      b = this.makeBuddy(id);\n      this.buddies.push(b);\n    }\n    b.hp = 0;\n    b.alive = true;\n    b.down = true;\n    b.downLeft = 40;\n    b.burning = !!opts.burning;\n    const p = this.feet();\n    b.x = p.x + 1.2;\n    b.z = p.z;\n    return b;\n  }\n\n  finishBuddy(b) {\n    if (!b || !b.down) return;\n    b.alive = false;\n    b.down = false;\n    b.hp = 0;\n    if (!this.deadBuddies.has(b.id)) {\n      this.deadBuddies.add(b.id);\n      this.ledger.friends += 1;\n    }\n    this.subtitle = 'IT IS DONE.';\n    if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'buddy-down') this.completeStep();\n  }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":911,"output_tokens":4002,"cache_read_input_tokens":139648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e