{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_93","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hover uses the items index, but draw slices.\n\nHover y positions will use a top offset of 86 to match the draw list. This aligns hover and click targets for Playwright tests.\n\nNDC coordinates for the first menu item are calculated to enable precise Playwright pointer clicks. The title screen's single press-to-start option also aligns at y=86. Next steps are writing main.js and the boot test.\n\nTouch mode shows only the SETTINGS menu. Title screen idle exits on mouse movement, so attract tests must avoid pointer motion. Engine step noise is unlikely. World simulation remains fixed during title while fire still steps. startMission switches to play mode and defers fixedUpdate to the next frame.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-91520a0f-1472-4713-b93b-2ec0600a38b5-120","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"interface PlayOptions","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/types/engine/audio","-A":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-91520a0f-1472-4713-b93b-2ec0600a38b5-121","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","old_string":"      const y = 78 + i * 16;","new_string":"      const y = 86 + i * 16;"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3417,"output_tokens":723,"cache_read_input_tokens":199040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"bbc05a52-23ca-4f03-b2b4-181bdd72d8d3"}
