{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_125","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Enter and drive commands work. Drive performance is 22 meters in two seconds, mostly under -Z, matching the expected look.\n\nRepair hold failed after 3.33 seconds. The code requires 1.5 seconds with the vkit upgrade, or 3 seconds without it. Need to check the `held` flag in tryUse.\n\nThe `held` flag should be true after holding KeyE for 200 frames. The real issue may be that the truck is no longer considered near after repair announce resets the vehicle state, since `feet()` falls back to the hero position when not in a vehicle.\n\nThe hero stays at the spawn position while the vehicle is driven away. During repair announce, `feet()` returns the hero's coordinates because `inVehicle` remains true at that point. The truck therefore resets to the spawn area instead of near the player.\n\nThe repair step resets the truck to the vehicle position plus three on the X axis. The hero remains at the original spawn point. The distance exceeds eight units, so the nearness check fails and the repair hold never completes.\n\nThe fix is to teleport the hero next to the truck during repair exit. The truck should be placed at the current vehicle position rather than offset by three units from the feet coordinates.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ac1275bf-1076-4f9a-8aa0-c7d234d9072a-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":1055,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":790,"output_tokens":1078,"cache_read_input_tokens":107904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"73bb8208-3a88-471e-9d19-52972e233e4f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ac1275bf-1076-4f9a-8aa0-c7d234d9072a-55","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1055→    const take = Math.min(need, gun.reserve);\\n    gun.mag += take;\\n    gun.reserve -= take;\\n  }\\n\\n1060→  tryUse(dt, input) {\\n    const pressed = consumeAction(input, 'use');\\n    const held = heldAction(input, 'use') || input.isDown('KeyE');\\n    if (!pressed && !held) {\\n      this.holdT.use = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && b.down && Math.hypot((b.x || p.x) - p.x, (b.z || p.z) - p.z) < 2.5);\\n    if (buddy && pressed && this.syrettes > 0 && !buddy.burning) {\\n1070→      this.syrettes -= 1;\\n      buddy.down = false;\\n      buddy.hp = buddy.max * 0.5;\\n      buddy.trust += 1;\\n      buddy.burning = false;\\n      if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'buddy-down') this.completeStep();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (buddy && pressed && (buddy.burning || this.syrettes <= 0)) {\\n      this.finishBuddy(buddy);\\n1080→      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.map.up && pressed) {\\n      this.pickWaypoint();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const truckNear = this.car && Math.hypot(this.truckPos().x - p.x, this.truckPos().z - p.z) < 8;\\n    if (truckNear && this.vehicleHp < 50 && held) {\\n      this.holdT.use += dt || 0.016;\\n      const need = this.upgrades.has('vkit') ? 1.5 : 3;\\n1090→      if (this.holdT.use >= need) {\\n        this.vehicleHp = 50;\\n        this.holdT.use = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'repair') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (!pressed) return;\\n    if (truckNear && !this.inVehicle && this.vehicleHp >= 50) {\\n      this.inVehicle = true;\\n1100→      this.hero.collider.setEnabled(false);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.inVehicle) {\\n      this.inVehicle = false;\",\"content_concise\":\"1055→    const take = Math.min(need, gun.reserve);\\n    gun.mag += take;\\n    gun.reserve -= take;\\n  }\\n\\n1060→  tryUse(dt, input) {\\n    const pressed = consumeAction(input, 'use');\\n    const held = heldAction(input, 'use') || input.isDown('KeyE');\\n    if (!pressed && !held) {\\n      this.holdT.use = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && b.down && Math.hypot((b.x || p.x) - p.x, (b.z || p.z) - p.z) < 2.5);\\n    if (buddy && pressed && this.syrettes > 0 && !buddy.burning) {\\n1070→      this.syrettes -= 1;\\n      buddy.down = false;\\n      buddy.hp = buddy.max * 0.5;\\n      buddy.trust += 1;\\n      buddy.burning = false;\\n      if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'buddy-down') this.completeStep();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (buddy && pressed && (buddy.burning || this.syrettes <= 0)) {\\n      this.finishBuddy(buddy);\\n1080→      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.map.up && pressed) {\\n      this.pickWaypoint();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const truckNear = this.car && Math.hypot(this.truckPos().x - p.x, this.truckPos().z - p.z) < 8;\\n    if (truckNear && this.vehicleHp < 50 && held) {\\n      this.holdT.use += dt || 0.016;\\n      const need = this.upgrades.has('vkit') ? 1.5 : 3;\\n1090→      if (this.holdT.use >= need) {\\n        this.vehicleHp = 50;\\n        this.holdT.use = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'repair') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (!pressed) return;\\n    if (truckNear && !this.inVehicle && this.vehicleHp >= 50) {\\n      this.inVehicle = true;\\n1100→      this.hero.collider.setEnabled(false);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.inVehicle) {\\n      this.inVehicle = false;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js\",\"offset\":1055,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"    const take = Math.min(need, gun.reserve);\\n    gun.mag += take;\\n    gun.reserve -= take;\\n  }\\n\\n  tryUse(dt, input) {\\n    const pressed = consumeAction(input, 'use');\\n    const held = heldAction(input, 'use') || input.isDown('KeyE');\\n    if (!pressed && !held) {\\n      this.holdT.use = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && b.down && Math.hypot((b.x || p.x) - p.x, (b.z || p.z) - p.z) < 2.5);\\n    if (buddy && pressed && this.syrettes > 0 && !buddy.burning) {\\n      this.syrettes -= 1;\\n      buddy.down = false;\\n      buddy.hp = buddy.max * 0.5;\\n      buddy.trust += 1;\\n      buddy.burning = false;\\n      if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'buddy-down') this.completeStep();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (buddy && pressed && (buddy.burning || this.syrettes <= 0)) {\\n      this.finishBuddy(buddy);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.map.up && pressed) {\\n      this.pickWaypoint();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const truckNear = this.car && Math.hypot(this.truckPos().x - p.x, this.truckPos().z - p.z) < 8;\\n    if (truckNear && this.vehicleHp < 50 && held) {\\n      this.holdT.use += dt || 0.016;\\n      const need = this.upgrades.has('vkit') ? 1.5 : 3;\\n      if (this.holdT.use >= need) {\\n        this.vehicleHp = 50;\\n        this.holdT.use = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'repair') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (!pressed) return;\\n    if (truckNear && !this.inVehicle && this.vehicleHp >= 50) {\\n      this.inVehicle = true;\\n      this.hero.collider.setEnabled(false);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.inVehicle) {\\n      this.inVehicle = false;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1334}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"5d9922fd-76b2-4756-8a3a-4142406df288"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_126","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Another bug was found: when the truck is not near and an item is held but not pressed, the code returns prematurely.\n\nDistance is the real issue, not the held flag. The repair announcement must place the player beside the broken truck instead of inside the vehicle. The m1 flow fix ensures the player exits the vehicle before repairing.\n\nThe repair announcement must bring the broken truck to the player rather than teleporting the player. When the player is in a vehicle, the truck currently jumps ahead by three units while the hero stays behind. The fix adds a check for whether the player is driving before positioning the truck.\n\nThe repair logic now resets the truck beside the car when the player is driving, or places it three units ahead when on foot. The hero then teleports to stand two units from the truck. A 200-frame hold should exceed the three-second threshold, but a large delta-time bug may still exist.\n\nThe delta-time is confirmed correct at one-sixtieth of a second per frame. The repair exit fix is the next priority. Then world.js needs auditing for other obvious bugs. Tests will be written to drive the real game. HTML will be built and verified. A large remaining task.\n\nI will read PLAN.md and TASK.md to align the test runner with the required observations. I also need to study tickMission and mission step types so the bot can actually finish each mission. The remaining work is to audit world.js for playthrough blockers, write a comprehensive test runner, fix failures, build the HTML, and verify in the browser.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7cf8e2-a471-414a-94d3-ce91b57038d0-56","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    if (s.do === 'repair') {\n      const x = this.feet().x + 3;\n      const z = this.feet().z;\n      if (!this.car) this.ensureTruck(x, z);\n      else this.car.reset([x, this.ground(x, z) + 1.2, z], Math.PI);\n      this.vehicleHp = 0;\n      this.inVehicle = false;\n      if (this.hero.collider) this.hero.collider.setEnabled(true);\n    }","new_string":"    if (s.do === 'repair') {\n      const riding = this.inVehicle && this.car;\n      const here = this.feet();\n      const x = here.x + (riding ? 0 : 3);\n      const z = here.z;\n      if (!this.car) this.ensureTruck(x, z);\n      else this.car.reset([x, this.ground(x, z) + 1.2, z], Math.PI);\n      this.vehicleHp = 0;\n      this.inVehicle = false;\n      if (this.hero.collider) this.hero.collider.setEnabled(true);\n      const t = this.truckPos();\n      this.hero.teleport([t.x + 2, this.ground(t.x, t.z) + 0.1, t.z]);\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7cf8e2-a471-414a-94d3-ce91b57038d0-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tickMission|completeStep|do ===","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1658,"output_tokens":1304,"cache_read_input_tokens":108672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"02d4d472-646e-4589-a2a9-c58e7d1c7797"}
