{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_128","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fixing a falsy `choicePick 0` issue.\n\nThe fix is `choicePick != null`. `tryUse` completes report steps immediately on use without setting `_reported`, so `tickMission` won't double-complete. The bug specifically affects walk ending with option 0.\n\nPlanning a test harness to play missions with a bot helper and fix failures. Will read world.js sections on prop spawning, ignition, combat, and damage. Also checking game.js state and attract functions for test access.\n\nThe test plan covers five categories: static checks, system behaviors, playthroughs, solo rounds, and endings. A full suite should run 1–2 minutes. Destroy steps require real shots hitting props.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b87e57e-7fca-41be-96f0-a551537f36e2-60","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'choice' && this.choicePick) {","new_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'choice' && this.choicePick != null) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b87e57e-7fca-41be-96f0-a551537f36e2-61","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"props\\.push|spawnProp|tag:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4016,"output_tokens":713,"cache_read_input_tokens":112768,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"82a103b9-9456-4ee5-8958-ae968037092f"}
