{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_149","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"resetDynamic calls spawnTown, which pushes more props every time.\n\nresetDynamic should clear props before calling spawnTown to prevent duplication. spawnTown also stacks meshes with addBlock each time. Duplicate props could make destroy steps finish too early or require more kills.\n\nDuplicate fuel tanks would break destroy step counts. The playthrough and attract exit should use separate engines. Props will still be cleared on exit to keep the scene clean. addBlock duplicates are harmless in headless mode.\n\nThe next step is to implement all fixes and write the test files tests/lib.mjs and tests/run.mjs. Fire spread will be measured by igniting a wide line along Z at a known x, then recording the maximum burning cell index versus the start index. Wind direction 0 means head speed is +X.\n\nFlank spread along Z will be slower than head spread. The test will verify audio counts after playMusic and confirm that sound names increment even in headless mode. Each model will be checked with checkModel, recording any failures for later fixes.\n\nA quick model check script will run before the full test suite to catch and fix model issues early. Textures will also be validated. The planned code edits cover weapon switching, giveGun, wantsUse, tryUse, round tick logic, M1 fever, and clearing props in resetDynamic. handleUse behavior for rounds is being reviewed.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"A few mission actions never reach the code that finishes them. I'll wire weapon carry, round use, and the tablet step, then run those paths."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5947ede8-4b52-4446-9320-784390ecb25f-103","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    const slot = gun.slot;\n    const at = this.guns.findIndex((g) => g.slot === slot);\n    if (at >= 0) this.guns[at] = gun;\n    else this.guns.push(gun);\n    this.unlocked.add(id);\n    this.slot = Math.max(0, this.guns.findIndex((g) => g.id === id));","new_string":"    const at = this.guns.findIndex((g) => g.id === id);\n    if (at >= 0) this.guns[at] = gun;\n    else this.guns.push(gun);\n    this.unlocked.add(id);\n    this.slot = Math.max(0, this.guns.findIndex((g) => g.id === id));"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5947ede8-4b52-4446-9320-784390ecb25f-104","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    this.actors.length = 0;","new_string":"    this.actors.length = 0;\n    this.props.length = 0;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5947ede8-4b52-4446-9320-784390ecb25f-105","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    if (bot) return;\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'crouch')) this.crouch = !this.crouch;","new_string":"    if (bot) return;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.guns.length && i < 4; i++) {\n      if (input.consumePress('Digit' + (i + 1))) this.slot = i;\n    }\n    if (input.consumePress('PadTriangle') && this.guns.length > 1) this.slot = (this.slot + 1) % this.guns.length;\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'crouch')) this.crouch = !this.crouch;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5947ede8-4b52-4446-9320-784390ecb25f-106","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    const pressed = consumeAction(input, 'use');\n    const held = heldAction(input, 'use') || input.isDown('KeyE');\n    if (!pressed && !held) {\n      this.holdT.use = 0;\n      return;\n    }","new_string":"    const pressed = consumeAction(input, 'use');\n    const held = heldAction(input, 'use') || input.isDown('KeyE');\n    if (!pressed && !held) {\n      this.holdT.use = 0;\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.round && (pressed || held) && this.round.tryUse(this)) return;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5947ede8-4b52-4446-9320-784390ecb25f-107","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    if (this.round && (this.carrying || this.cases.some((c) => !c.taken && Math.hypot(c.x - p.x, c.z - p.z) < 2.4))) return true;\n    return false;","new_string":"    if (this.round) {\n      const seat = this.round.seat(this.round.me);\n      if (seat && !seat.down) {\n        if (seat.carrying && Math.hypot(this.round.truck.x - p.x, this.round.truck.z - p.z) < 6) return true;\n        if (this.round.seats.some((o) => o.id !== seat.id && o.down && Math.hypot(o.x - p.x, o.z - p.z) < 3)) return true;\n        if (!seat.carrying && this.round.cases.some((c) => !c.taken && c.carrier == null && Math.hypot(c.x - p.x, c.z - p.z) < 2.6)) return true;\n      }\n    }\n    return false;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5947ede8-4b52-4446-9320-784390ecb25f-108","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    if (this.round && pressed) {\n      if (this.round.tryUse(this)) return;\n    }\n    if (step && step.do === 'use') {","new_string":"    if (step && step.do === 'use') {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5947ede8-4b52-4446-9320-784390ecb25f-109","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__2