{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-98921169-d6df-43b1-9b97-1685a6d84dd2-119","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"268→    if (ok) this.saves += 1;\\n    return ok;\\n270→  }\\n\\n  load() {\\n    const data = readSave();\\n    if (!data || !this.world) return false;\\n    this.world.hp = data.hp ?? 100;\\n    this.world.stones = data.stones ?? 0;\\n    this.world.tablets = data.tablets ?? 0;\\n    this.world.syrettes = data.syrettes ?? 0;\\n    this.world.hour = data.hour ?? 9;\\n280→    this.world.gameHours = this.world.hour;\\n    this.world.flags = new Set(data.flags || []);\\n    this.world.sheet = data.sheet || null;\\n    if (data.ledger) this.world.ledger = { ...this.world.ledger, ...data.ledger };\\n    if (data.fire) this.world.fire.decode(data.fire);\\n    this.world.teleport(data.x || 0, data.z || 40);\\n    this.mode = 'play';\\n    this.screen = 'play';\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n    return true;\\n290→  }\\n\\n  storeSettings() {\\n    writeSettings({ volumes: this.volumes, glyphSet: this.glyphSet, invertY: this.look.invertY, sensX: this.look.sensX });\\n  }\\n\\n  items() {\\n    if (this.touchGate && (this.screen === 'title' || this.screen === 'menu')) return [{ id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }];\\n    if (this.screen === 'title') return [{ id: 'menu', label: 'PRESS TO START' }];\\n    if (this.screen === 'menu') {\\n300→      const rows = [];\\n      if (readSave()) rows.push({ id: 'continue', label: 'CONTINUE' });\\n      rows.push({ id: 'new', label: 'NEW GAME' }, { id: 'cash', label: 'CASH RUN' }, { id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }, { id: 'about', label: 'ABOUT AND CREDITS' });\",\"content_concise\":\"268→    if (ok) this.saves += 1;\\n    return ok;\\n270→  }\\n\\n  load() {\\n    const data = readSave();\\n    if (!data || !this.world) return false;\\n    this.world.hp = data.hp ?? 100;\\n    this.world.stones = data.stones ?? 0;\\n    this.world.tablets = data.tablets ?? 0;\\n    this.world.syrettes = data.syrettes ?? 0;\\n    this.world.hour = data.hour ?? 9;\\n280→    this.world.gameHours = this.world.hour;\\n    this.world.flags = new Set(data.flags || []);\\n    this.world.sheet = data.sheet || null;\\n    if (data.ledger) this.world.ledger = { ...this.world.ledger, ...data.ledger };\\n    if (data.fire) this.world.fire.decode(data.fire);\\n    this.world.teleport(data.x || 0, data.z || 40);\\n    this.mode = 'play';\\n    this.screen = 'play';\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n    return true;\\n290→  }\\n\\n  storeSettings() {\\n    writeSettings({ volumes: this.volumes, glyphSet: this.glyphSet, invertY: this.look.invertY, sensX: this.look.sensX });\\n  }\\n\\n  items() {\\n    if (this.touchGate && (this.screen === 'title' || this.screen === 'menu')) return [{ id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }];\\n    if (this.screen === 'title') return [{ id: 'menu', label: 'PRESS TO START' }];\\n    if (this.screen === 'menu') {\\n300→      const rows = [];\\n      if (readSave()) rows.push({ id: 'continue', label: 'CONTINUE' });\\n      rows.push({ id: 'new', label: 'NEW GAME' }, { id: 'cash', label: 'CASH RUN' }, { id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }, { id: 'about', label: 'ABOUT AND CREDITS' });\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js\",\"offset\":268,\"limit\":35,\"raw_output\":\"    if (ok) this.saves += 1;\\n    return ok;\\n  }\\n\\n  load() {\\n    const data = readSave();\\n    if (!data || !this.world) return false;\\n    this.world.hp = data.hp ?? 100;\\n    this.world.stones = data.stones ?? 0;\\n    this.world.tablets = data.tablets ?? 0;\\n    this.world.syrettes = data.syrettes ?? 0;\\n    this.world.hour = data.hour ?? 9;\\n    this.world.gameHours = this.world.hour;\\n    this.world.flags = new Set(data.flags || []);\\n    this.world.sheet = data.sheet || null;\\n    if (data.ledger) this.world.ledger = { ...this.world.ledger, ...data.ledger };\\n    if (data.fire) this.world.fire.decode(data.fire);\\n    this.world.teleport(data.x || 0, data.z || 40);\\n    this.mode = 'play';\\n    this.screen = 'play';\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  storeSettings() {\\n    writeSettings({ volumes: this.volumes, glyphSet: this.glyphSet, invertY: this.look.invertY, sensX: this.look.sensX });\\n  }\\n\\n  items() {\\n    if (this.touchGate && (this.screen === 'title' || this.screen === 'menu')) return [{ id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }];\\n    if (this.screen === 'title') return [{ id: 'menu', label: 'PRESS TO START' }];\\n    if (this.screen === 'menu') {\\n      const rows = [];\\n      if (readSave()) rows.push({ id: 'continue', label: 'CONTINUE' });\\n      rows.push({ id: 'new', label: 'NEW GAME' }, { id: 'cash', label: 'CASH RUN' }, { id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }, { id: 'about', label: 'ABOUT AND CREDITS' });\\n\",\"total_lines\":740}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"3c952589-723f-402b-ad54-233b26e90c0e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_157","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only settings are being touched.\n\nTesting touch-to-settings behavior. Title attract mode persists with coarse touch input. Headless mode requires explicit touch-only setup. The test expects tapping to open Settings.\n\nA tap during attract mode exits to the title screen. Another tap on the settings row then opens Settings.\n\nCalculating NDC coordinates to simulate a tap on the settings row in headless mode. Keyboard navigation from the title screen will also be tested without mouse input. Now writing the test file.\n\nA single test file is simpler than splitting into runner and suite modules. The solo round test will verify stone pickup and deposit at the truck. Optional save state decoding via fire.decode is also under consideration.\n\nDesigning the friendly fire and revive tests. Friendly fire will test shooting a mercenary. Revive will test downing a mercenary, teleporting nearby, and holding E for three seconds.\n\nFor the drop test, hurting the player to zero triggers noteDown. The case drops at the seat position. The test asserts the case carrier is null and the case is not taken. Then it emits time-up to end the session and verify standings.\n\nThe revive test will use a real tractor shot to down the mercenary. The player must teleport near the target and fire before the three AI allies arrive, since they will otherwise steal the case.\n\nCase pickup is instant, so the AI's 3.2 m/s speed is not a concern. The friendly fire test will assert that mercenary health drops after being shot. Standings are arrays of arrays. startSolo replaces any existing session and begins the round, and CashRound clears world.mission. The test sequence runs playthrough, then round, then attract; resetDynamic may clear the round.\n\nAttract mode must run before the solo round to avoid tick conflicts, since resetDynamic does not clear world.round. The test will exit attract via toTitle() first, then startSolo. For the attract loop test, twenty seconds of stepping is sufficient to cover a couple beats without cheating.\n\nThe attract loop test will step 70 seconds to verify a full 64-second wrap. God mode keeps the player alive during this test. Audio is already fixed and will not throw. The runner will print only failures and a summary line, omitting passing tests. The file will be written in compact style and checked with node --check.\n\nThe runner will print a final pass and fail count. Debug logging is reserved for temporary use only. Tests throw descriptive errors, and dialogue files may be read if line assertions fail. The choice confirmation flow was verified: pressing Enter sets the pick before tickMission runs in the same frame.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-60e7c8f2-5370-489e-94b1-57f9359081d4-120","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/dialogue.js","limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":623,"output_tokens":1597,"cache_read_input_tokens":179456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"3f7c2e64-ff96-4332-a614-7b0fa33eacd2"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-60e7c8f2-5370-489e-94b1-57f9359081d4-120","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Spoken lines. Each fits the HUD font and stays at or under 60 characters. */\\nexport const LINES = {\\n  'bakr:m0.1': 'FORTY MILES OF TRACK AND NOT ONE STATION',\\n  'bakr:m0.2': 'THAT REMEMBERS ITS NAME.',\\n  'bakr:m0.3': 'THEY PAINT THE SIGNS OVER. WHOEVER WON LAST.',\\n  'bakr:m0.4': 'YOU HAVE THE LOOK OF A MAN WHO READ ABOUT THIS PLACE.',\\n  'bakr:m0.5': 'READING IS A GOOD WAY TO VISIT.',\\n  'bakr:m0.6': 'UP THERE THEY WILL ASK YOU WHICH SIDE. SAY YES.',\\n  'bakr:halt': 'THIS HALT USED TO HAVE A LONGER NAME.',\\n10→  'odile:m1.1': 'THREE TABLETS. THE FOURTH YOU PAY FOR.',\\n  'odile:m1.2': 'I DO NOT MEAN IN STONES.',\\n  'odile:m1.3': 'I DO NOT NEED YOU TO BE GOOD. I NEED YOU TO BE ON TIME.',\\n  'odile:m1.4': 'SIXTY-ONE BEDS. FORTY BLANKETS. YOU ARE THE MATH.',\\n  'odile:refuse': 'COME BACK WHEN THE WELLS HAVE WATER. I AM COUNTING.',\\n  'odile:m8.1': 'GET THEM ON THE TRAIN. COUNT THE ONES WHO MAKE IT.',\\n  'vance:m3.1': 'WE DO NOT BURN VILLAGES. WE CONCLUDE THEM.',\\n  'vance:m3.2': 'THE DEPOT IS A REGRETTABLE MATTER. CONCLUDE IT.',\\n  'vance:m5.1': 'THE WATER QUESTION HAS BEEN A GREAT SORROW TO THIS OFFICE.',\\n  'vance:m5.2': 'YOUR INVOICE WILL BE HONOURED, REGRETTABLY.',\\n20→  'vance:pay': 'THE MATTER IS CLOSED. THE INVOICE WILL FOLLOW.',\\n  'ansa:m4.1': 'YOU SAID LESS PEOPLE. FEWER. FEWER PEOPLE.',\\n  'ansa:m4.2': 'IT WILL MATTER BY THE END OF THE MONTH.',\\n  'ansa:m6.1': 'BURN THE FIELD. A HUNGRY MAN LEARNS TO READ THE WIND.',\\n  'ansa:pay': 'THE GRAMMAR WAS THE LEAST OF IT. TAKE THE STONES.',\\n  'tibor:shop': 'EVERYTHING ON THIS RACK HAS BEEN RETURNED AT LEAST ONCE.',\\n  'tibor:price': 'IT FIRES. IF YOU WANT IT TO FIRE TWICE, THAT IS A DIFFERENT PRICE.',\\n  'tibor:m2.1': 'SHE OWES ME A PLANE. I OWE HER A KEY. FETCH HER.',\\n  'ines:meet': 'I FLEW FOR BOTH OF THEM. NEITHER PAID. GET IN.',\\n  'ines:owe': 'YOU OWE ME A TRUCK. YOU OWE ME SEVERAL TRUCKS.',\\n30→  'ines:m3': 'TAKE THE TANKER AT THE EAST POST AND DRIVE IT IN.',\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Spoken lines. Each fits the HUD font and stays at or under 60 characters. */\\nexport const LINES = {\\n  'bakr:m0.1': 'FORTY MILES OF TRACK AND NOT ONE STATION',\\n  'bakr:m0.2': 'THAT REMEMBERS ITS NAME.',\\n  'bakr:m0.3': 'THEY PAINT THE SIGNS OVER. WHOEVER WON LAST.',\\n  'bakr:m0.4': 'YOU HAVE THE LOOK OF A MAN WHO READ ABOUT THIS PLACE.',\\n  'bakr:m0.5': 'READING IS A GOOD WAY TO VISIT.',\\n  'bakr:m0.6': 'UP THERE THEY WILL ASK YOU WHICH SIDE. SAY YES.',\\n  'bakr:halt': 'THIS HALT USED TO HAVE A LONGER NAME.',\\n10→  'odile:m1.1': 'THREE TABLETS. THE FOURTH YOU PAY FOR.',\\n  'odile:m1.2': 'I DO NOT MEAN IN STONES.',\\n  'odile:m1.3': 'I DO NOT NEED YOU TO BE GOOD. I NEED YOU TO BE ON TIME.',\\n  'odile:m1.4': 'SIXTY-ONE BEDS. FORTY BLANKETS. YOU ARE THE MATH.',\\n  'odile:refuse': 'COME BACK WHEN THE WELLS HAVE WATER. I AM COUNTING.',\\n  'odile:m8.1': 'GET THEM ON THE TRAIN. COUNT THE ONES WHO MAKE IT.',\\n  'vance:m3.1': 'WE DO NOT BURN VILLAGES. WE CONCLUDE THEM.',\\n  'vance:m3.2': 'THE DEPOT IS A REGRETTABLE MATTER. CONCLUDE IT.',\\n  'vance:m5.1': 'THE WATER QUESTION HAS BEEN A GREAT SORROW TO THIS OFFICE.',\\n  'vance:m5.2': 'YOUR INVOICE WILL BE HONOURED, REGRETTABLY.',\\n20→  'vance:pay': 'THE MATTER IS CLOSED. THE INVOICE WILL FOLLOW.',\\n  'ansa:m4.1': 'YOU SAID LESS PEOPLE. FEWER. FEWER PEOPLE.',\\n  'ansa:m4.2': 'IT WILL MATTER BY THE END OF THE MONTH.',\\n  'ansa:m6.1': 'BURN THE FIELD. A HUNGRY MAN LEARNS TO READ THE WIND.',\\n  'ansa:pay': 'THE GRAMMAR WAS THE LEAST OF IT. TAKE THE STONES.',\\n  'tibor:shop': 'EVERYTHING ON THIS RACK HAS BEEN RETURNED AT LEAST ONCE.',\\n  'tibor:price': 'IT FIRES. IF YOU WANT IT TO FIRE TWICE, THAT IS A DIFFERENT PRICE.',\\n  'tibor:m2.1': 'SHE OWES ME A PLANE. I OWE HER A KEY. FETCH HER.',\