{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_173","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cursor moved past the assertion, but the waypoint was not set.\n\nThe map waypoint check runs after buddy and round checks. KeyE may be getting consumed by those earlier checks instead of picking the waypoint.\n\nThe map stays open after KeyM is released. The cursor starts at the player position when the map opens. After driving, it moved roughly 3.6 meters. No site was within 18 meters of that new position, so pickWaypoint found nothing.\n\nThe map cursor was locked to the player position when the map opened. After 20 frames of driving and a 14-meter pan, the cursor sits roughly 20 meters from the clinic. That exceeds the 18-meter pickup radius, so pickWaypoint finds nothing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dfc91471-323b-4b2e-a059-ebf4e263ee41-140","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  engine.input.setPointer(0.05, -0.04, false);","new_string":"  engine.input.setPointer(0.02, -0.01, false);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":498,"output_tokens":734,"cache_read_input_tokens":204160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"9b4063b1-13b0-481b-afe0-9c1d3cf9fc76"}
