{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_185","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The report failed because the player was at the clinic when KeyE did not complete.\n\nThe hero is likely stuck in the vehicle after repair. The mission logic requires being in the vehicle with full health to tap KeyE, but tryUse returns early during the repair hold.\n\nThe hero exits the vehicle after repair and remains on foot. The report still fails, so dialogue lines may be blocking the mission. tickPlayer might return early when lines are present.\n\nThe map is not blocking because the process is fresh. The hero may still be in the vehicle after driving, since goTo sets camera yaw and KeyW. Also checking whether consumeAction sees KeyE differently than tap.\n\nThe drive step completed successfully, so the hero reached the repair point on foot. The failure occurs during the report phase after repair.\n\nThe truck might remain at the west road after repair while the player teleports to the clinic. If so, the hero would still be next to the truck and in the vehicle when report starts. The playMission logic requires the hero to be in the vehicle with full health to tap KeyE. This would explain why KeyE never completes.\n\nThe hero likely exits the vehicle after repair. The holdKey logic releases KeyE before the enter-vehicle check, so the hero remains on foot. The report still fails, suggesting dialogue lines block the entire tickPlayer cycle and prevent use input.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b86a4f16-3333-43f5-a998-0e1c3b668f42-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":380,"limit":280}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b86a4f16-3333-43f5-a998-0e1c3b668f42-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.