{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_187","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Noted that m1 does not start with lines, but tickPlayer returns early if lines.length is truthy.\n\nChecking where lines get set. announceStep only sets them for 'lines' steps. m0 empties its lines array before completion. Now checking if applySetup or later steps leave lines behind.\n\nThe player died during the drive and was rescued at the clinic teleport. KeyE failed to complete because lines were still active, blocking step advancement. Now searching for what triggers lines during m1, possibly area entry dialogue.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-33bcd5bc-1f2f-4c8e-a6f9-3e5668c12b35-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"this\\.lines","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2393,"output_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":59776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"42372f66-43f9-4560-a4ea-c0d669a4f250"}
