{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_188","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"applySetup clears lines 243 and 361.\n\nKeyE failed to complete the step. The player was at the teleport position 12,56. The error fired after the action because the step index did not change. This suggests teleport may not move feet immediately.\n\nA prior syrette step likely killed the player by dealing 30 damage when health was already low. This left them dead, which blocks KeyE input via tickPlayer's early return.\n\nThe player survived the syrette step and completed it. The failure occurs at the clinic during the report step, so the cause is being traced inside tryUse.\n\nThe clinic spawn point is 12,55. If the truck is within 8 meters of that location, KeyE triggers the vehicle entry logic instead of the report step. The truck's spawn position in applySetup needs to be checked.\n\nThe player walks to the west road without pressing E, so the truck stays at its spawn near the clinic. The repair step then resets the truck to the player's feet, moving it to the west road area.\n\nThe truck is now at the west road, so it should be far from the clinic. KeyE should reach the report branch. The hero is only one meter from the clinic. But if the player is inside the vehicle, feet() might return the truck position instead of the hero's.\n\nThe error position 12,56 confirms the hero is at the clinic, not inside the truck. This means the truck was likely also at the clinic. The drive step requires walking 400 meters at roughly five meters per second, which takes about eighty seconds.\n\nThe drive step completed successfully. The jam step is now being examined. It holds fire for eighty frames then uses KeyR. The player may have died from the jam damage and survived to use syrette. The syrette completion logic is being checked.\n\nThe syrette step completes even if the player dies during its hold. The player likely took fire damage, soldier damage, or a fever collapse while driving across the map. This left them near death when the syrette struck. They survived to use it, but died before reaching the report step. The teleport to the clinic still worked because it ignores death. Then tickPlayer returned early and blocked KeyE input.\n\nThe mission setup sets feverIn to zero, so the fever timer starts at zero and turns on immediately. The tablet step holds KeyH for ninety frames to clear the fever for five seconds. During the long drive across the map, the fever returns after twenty-five seconds. If the player does not take a tablet, they collapse, which sets their health to at least thirty and teleports them to the safehouse.\n\nA collapse during the drive teleports the player to the nearest safehouse, which is the clinic itself. The goTo routine continues from there, so repeated collapses could eventually drain stones but would not kill the player. Soldier fire and fire damage are also considered as possible causes of low health.\n\nThe repair step triggers announceStep, which calls hurt(30) before the syrette hold begins. If that damage drops health below thirty, the player dies before KeyQ registers. The tickPlayer early return would then block the step completion. The hurt function and syrette healing code need to be checked.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e389a44-6c0f-4533-af6f-f951eecd490c-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":860,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e389a44-6c0f-4533-af6f-f951eecd490c-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hurt\\(|this\\.dead|teleport\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":761,"output_tokens":2018,"cache_read_input_tokens":62080,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"d9a21c32-f304-4604-85f1-d61d2fd0f7de"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4e389a44-6c0f-4533-af6f-f951eecd490c-21","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"860→        const t = this.car.body.translation();\\n        this.fire.ignite(t.x, t.z, 6);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  readNeeds(dt, input, bot) {\\n    if (bot) return;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.guns.length && i < 4; i++) {\\n      if (input.consumePress('Digit' + (i + 1))) this.slot = i;\\n870→    }\\n    if (input.consumePress('PadTriangle') && this.guns.length > 1) this.slot = (this.slot + 1) % this.guns.length;\\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'crouch')) this.crouch = !this.crouch;\\n    if (input.consumePress('CapsLock')) this.walk = !this.walk;\\n    this.sprint = heldAction(input, 'sprint') || input.isDown('ShiftLeft');\\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'map')) {\\n      this.map.up = !this.map.up;\\n      if (this.map.up) {\\n        const p = this.feet();\\n        this.map.cx = p.x;\\n880→        this.map.cz = p.z;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (this.map.up) this.map.anim = Math.min(1, this.map.anim + dt / 0.4);\\n    else this.map.anim = Math.max(0, this.map.anim - dt / 0.4);\\n    if (this.feverOn && (heldAction(input, 'tablet') || input.isDown('KeyH'))) {\\n      this.holdT.tablet += dt;\\n      if (this.holdT.tablet >= 1 && this.tablets > 0) {\\n        this.tablets -= 1;\\n        this.feverClear = 5;\\n890→        this.holdT.tablet = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'tablet') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.tablet = 0;\\n    const healHeld = heldAction(input, 'heal') || input.isDown('KeyQ');\\n    if (this.hp < 20 && this.hp > 0 && consumeAction(input, 'heal')) {\\n      this.surgeryT = 4;\\n      this.subtitle = this.lastHurt === 'fire' ? 'THE LIGHTER' : 'HOLD STILL.';\\n    } else if (healHeld && this.syrettes > 0 && this.hp >= 20) {\\n      this.holdT.heal += dt;\\n900→      if (this.holdT.heal >= 0.8) {\\n        this.syrettes -= 1;\\n        this.hp = Math.min(100, this.hp + 40);\\n        this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'syrette') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  combat(dt, input) {\\n910→    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (gun) gun.cooldown = Math.max(0, gun.cooldown - dt);\\n    const want = heldAction(input, 'fire') || input.isDown('MouseLeft');\\n    const tap = consumeAction(input, 'fire');\\n    if (!gun || this.sprint) return;\\n    const def = WEAPON_BY_ID[gun.id];\\n    const auto = !!(def && def.auto);\\n    if (!(auto ? want : tap)) return;\\n    if (gun.cooldown > 0) return;\\n    if (this.inTown(this.feet().x, this.feet().z) && this.truce) return;\\n920→    if (gun.jammed) {\\n      this.prompt = 'JAMMED';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (gun.magSize > 0 && gun.mag <= 0) return;\\n    this.fireGun(gun, def);\\n  }\\n\\n  fireGun(gun, def) {\\n    const rate = def.rate || 1;\\n930→    gun.cooldown = 1 / rate;\\n    if (!this.infAmmo && gun.magSize > 0) gun.mag -= 1;\\n    gun.shots += 1;\\n    this.shotCount += 1;\\n    const wear = (def.wear || 0) * TUNING.wearRate * (this.upgrades.has('clean') ? 0.6 : 1);\\n    gun.cond = Math.max(0, gun.cond - wear);\\n    if (gun.cond <= 0) {\\n      this.breakGun();\\n      return;\\n    }\",\"content_concise\":\"860→        const t = this.car.body.translation();\\n        this.fire.ignite(t.x, t.z, 6);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  readNeeds(dt, input, bot) {\\n    if (bot) return;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.guns.length && i < 4; i++) {\\n      if (input.consumePress('Digit' + (i + 1))) this.slot = i;\\n870→    }\\n    if (input.consumePress('PadTriangle') && this.guns.length > 1) this.slot = (this.slot + 1) % this.guns.length;\\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'crouch')) this.crouch = !this.crouch;\\n    if (input.consumePress('CapsLock')) this.walk = !this.walk;\\n    this.sprint = heldAction(input, 'sprint') || input.isDown('ShiftLeft');\\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'map')) {\\n      this.map.up = !this.map.up;\\n      if (this.map.up) {\\n        const p = this.feet();\\n        this.map.cx = p.x;\\n880→        this.map.cz = p.z;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (this.map.up) this.map.anim = Math.min(1, this.map.anim + dt / 0.4);\\n    else this.map.anim = Math.max(0, this.map.anim - dt / 0.4);\\n    if (this.feverOn && (heldAction(input, 'tablet') || input.isDown('KeyH'))) {\\n      this.holdT.tablet += dt;\\n      if (this.holdT.tablet >= 1 && this.tablets > 0) {\\n        this.tablets -= 1;\\n        this.feverClear = 5;\\n890→        this.holdT.tablet = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'tablet') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.tablet = 0;\\n    const healHeld = heldAction(input, 'heal') || input.isDown('KeyQ');\\n    if (this.hp < 20 && this.hp > 0 && consumeAction(input, 'heal')) {\\n      this.surgeryT = 4;\\n      this.subtitle = this.lastHurt === 'fire' ? 'THE LIGHTER' : 'HOLD STILL.';\\n    } else if (healHeld && this.syrettes > 0 && this.hp >= 20) {\\n      this.holdT.heal += dt;\\n900→      if (this.holdT.heal >= 0.8) {\\n        this.syrettes -= 1;\\n        this.hp = Math.min(100, this.hp + 40);\\n        this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'syrette') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  combat(dt, input) {\\n910→    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (gun) gun.cooldown = Math.max(0, gun.cooldown - dt);\\n    const want = heldAction(input, 'fire') || input.isDown('MouseLeft');\\n    const tap = consumeAction(input, 'fire');\\n    if (!gun || this.sprint) return;\\n    const def = WEAPON_BY_ID[gun.id];\\n    const auto = !!(def && def.auto);\\n    if (!(auto ? want : tap)) return;\\n    if (gun.cooldown > 0) return;\\n    if (this.inTown(this.feet().x, this.feet().z) && this.truce) return;\\n920→    if (gun.jammed) {\\n      this.prompt = 'JAMMED';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (gun.magSize > 0 && gun.mag <= 0) return;\\n    this.fireGun(gun, def);\\n  }\\n\\n  fireGun(gun, def) {\\n    const rate = def.rate || 1;\\n930→    gun.cooldown = 1 / rate;\\n    if (!this.infAmmo && gun.magSize > 0) gun.mag -= 1;\\n    gun.shots += 1;\\n    this.shotCount += 1;\\n    const wear = (def.wear || 0) * TUNING.wearRate * (this.upgrades.has('clean') ? 0.6 : 1);\\n    gun.cond = Math.max(0, gun.cond - wear);\\n    if (gun.cond <= 0) {\\n      this.breakGun();\\n      return;\\n    }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js\",\"offset\":860,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"        const t = this.car.body.translation();\\n        this.fire.ignite(t.x, t.z, 6);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  readNeeds(dt, input, bot) {\\n    if (bot) return;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.guns.length && i < 4; i++) {\\n      if (input.consumePress('Digit' + (i + 1))) this.slot = i;\\n    }\\n    if (input.consumePress('PadTriangle') && this.guns.length > 1) this.slot = (this.slot + 1) % this.guns.length;\\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'crouch')) this.crouch = !this.crouch;\\n    if (input.consumePress('CapsLock')) this.walk = !this.walk;\\n    this.sprint = heldAction(input, 'sprint') || input.isDown('ShiftLeft');\\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'map')) {\\n      this.map.up = !this.map.up;\\n      if (this.map.up) {\\n        const p = this.feet();\\n        this.map.cx = p.x;\\n        this.map.cz = p.z;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (this.map.up) this.map.anim = Math.min(1, this.map.anim + dt / 0.4);\\n    else this.map.anim = Math.max(0, this.map.anim - dt / 0.4);\\n    if (this.feverOn && (heldAction(input, 'tablet') || input.isDown('KeyH'))) {\\n      this.holdT.tablet += dt;\\n      if (this.holdT.tablet >= 1 && this.tablets > 0) {\\n        this.tablets -= 1;\\n        this.feverClear = 5;\\n        this.holdT.tablet = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'tablet') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.tablet = 0;\\n    const healHeld = heldAction(input, 'heal') || input.isDown('KeyQ');\\n    if (this.hp < 20 && this.hp > 0 && consumeAction(input, 'heal')) {\\n      this.surgeryT = 4;\\n      this.subtitle = this.lastHurt === 'fire' ? 'THE LIGHTER' : 'HOLD STILL.';\\n    } else if (healHeld && this.syrettes > 0 && this.hp >= 20) {\\n      this.holdT.heal += dt;\\n      if (this.holdT.heal >= 0.8) {\\n        this.syrettes -= 1;\\n        this.hp = Math.min(100, this.hp + 40);\\n        this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'syrette') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  combat(dt, input) {\\n    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (gun) gun.cooldown = Math.max(0, gun.cooldown - dt);\\n    const want = heldAction(input, 'fire') || input.isDown('MouseLeft');\\n    const tap = consumeAction(input, 'fire');\\n    if (!gun || this.sprint) return;\\n    const def = WEAPON_BY_ID[gun.id];\\n    const auto = !!(def && def.auto);\\n    if (!(auto ? want : tap)) return;\\n    if (gun.cooldown > 0) return;\\n    if (this.inTown(this.feet().x, this.feet().z) && this.truce) return;\\n    if (gun.jammed) {\\n      this.prompt = 'JAMMED';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (gun.magSize > 0 && gun.mag <= 0) return;\\n    this.fireGun(gun, def);\\n  }\\n\\n  fireGun(gun, def) {\\n    const rate = def.rate || 1;\\n    gun.cooldown = 1 / rate;\\n    if (!this.infAmmo && gun.magSize > 0) gun.mag -= 1;\\n    gun.shots += 1;\\n    this.shotCount += 1;\\n    const wear = (def.wear || 0) * TUNING.wearRate * (this.upgrades.has('clean') ? 0.6 : 1);\\n    gun.cond = Math.max(0, gun.cond - wear);\\n    if (gun.cond <= 0) {\\n      this.breakGun();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\",\"total_lines\":1359}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4e389a44-6c0f-4533-af6f-f951eecd490c-22","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,