{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_189","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Syrette requires at least 20 HP and zero hold.\n\nannounceStep deals 30 damage before the hold, so Syrette should still work at 70 HP. Report at clinic fails. Checking feet() and vehicle status there. tryUse skips _reported and completes directly when distance is under 16. Verifying whether tap() key presses register before consumeAny.\n\ntap() key presses register correctly before consumeAny. The map test confirms KeyE enters the truck at mission start because the spawn point is within 8m of the clinic. At report time, the code enters the vehicle if the truck is near and HP is at least 50, skipping the report check entirely. The question is when the truck is actually within 8m of the clinic during reporting.\n\nRepair resets the truck to the player's feet. After driving to -260, 240 and then -200, 30, the player should be near -200, 30 while the truck stays there. Report teleports the player back to the clinic, leaving the truck at -200, 30. The truck should not be near the clinic during reporting. The only remaining explanation is that the drive goTo never moved the player far enough.\n\nThe drive completion radius is 28 meters. The player might be arriving at the destination incorrectly while inside the vehicle, or entering the truck by accident.\n\nThe map stays open from the previous mission. KeyE on the open map triggers waypoint picking instead of reporting. The report step is never reached.\n\nThe test leaves the map open after the map step, which prevents KeyE from reporting. The fix is to lower the map in the playMission helper by tapping KeyM again after raising it. A single tap toggles the map up and completes the step, so a second tap is needed to close it.\n\nRepair worked because its first frame is a press that the open map intercepts, but it holds afterward so repair proceeds. Report needs a press, which the map blocks. Closing the map fixes all use and collect steps too. The test should close the map rather than changing the game.\n\nThe map stays open because the map block does not return early during movement. The drive step uses goTo, which walks the player rather than driving. I will fix the test and check for other stuck points before re-running.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88f43c50-c315-4896-9e23-731ffdce3cb7-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":200,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88f43c50-c315-4896-9e23-731ffdce3cb7-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":980,"limit":100}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3818,"output_tokens":3261,"cache_read_input_tokens":62720,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"5154be8a-a947-487b-a564-5b27ddc079b5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-88f43c50-c315-4896-9e23-731ffdce3cb7-23","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→\\n  refreshMap() {\\n    const fire = this.fire;\\n    if (this.scarTick === this._scarDrawn) {\\n      const p = this.feet();\\n      this.stamp(p.x, p.z, 240, 240, 240);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this._scarDrawn = this.scarTick;\\n    for (const i of fire.burntList) {\\n210→      const ix = i % 256;\\n      const iz = (i / 256) | 0;\\n      const [x, z] = fire.center(ix, iz);\\n      this.stamp(x, z, 30, 28, 36);\\n    }\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    this.stamp(p.x, p.z, 240, 240, 240);\\n  }\\n\\n  mapHasScar() {\\n220→    for (let i = 0; i < this.mapPx.length; i += 4) {\\n      if (this.mapPx[i] < 40 && this.mapPx[i + 1] < 40 && this.mapPx[i + 2] < 50 && this.mapPx[i + 3] > 0) return true;\\n    }\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  markSeen() {\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    for (const s of SITES) if (Math.hypot(s.x - p.x, s.z - p.z) < 90) this.seen.add(s.id);\\n  }\\n230→\\n  resetDynamic() {\\n    this.fire.extinguish();\\n    this.fire.state.fill(0);\\n    this.fire.burning.length = 0;\\n    this.fire.burntList.length = 0;\\n    this.fire.burntCount = 0;\\n    this.actors.length = 0;\\n    this.props.length = 0;\\n    this.dead = false;\\n240→    this.carrying = null;\\n    this.inVehicle = false;\\n    this.mission = null;\\n    this.lines = [];\\n    this.choice = null;\\n    this.subtitle = '';\\n    this.feverOn = false;\\n    this.surgeryT = 0;\\n    this.rescueT = 0;\\n    this.ending = null;\\n250→    this.sheet = null;\\n    this.spawnTown();\\n  }\\n\\n  teleport(x, z) {\\n    const y = this.ground(x, z) + 0.1;\\n    if (this.inVehicle && this.car) this.car.reset([x, y + 1, z], this.car.yaw);\\n    else this.hero.teleport([x, y, z]);\\n    this.markSeen();\\n  }\\n260→\\n  giveGun(id, cond) {\\n    const gun = freshWeapon(id, cond);\\n    if (!gun) return;\\n    if (this.upgrades.has('belt') && gun.reserve) gun.reserve = Math.round(gun.reserve * 1.5);\\n    const at = this.guns.findIndex((g) => g.id === id);\\n    if (at >= 0) this.guns[at] = gun;\\n    else this.guns.push(gun);\\n    this.unlocked.add(id);\\n    this.slot = Math.max(0, this.guns.findIndex((g) => g.id === id));\\n270→  }\\n\\n  get weapon() {\\n    return this.guns[this.slot] || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  hurt(amount, kind = 'bullet', force = false) {\\n    if (this.dead) return;\\n    if (this.god && !force) return;\\n    const d = amount * TUNING.playerDamageTaken;\\n280→    this.hp = Math.max(0, this.hp - d);\\n    this.lastHurt = kind;\\n    this.regenT = 5;\\n    this.surgeryT = 0;\\n    if (this.hp <= 0) this.down();\\n  }\\n\\n  down() {\\n    if (this.round) {\\n      this.round.noteDown();\\n290→      return;\\n    }\\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && !b.down && (b.spentUntil || 0) <= this.clock);\\n    if (buddy) {\\n      this.rescueT = 2.2;\\n      this.rescueBuddy = buddy;\\n      this.subtitle = line('buddy:rescue');\\n      this.speaker = buddy.name;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n300→    this.dead = true;\\n    this.subtitle = line('death');\\n    this.game.onDeath();\\n  }\\n\\n  pay(amount) {\\n    const n = Math.round(amount * TUNING.stonesReward);\\n    this.stones += n;\\n    this.ledger.stonesEarned += n;\\n  }\\n310→\\n  applySetup(setup, deadIds = []) {\\n    this.flags = new Set(setup.flags || []);\\n    this.safehouses = new Set(setup.safehouses || []);\\n    this.stones = setup.stones ?? 0;\\n    this.tablets = setup.tablets ?? 0;\\n    this.syrettes = setup.syrettes ?? 3;\\n    this.hour = setup.hour ?? 9;\\n    this.gameHours = this.hour;\\n    this.truce = setup.truce !== false;\\n320→    this.column = !!setup.column;\\n    this.tracker = !!setup.tracker;\\n    this.hp = 100;\\n    this.dead = false;\\n    this.feverOn = false;\\n    this.feverIgnore = 0;\\n    this.feverClear = 0;\\n    this.feverT = setup.feverIn === 0 ? 0 : (TUNING.feverMinutes * 60);\\n    this.guns = [];\\n    for (const g of setup.guns || []) this.giveGun(g.id, g.cond);\\n330→    if (!this.guns.find((g) => g.id === 'cane') && (setup.guns || []).length) this.giveGun('cane', 100);\\n    for (const id of deadIds) {\\n      if (!this.deadBuddies.has(id)) {\\n        this.deadBuddies.add(id);\\n        this.ledger.friends += 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.buddies = [];\\n    const listed = new Set(setup.buddies || []);\\n    for (const id of listed) {\\n340→      const b = this.makeBuddy(id);\\n      if (this.deadBuddies.has(id)) {\\n        b.alive = false;\\n        b.hp = 0;\\n      }\\n      this.buddies.push(b);\\n    }\\n    for (const id of this.deadBuddies) {\\n      if (!listed.has(id)) this.buddies.push({ ...this.makeBuddy(id), alive: false, down: false, hp: 0 });\\n    }\\n350→    this.fire.extinguish();\\n    this.fire.state.fill(0);\\n    this.fire.burning.length = 0;\\n    this.fire.burntList.length = 0;\\n    this.fire.burntCount = 0;\\n    this.paintMapBase();\\n    for (const scar of setup.scars || []) this.layScar(scar);\\n    this.sheet = setup.sheet || null;\\n    this.ending = null;\\n    this.choice = null;\\n360→    this.choicePick = null;\\n    this.lines = [];\\n    this.carrying = null;\\n    this.jamScript = 0;\\n    this.shotCount = 0;\\n    this.movedOnce = false;\\n    this.civilians = 12;\\n    this.provoked = false;\\n    if (setup.truck) this.ensureTruck(setup.x + 6, setup.z);\\n    if (setup.x !== undefined) this.teleport(setup.x, setup.z);\\n370→    this.subtitle = '';\\n  }\\n\\n  makeBuddy(id) {\\n    const d = BUDDY_DEF[id] || { name: id.toUpperCase(), hp: 200 };\\n    return { id, name: d.name, hp: d.hp, max: d.hp, alive: true, down: false, downLeft: 0, trust: 1, spentUntil: 0, wound: false, burning: false };\\n  }\\n\\n  layScar(id) {\\n    const strip = STRIPS[id];\",\"content_concise\":\"200→\\n  refreshMap() {\\n    const fire = this.fire;\\n    