{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_191","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking how flare ignite works. Arc means it might land short.\n\nThe player sits 18m south at higher elevation looking toward the target. The 70m arc flare should land short. Tractor jamming is safe: it breaks after 128 shots, not 5. Convoy health is 80 and tractor damage is 24, so a few hits will destroy it. The player is 4m from the prop facing -Z, within tractor range. One hit destroys fuel tanks even if they still have HP.\n\nCage and ledger positions are confirmed. Teleporting to z+1 places the player one meter away from each target. The fire code for arc weapons is still needed. map.up must be cleared in the test. The truck is six meters from the clinic, so the player will walk over and press E to enter.\n\nThe map must be closed before any use step, because an open map intercepts KeyE as a waypoint. The handler opens the map if needed, then closes it before checking the next step index. During the 26-second fever-fall, the map can remain open; an extra KeyM tap during that period is harmless.\n\nThe map handler taps KeyM twice. The first tap opens the map if it is closed, and the second closes it after the step index changes. For drive steps, the code teleports the player within seven meters of the truck before pressing E to enter.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a449fd17-e7b6-4e7a-b4ce-4b4c4d930571-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":928,"limit":55}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a449fd17-e7b6-4e7a-b4ce-4b4c4d930571-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ignite|arc|blast","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4772,"output_tokens":1095,"cache_read_input_tokens":72832,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"1153e605-2dfc-4adc-b90e-6914bb1ae151"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a449fd17-e7b6-4e7a-b4ce-4b4c4d930571-27","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"928→  fireGun(gun, def) {\\n    const rate = def.rate || 1;\\n930→    gun.cooldown = 1 / rate;\\n    if (!this.infAmmo && gun.magSize > 0) gun.mag -= 1;\\n    gun.shots += 1;\\n    this.shotCount += 1;\\n    const wear = (def.wear || 0) * TUNING.wearRate * (this.upgrades.has('clean') ? 0.6 : 1);\\n    gun.cond = Math.max(0, gun.cond - wear);\\n    if (gun.cond <= 0) {\\n      this.breakGun();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n940→    const jamP = this.noJam ? 0 : TUNING.jamRate * 0.12 * (1 - gun.cond / 100) ** 2;\\n    const script = this.jamScript && gun.shots >= this.jamScript;\\n    if (script || this.rng.next() < jamP) {\\n      gun.jammed = true;\\n      gun.jamLeft = 2 + Math.floor(this.rng.next() * 3);\\n      this.jamScript = 0;\\n    }\\n    this.resolveShot(def);\\n    this.provoked = true;\\n  }\\n950→\\n  breakGun() {\\n    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (!gun) return;\\n    this.guns.splice(this.slot, 1);\\n    this.slot = Math.max(0, this.guns.length - 1);\\n    this.subtitle = 'THE GUN COMES APART.';\\n  }\\n\\n  resolveShot(def) {\\n960→    const p = this.feet();\\n    const yaw = this.ctx.camera.yaw || 0;\\n    const dx = -Math.sin(yaw);\\n    const dz = -Math.cos(yaw);\\n    const range = def.range || 40;\\n    if (def.ignite || def.blast) {\\n      const x = p.x + dx * Math.min(range, 18);\\n      const z = p.z + dz * Math.min(range, 18);\\n      this.fire.ignite(x, z, def.ignite || def.blast || 1);\\n      this.fire.litByPlayer += 1;\\n970→      this.damagePoint(x, z, def.damage * TUNING.weaponDamage, def.blast || 2);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.damageRay(p, dx, dz, range, (def.damage || 10) * TUNING.weaponDamage);\\n  }\\n\\n  damageRay(p, dx, dz, range, dmg) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bd = range;\\n    for (const a of this.actors) {\\n980→      if (!a.alive) continue;\\n      const ox = a.x - p.x;\\n      const oz = a.z - p.z;\",\"content_concise\":\"928→  fireGun(gun, def) {\\n    const rate = def.rate || 1;\\n930→    gun.cooldown = 1 / rate;\\n    if (!this.infAmmo && gun.magSize > 0) gun.mag -= 1;\\n    gun.shots += 1;\\n    this.shotCount += 1;\\n    const wear = (def.wear || 0) * TUNING.wearRate * (this.upgrades.has('clean') ? 0.6 : 1);\\n    gun.cond = Math.max(0, gun.cond - wear);\\n    if (gun.cond <= 0) {\\n      this.breakGun();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n940→    const jamP = this.noJam ? 0 : TUNING.jamRate * 0.12 * (1 - gun.cond / 100) ** 2;\\n    const script = this.jamScript && gun.shots >= this.jamScript;\\n    if (script || this.rng.next() < jamP) {\\n      gun.jammed = true;\\n      gun.jamLeft = 2 + Math.floor(this.rng.next() * 3);\\n      this.jamScript = 0;\\n    }\\n    this.resolveShot(def);\\n    this.provoked = true;\\n  }\\n950→\\n  breakGun() {\\n    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (!gun) return;\\n    this.guns.splice(this.slot, 1);\\n    this.slot = Math.max(0, this.guns.length - 1);\\n    this.subtitle = 'THE GUN COMES APART.';\\n  }\\n\\n  resolveShot(def) {\\n960→    const p = this.feet();\\n    const yaw = this.ctx.camera.yaw || 0;\\n    const dx = -Math.sin(yaw);\\n    const dz = -Math.cos(yaw);\\n    const range = def.range || 40;\\n    if (def.ignite || def.blast) {\\n      const x = p.x + dx * Math.min(range, 18);\\n      const z = p.z + dz * Math.min(range, 18);\\n      this.fire.ignite(x, z, def.ignite || def.blast || 1);\\n      this.fire.litByPlayer += 1;\\n970→      this.damagePoint(x, z, def.damage * TUNING.weaponDamage, def.blast || 2);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.damageRay(p, dx, dz, range, (def.damage || 10) * TUNING.weaponDamage);\\n  }\\n\\n  damageRay(p, dx, dz, range, dmg) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bd = range;\\n    for (const a of this.actors) {\\n980→      if (!a.alive) continue;\\n      const ox = a.x - p.x;\\n      const oz = a.z - p.z;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js\",\"offset\":928,\"limit\":55,\"raw_output\":\"  fireGun(gun, def) {\\n    const rate = def.rate || 1;\\n    gun.cooldown = 1 / rate;\\n    if (!this.infAmmo && gun.magSize > 0) gun.mag -= 1;\\n    gun.shots += 1;\\n    this.shotCount += 1;\\n    const wear = (def.wear || 0) * TUNING.wearRate * (this.upgrades.has('clean') ? 0.6 : 1);\\n    gun.cond = Math.max(0, gun.cond - wear);\\n    if (gun.cond <= 0) {\\n      this.breakGun();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const jamP = this.noJam ? 0 : TUNING.jamRate * 0.12 * (1 - gun.cond / 100) ** 2;\\n    const script = this.jamScript && gun.shots >= this.jamScript;\\n    if (script || this.rng.next() < jamP) {\\n      gun.jammed = true;\\n      gun.jamLeft = 2 + Math.floor(this.rng.next() * 3);\\n      this.jamScript = 0;\\n    }\\n    this.resolveShot(def);\\n    this.provoked = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  breakGun() {\\n    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (!gun) return;\\n    this.guns.splice(this.slot, 1);\\n    this.slot = Math.max(0, this.guns.length - 1);\\n    this.subtitle = 'THE GUN COMES APART.';\\n  }\\n\\n  resolveShot(def) {\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    const yaw = this.ctx.camera.yaw || 0;\\n    const dx = -Math.sin(yaw);\\n    const dz = -Math.cos(yaw);\\n    const range = def.range || 40;\\n    if (def.ignite || def.blast) {\\n      const x = p.x + dx * Math.min(range, 18);\\n      const z = p.z + dz * Math.min(range, 18);\\n      this.fire.ignite(x, z, def.ignite || def.blast || 1);\\n      this.fire.litByPlayer += 1;\\n      this.damagePoint(x, z, def.damage * TUNING.weaponDamage, def.blast || 2);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.damageRay(p, dx, dz, range, (def.damage || 10) * TUNING.weaponDamage);\\n  }\\n\\n  damageRay(p, dx, dz, range, dmg) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bd = range;\\n    for (const a of this.actors) {\\