{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_199","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"burnStrip skips fuel === 0. Story scars on roads won't mark.\n\nSTRIPS points must be placed on fuel cells for story scars to appear. The test baseline includes m5 fires, and m6 resets the count before adding player burns and scar B.\n\nThe test will record burntCount immediately after startMission and assert it increased. playMission already calls startMission internally.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5748a34a-c7a2-47fe-9ef3-0470b9837caf-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/sites.js","offset":55,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":79239,"output_tokens":474,"cache_read_input_tokens":10112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"129e03b5-e408-47e9-8600-226107e59eb7"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5748a34a-c7a2-47fe-9ef3-0470b9837caf-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"55→\\nexport const HALTS = [\\n  { id: 'west-cutting', name: 'WEST CUTTING', x: -400, z: 100 },\\n  { id: 'mile-halt', name: 'MILE FORTY HALT', x: 0, z: 70 },\\n  { id: 'east-halt', name: 'EAST SIDING HALT', x: 430, z: -60 },\\n60→  { id: 'cut-spur', name: 'CUT SPUR', x: 180, z: -220 },\\n];\\n\\n/** Story scars. Burned grass cannot burn twice, so the column can walk them. */\\nexport const STRIPS = {\\n  A: { width: 30, points: [[430, -60], [320, -150], [220, -230], [150, -300]] },\\n  C: { width: 26, points: [[90, -280], [150, -300], [230, -290]] },\\n  B: { width: 30, points: [[150, -300], [-40, -310], [-260, -300], [-420, -370], [-590, -430]] },\\n};\\n\\n70→export function siteById(id) {\\n  return SITES.find((s) => s.id === id) || POSTS.find((s) => s.id === id) || HALTS.find((s) => s.id === id) || null;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"55→\\nexport const HALTS = [\\n  { id: 'west-cutting', name: 'WEST CUTTING', x: -400, z: 100 },\\n  { id: 'mile-halt', name: 'MILE FORTY HALT', x: 0, z: 70 },\\n  { id: 'east-halt', name: 'EAST SIDING HALT', x: 430, z: -60 },\\n60→  { id: 'cut-spur', name: 'CUT SPUR', x: 180, z: -220 },\\n];\\n\\n/** Story scars. Burned grass cannot burn twice, so the column can walk them. */\\nexport const STRIPS = {\\n  A: { width: 30, points: [[430, -60], [320, -150], [220, -230], [150, -300]] },\\n  C: { width: 26, points: [[90, -280], [150, -300], [230, -290]] },\\n  B: { width: 30, points: [[150, -300], [-40, -310], [-260, -300], [-420, -370], [-590, -430]] },\\n};\\n\\n70→export function siteById(id) {\\n  return SITES.find((s) => s.id === id) || POSTS.find((s) => s.id === id) || HALTS.find((s) => s.id === id) || null;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/sites.js\",\"offset\":55,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"\\nexport const HALTS = [\\n  { id: 'west-cutting', name: 'WEST CUTTING', x: -400, z: 100 },\\n  { id: 'mile-halt', name: 'MILE FORTY HALT', x: 0, z: 70 },\\n  { id: 'east-halt', name: 'EAST SIDING HALT', x: 430, z: -60 },\\n  { id: 'cut-spur', name: 'CUT SPUR', x: 180, z: -220 },\\n];\\n\\n/** Story scars. Burned grass cannot burn twice, so the column can walk them. */\\nexport const STRIPS = {\\n  A: { width: 30, points: [[430, -60], [320, -150], [220, -230], [150, -300]] },\\n  C: { width: 26, points: [[90, -280], [150, -300], [230, -290]] },\\n  B: { width: 30, points: [[150, -300], [-40, -310], [-260, -300], [-420, -370], [-590, -430]] },\\n};\\n\\nexport function siteById(id) {\\n  return SITES.find((s) => s.id === id) || POSTS.find((s) => s.id === id) || HALTS.find((s) => s.id === id) || null;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":72}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"02f49b17-dd44-49db-913a-89115a038032"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_200","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Scar B traverses the pass road from the long field to the pass, 30 units wide.\n\nThe 30m-wide road and scar A strips burn grass up to 15m from the path. This inflates the burnt count. m6 zeros fire and re-lays scar A. Then the player burns scar B. The final count includes both scars plus the flare. The pre-test snapshot only captures scar A and pump ignition.\n\nThe burntCount comparison should pass because burnStrip marks cells. Four fixes are planned: close the map after raising it, enter the vehicle on drive steps, complete burning within radius so road-centered objectives light adjacent grass, and aim the flare slightly off the road in tests. Walking m0 needs no travel; m1 drive covers roughly 400m.\n\nThe simulation runs at 1.6 ms per frame, so the 74-second walk would take about seven seconds wall-clock. Driving is faster, so entering the truck is preferable.\n\nVehicle goTo may be stuck because the camera yaw and steer keys are updated every frame. The truck might not turn fast enough and orbit instead. Two thousand five hundred spins should suffice if the heading is generally correct.\n\ntickPlayer also continues moving while the map is open.\n\nFever timing during the m1 drive is being checked. The tablet clears fever for five seconds, then the player collapses after a delay of roughly five seconds plus sixty times the default fever minutes plus twenty-five seconds. At eight minutes that delay is about 510 seconds, far longer than the 27-second drive, so collapse is unlikely. At two minutes the delay is about 150 seconds.\n\nThe m1 tractor should not jam. Eighty auto-fire frames at rate nine fire twelve shots. Wear is 0.35, so condition drops by about four points and stays above the jam threshold of five. The jam script triggers at shot five, but reloads should clear it.\n\nRepairing while in the vehicle works correctly. The step sets inVehicle to false, teleports the hero to the truck, and hold E repairs.\n\nThe default fever minutes will be checked next.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7cc713ab-feaa-4002-a560-053cd203309e-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":140,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7cc713ab-feaa-4002-a560-053cd203309e-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"feverMinutes|vehicleTopSpeed|playerSpeed","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/tuning-defaults.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":807,"output_tokens":1232,"cache_read_input_tokens":89344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"f70fdb85-dc94-4ae9-82aa-c455334329cc"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7cc713ab-feaa-4002-a560-053cd203309e-40","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"140→  ground(x, z) {\\n    if (this.land) return this.land.heightAt(x, z);\\n    if (this.heights) return this.heights(x, z);\\n    return 40;\\n  }\\n\\n  feet() {\\n    if (this.inVehicle && this.car) {\\n      const t = this.car.body.translation();\\n      return { x: t.x, y: t.y, z: t.z };\\n150→    }\\n    const f = this.hero.feet;\\n    return { x: f.x, y: f.y, z: f.z };\\n  }\\n\\n  spawnTown() {\\n    const y = this.ground(12, 55);\\n    addBlock(this.ctx, 12, y + 1.2, 55, 6, 2.4, 4, PALETTE.white);\\n    addBlock(this.ctx, -18, this.ground(-18, 62) + 1.1, 62, 5, 2.2, 4, PALETTE.orange);\\n    addBlock(this.ctx, 0, this.ground(0, 70) + 0.4, 70, 14, 0.4, 4, PALETTE.slate);\\n160→    this.props.push({ tag: 'ledger-book', x: 168, z: -286, alive: true });\\n    this.props.push({ tag: 'cage', x: 40, z: -164, alive: true });\\n    this.props.push({ tag: 'pump', x: -330, z: 395, alive: true });\\n    for (const [x, z] of [[410, -50], [440, -70], [455, -45]]) {\\n      this.props.push({ tag: 'fuel-tank', x, z, alive: true });\\n      addBlock(this.ctx, x, this.ground(x, z) + 1.5, z, 2.2, 3, 2.2, PALETTE.slate);\\n    }\\n    this.props.push({ tag: 'convoy', x: 220, z: 450, alive: true, hp: 80 });\\n    this.props.push({ tag: 'payroll', x: 220, z: 450, alive: true, hidden: true });\\n    this.actors.push({\\n170→      id: 'civil-1', kind: 'civil', x: -250, z: 230, hp: 40, alive: true, faction: 'civil', fleeing: false,\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  paintMapBase() {\\n    const px = this.mapPx;\\n    px.fill(0);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 320 * 240; i++) {\\n      px[i * 4] = 196;\\n      px[i * 4 + 1] = 154;\",\"content_concise\":\"140→  ground(x, z) {\\n    if (this.land) return this.land.heightAt(x, z);\\n    if (this.heights) return this.heights(x, z);\\n    return 40;\\n  }\\n