{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_206","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only one soldier appears in the story: a cage guard.\n\nTravel is safe from combat. The M8 hold waits in place without spawning attackers, which is thin but implemented. Enter confirms choices in the UI.\n\nArrowRight is handled as a 'right' action. I am now editing files. I checked whether the long field burn could be falsely completed by a prior fire. Scar A does not overlap the burn point. Scar B is laid after the burn step.\n\nScar B already burns the grass at the burn point before the player lights it. If burn completion checks any hot cell within range, the step would auto-complete. The check should require lighting an unburnt cell or the objective point itself.\n\nThe burn step at -560,-420 would see already-burnt cells if it checks any hot cell within range. The road there has fuel 0, so burnStrip skips it and the state stays 0. The cell is never actually burnt.\n\nThe exact-cell check would make the step impossible, since the road never burns. The radius check would let it auto-complete because the scar already burned that grass. Both approaches conflict with the design intent: the player should fire a flare at the last unburnt grass, but the scar already covers the objective. I am weighing options to resolve this.\n\nThe cleanest fix is to move the end burn point onto fresh grass so the player must actually light it. Moving the coordinates off the road onto unburnt grass is simpler and avoids changing the completion check. The long field burn at -260,-300 marks the start of scar B, which is laid after the burn step.\n\nDuring the m6 burn step, scar B does not exist yet. Only the road is unburnable, so a radius check for newly burning cells works fine.\n\nFor the end mission, requiring state 1 (currently burning) instead of state 2 (already burnt) would force the player to ignite fresh fuel. However, scar B's 15m half-width may already cover all grass within 12m of the objective point, leaving nothing unburnt.\n\nThe end burn point sits only 2.2 meters from the road center. Fresh grass begins roughly 12.8 meters away on the far side and 17.2 meters away on the near side. The 12-meter radius check therefore cannot reach any unburnt grass, so the step would be impossible to complete.\n\nThe fix is to move both burn objectives onto fresh grass. The end mission point will be placed off the scar, and the m6 long field site will shift 20 meters north of the road to sit on crop. The completion check will use step.r so nearby ignitions count.\n\nThe m6 burn point is fixed at (-260, -280) with radius 18. The long-field goto site stays at (-260, -300). The end mission burn point must be on fuel, below height 68, and outside all story scars.\n\nThe end mission burn point will be placed north of Scar B near (-540, -400). I am computing the exact distance to the road segment and verifying fuel availability with a quick Node script.\n\nI will boot the headless engine to test candidate burn points. I am preparing a script that loads the end mission and samples fuel and height at several coordinates.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-abd1e064-3b20-4d0e-9839-9ce337a83abb-47","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"    if (step.do === 'lines') {\n      for (let n = 0; n < 8 && w.currentStep()?.do === 'lines'; n++) tap('Enter');\n    } else if (step.do === 'map') {\n      tap('KeyM');\n    } else if (step.do === 'fever-fall') {","new_string":"    if (step.do === 'lines') {\n      for (let n = 0; n < 8 && w.currentStep()?.do === 'lines'; n++) tap('Enter');\n    } else if (step.do === 'map') {\n      if (!w.map.up) tap('KeyM');\n      else engine.step(1, DT);\n      if (w.map.up) tap('KeyM');\n    } else if (step.do === 'fever-fall') {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-abd1e064-3b20-4d0e-9839-9ce337a83abb-48","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'goto' || step.do === 'drive' || step.do === 'leave') {\n      const site = step.site ? siteById(step.site) : null;\n      const x = site ? site.x : step.x;\n      const z = site ? site.z : step.z;\n      const radius = step.r || (step.do === 'leave' ? 40 : 20);\n      if (step.do === 'leave') {\n        goTo(x + radius + 30, z, 8);\n      } else goTo(x, z, Math.max(4, radius - 2));","new_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'goto' || step.do === 'drive' || step.do === 'leave') {\n      const site = step.site ? siteById(step.site) : null;\n      const x = site ? site.x : step.x;\n      const z = site ? site.z : step.z;\n      const radius = step.r || (step.do === 'leave' ? 40 : 20);\n      if (step.do === 'drive' && w.car && !w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) {\n        const t = w.truckPos();\n        const p = w.feet();\n        if (Math.hypot(t.x - p.x, t.z - p.z) < 8) tap('KeyE');\n      }\n      if (step.do === 'leave') {\n        goTo(x + radius + 30, z, 8);\n      } else goTo(x, z, Math.max(4, radius - 2));"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-abd1e064-3b20-4d0e-9839-9ce337a83abb-49","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'burn') {\n      if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\n      w.teleport(step.x, step.z + 18);\n      game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\n      arm('flare');\n      tapFire();\n      engine.step(20, DT);","new_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'burn') {\n      if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\n      const r = step.r || 12;\n      const origin = w.fire.cellAt(step.x, step.z);\n      let lx = step.x;\n      let lz = step.z;\n      const reach = Math.ceil(r / 5);\n      let best = Infinity;\n      for (let dz = -reach; dz <= reach; dz++) {\n        for (let dx = -reach; dx <= reach; dx++) {\n          const ix = origin.ix + dx;\n          const iz = origin.iz + dz;\n          if (ix < 0 || iz < 0 || ix >= 256 || iz >= 256) continue;\n          const i = w.fire.idx(ix, iz);\n          if (w.fire.fuel[i] <= 0 || w.fire.state[i] !== 0) continue;\n          const [cx, cz] = w.fire.center(ix, iz);\n          const d = Math.hypot(cx - step.x, cz - step.z);\n          if (d > r - 1 || d >= best) continue;\n          best = d;\n          lx = cx;\n          lz = cz;\n        }\n      }\n      w.teleport(lx, lz + 18);\n      game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\n      arm('flare');\n      tapFire();\n      engine.step(20, DT);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-abd1e064-3b20-4d0e-9839-9ce337a83abb-50","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'burn') {\n      const cell = this.fire.cellAt(step.x, step.z);\n      const hot = cell && (this.fire.state[cell.i] === 1 || this.fire.state[cell.i] === 2);\n      if (hot) this.completeStep();","new_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'burn') {\n      const cell = this.fire.cellAt(step.x, step.z);\n      const reach = Math.ceil((step.r || 12) / 5);\n      let hot = false;\n      if (cell) {\n        for (let dz = -reach; dz <= reach && !hot; dz++) {\n          for (let dx = -reach; dx <= reach; dx++) {\n            const ix = cell.ix + dx;\n            const iz = cell.iz + dz;\n            if (ix < 0 || iz < 0 || ix >= 256 || iz >= 256) continue;\n            const [cx, cz] = this.fire.center(ix, iz);\n            if (Math.hypot(cx - step.x, cz - step.z) > (step.r || 12)) continue;\n            const st = this.fire.state[this.fire.idx(ix, iz)];\n            if (st === 1 || st === 2) {\n              hot = true;\n              break;\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n      if (hot) this.completeStep();"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1092,"output_tokens":3620,"cache_read_input_tokens":99200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"71d4f0f4-3751-48c9-895b-2fe36db0d5ec"}
