{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_207","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The burn radius check will auto-complete the end mission if scar B already covers the area with state 2.\n\nThe test requires a fresh cell within radius. If none exists, the road center is shot and fails to ignite. The step auto-completes on the first tick before the burn handler runs.\n\nThe previous step may have already advanced if the burn was hot when it completed. The first tick after burn becomes current is being determined.\n\nThe scar check occurs during the tapFire step. If the area is already hot, the mission auto-completes before the shot fires. This would pass the test without proving the player actually lit the cell. The acceptance criteria require real actions.\n\nPre-existing state 2 from story scars should not count as completing the burn objective. The check will use state === 1 instead of state === 2, since story scars are immediately marked burnt while fresh ignitions remain active. Grass burns for 8 to 14 seconds, so state 1 persists through the 20-step test.\n\nThe test assertion counts story scars as burnt, so the burn objective must require player ignition. I need to verify fresh fuel exists within radius at both burn points.\n\nIf the end point lacks fresh fuel within 12 meters, the objective must be relocated. A quick probe or script will verify the story layout.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aca87fd7-c719-4e07-84e5-f5a464d70a05-51","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"            const st = this.fire.state[this.fire.idx(ix, iz)];\n            if (st === 1 || st === 2) {\n              hot = true;\n              break;\n            }","new_string":"            if (this.fire.state[this.fire.idx(ix, iz)] === 1) {\n              hot = true;\n              break;\n            }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4017,"output_tokens":1025,"cache_read_input_tokens":100224,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"7eed3263-5cbe-48cc-9323-58ad7b967d20"}
