{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b50f7c0e-8742-48f4-868e-ce7c27d9d172-54","content":"{\"type\":\"TaskOutput\",\"Result\":{\"task_id\":\"6026bf76-a85e-479b-bc04-72ec9bae2fc2\",\"command\":\"cd \\\"A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917\\\" && node tests/run.mjs --only \\\"story\\\"\",\"status\":\"failed\",\"exit_code\":1,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T09:53:00Z\",\"ended\":\"2026-11-05T09:53:03Z\",\"duration_secs\":3.80041008,\"output\":\"mission m0\\nmission m1\\nFAIL story both endings\\nError: goto stuck at 735.5,-543.4 wanting -260,240\\n    at goTo (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:105:9)\\n    at playMission (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:147:14)\\n    at Object.fn (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:486:27)\\n    at async file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:619:5\\npassed 0 failed 1\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c%2Fwork/01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df/terminal/call-78d8500b-d353-4f7f-b5bf-73d7b3684fed-53.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":880}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"dd834650-f94e-40ad-b633-f0742abc9d96"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_210","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The vehicle moved to 735, -543. That coordinate is outside the -640 to 640 basin.\n\nThe driving steering logic is inverted. It sent the vehicle the wrong way off the map. The yaw calculation negates both X and Z differences, causing opposite-direction movement.\n\nThe car's forward vector is (sin(yaw), cos(yaw)), so yaw 0 drives +Z. The player's look direction is (-sin(yaw), -cos(yaw)), so yaw 0 looks down -Z. This confirms the steering signs are inverted.\n\nThe car yaw is exactly π radians off from the camera yaw. When the car faces the target, its nose points away from it. That explains why KeyW pushed the vehicle toward 735, -543 instead of toward -260, +240.\n\nThe fix is to use atan2(x − px, z − pz) for the car yaw instead of the camera yaw. The steering error must be wrapped to stay within ±π before applying KeyA and KeyD.\n\nWalking steering remains unchanged because the player's forward vector matches the camera yaw. A safeguard will detect when distance increases or position leaves the -640 to 640 bounds, signaling incorrect steering.\n\nThe probe confirmed KeyA increases yaw and KeyD decreases it, so the steering logic is sound. I will update goTo with the corrected yaw formula. I also need to throttle only when the steering error is small enough to prevent the vehicle from driving away while turning.\n\nThe truck starts facing -Z while the target is northwest. The wrapped steering error is roughly 2.28 radians, so the vehicle turns left with KeyA while throttling. It will not drive away during this turn.\n\nThe vehicle may arc off the map before aligning. Throttling while the steering error is large could make it drive away instead of turning. I am considering a handbrake or reverse strategy for misaligned turns, but direct yaw control would not be a real action. Walking already reached the destination successfully in the first run.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-821d294b-a4ce-4a3d-84b1-ee2c881a4133-55","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"drive\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917","glob":"*.js","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":898,"output_tokens":1580,"cache_read_input_tokens":106112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"40e114d0-f373-450e-88f8-72d91efef7b0"}
