{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5c9b32e3-19d7-4f56-9df4-21649fa7cf1f-59","content":"{\"type\":\"TaskOutput\",\"Result\":{\"task_id\":\"85ab9538-fa84-4da4-9eb5-2eb32760b5ce\",\"command\":\"cd \\\"A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917\\\" && node tests/run.mjs --only \\\"story\\\"\",\"status\":\"failed\",\"exit_code\":1,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T09:53:53Z\",\"ended\":\"2026-11-05T09:53:57Z\",\"duration_secs\":4.39143978,\"output\":\"mission m0\\nmission m1\\nmission m2\\nmission m3\\nmission m4\\nFAIL story both endings\\nError: m4 stuck on collect TAKE THE CASE at 220,455\\n    at playMission (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:221:13)\\n    at Object.fn (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:484:27)\\n    at async file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:617:5\\npassed 0 failed 1\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c%2Fwork/01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df/terminal/call-7ba1f677-70ce-4312-a01d-ac66ce905b7c-58.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":726}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"5781f60f-838c-4c5b-a04a-dddea9fea936"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_214","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"m0 through m3 passed. m4 is stuck on collect at 220,455.\n\nThe collect logic requires the prop to be unhidden. The payroll is hidden until the convoy dies, so the player could not reach it. Destroying the convoy should unhide the prop.\n\nThe payroll prop should have been unhidden when the convoy was destroyed, because the damageProp logic sets it to visible. Since the destroy step completed and collect began, the payroll must still be hidden. The cause of this discrepancy is being investigated.\n\nThe destroy step can only complete through damageProp. The damageProp function is being examined to verify whether it unhidden the payroll prop when the convoy died.\n\nThe damageProp function does unhide the payroll prop when the convoy dies. The payroll remains hidden at the collect step, so the cause must lie elsewhere.\n\nThe payroll should be visible. The player is only five blocks away, so the distance check passes. The failure likely stems from tryUse returning early, a hidden payroll, or a feet() mismatch.\n\nThe player is at 220,455 instead of the expected 220,451. The collect logic falls back to feet().z + 1 when the prop is missing or hidden. This explains the incorrect teleport position.\n\nThe player's position at 220,455 is now fully explained. After destroying the convoy at 450, placeFacing teleports to prop.z+4, placing the player at 454. The collect logic then falls back to feet().z + 1, which lands at 455. This matches the observed coordinates exactly.\n\nThe payroll prop remains hidden or inactive when collect runs. The destroy step may have completed without triggering the unhide logic, or the payroll was already marked dead before the convoy died.\n\nThe damage ray hits every prop in its path, not just the first target. The payroll and convoy share the same coordinates, so the tractor shot likely struck both props simultaneously. This could explain why the payroll remained hidden or inactive when collect ran.\n\nThe payroll prop has no HP value set, so it defaults to 40. A single tractor hit deals 24 damage, leaving it at 16 HP. The damageProp function returns early for non-convoy props while their HP remains above zero, so the payroll survives that first shot. It only dies after multiple hits reduce its HP to zero or below.\n\nThe payroll prop is destroyed by the same tractor shot that hits the convoy. It is marked alive=false while still hidden, so collect cannot find it. The unhide only happens when the convoy dies, but by then the payroll is already dead. This explains why collect fails despite the payroll being unhidden later.\n\nThe fix is to make damageProp skip hidden props entirely. A hidden case inside the truck should not be destroyed by bullets that hit the vehicle. The payroll would then survive the tractor shots, remain visible when the convoy dies, and collect would succeed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-af42d2e2-58a6-4284-b3a2-fee4732bb4f1-60","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"  damageProp(prop, dmg) {\n    prop.hp = (prop.hp || 40) - dmg;","new_string":"  damageProp(prop, dmg) {\n    if (prop.hidden) return;\n    prop.hp = (prop.hp || 40) - dmg;"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":650,"output_tokens":2040,"cache_read_input_tokens":111488,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"45447c50-209b-4ff9-bf2e-80a66edd8fc0"}
