{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_217","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The teleport failed because the prop was not found. The position remains stuck at 220,455.\n\nThe payroll prop remains hidden after the destroy step. The unhide logic may have been skipped because the convoy was destroyed before the guard triggered, or the destroy handler failed to locate the prop.\n\nThe tractor is armed correctly. The convoy likely dies and unhide payroll. Then the remaining bullets in that same holdFire hit the now-unhidden payroll and destroy it.\n\nThe payroll is unhidden when the convoy dies, but it is already dead. The collect step fails to find it because it requires alive status. The teleport falls back to feet placement near 455.\n\nThe test's holdFire loop continues for all 50 frames even after the destroy step completes. This kills the payroll after it is unhidden. The fix is to stop firing once the step advances.\n\nThe proposed fix may not work. The damageRay loop checks all props in the same frame that the step completes. The payroll could still be killed before the destroy loop stops.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-85f050d2-0945-4286-ad74-0bd33312e772-63","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"weaponDamage","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/tuning-defaults.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":642,"output_tokens":972,"cache_read_input_tokens":114688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"326ce67e-b194-46b8-a803-0582edb677ef"}
