{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_218","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Payroll is at 16 HP after one extra hit.\n\nThe destroy logic will advance one frame at a time and stop immediately. The case should not sit exactly on the truck's hit volume. If the player keeps firing after reveal, they could destroy the case before collecting it.\n\nThe payroll case will be offset 3 meters beside the truck when revealed. This keeps it out of the same hit volume.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6cd8ca28-64d6-42d5-9f99-e8ab711c3d16-64","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    if (prop.tag === 'convoy') {\n      const pay = this.props.find((p) => p.tag === 'payroll');\n      if (pay) pay.hidden = false;\n    }","new_string":"    if (prop.tag === 'convoy') {\n      const pay = this.props.find((p) => p.tag === 'payroll');\n      if (pay) {\n        pay.hidden = false;\n        pay.x = prop.x + 3;\n        pay.z = prop.z + 1.5;\n      }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6cd8ca28-64d6-42d5-9f99-e8ab711c3d16-65","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'destroy') {\n      for (let n = 0; n < 6 && w.currentStep()?.do === 'destroy'; n++) {\n        const prop = w.props.find((p) => p.alive !== false && p.tag === step.tag);\n        if (!prop) break;\n        placeFacing(prop.x, prop.z);\n        if (w.guns.some((g) => g.id === 'tractor')) arm('tractor');\n        holdFire(50);\n      }","new_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'destroy') {\n      for (let n = 0; n < 8 && w.currentStep()?.do === 'destroy'; n++) {\n        const 