{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_221","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All m0-m8 tasks are complete, including the 180-second hold.\n\nm9 is stuck at 23.9 meters from the observatory. The goTo radius is 22 meters, so the player cannot close the gap. Terrain blocks the final two meters.\n\nThe stuck distance of 23.9 meters is below the 24-meter completion threshold, so tickMission should have triggered. The step may no longer be a goto action.\n\nThe stuck state is caused by goTo() itself. Possible blockers include mode not being play, the step type changing mid-mission, feet position drift during tick, or an early return in fixed(). The observatory sits on a high ridge.\n\nThe stuck error is a test bug. goTo() never checks if the mission step completed. It keeps looping until the 2500-spin limit, even after the player has already reached the observatory.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-44ea9370-2d81-4f96-94ca-75149773087d-68","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"function goTo(x, z, r) {\n  const w = game.world;\n  release();\n  for (let spins = 0; spins < 2500; spins++) {\n    const p = w.feet();\n    if (Math.hypot(x - p.x, z - p.z) <= r) {","new_string":"function goTo(x, z, r) {\n  const w = game.world;\n  const step = w.currentStep();\n  release();\n  for (let spins = 0; spins < 2500; spins++) {\n    if (!w.mission || w.mission.done || w.currentStep() !== step) {\n      release();\n      return;\n    }\n    const p = w.feet();\n    if (Math.hypot(x - p.x, z - p.z) <= r) {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":801,"output_tokens":1422,"cache_read_input_tokens":118144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e