{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_229","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"m9 passed. The first end mission is stuck on burn.\n\nThe burn target is the road cell at (-560, -420). It has no fuel. The search found no better cell within radius. The shot landed on empty road and failed to ignite. The step cannot complete.\n\nThe burn target will be moved to a fuel patch near the pass that the scar does not cover. A quick script will probe the map state to find a valid cell.\n\nThe probe script scans the end mission area for fresh fuel. It checks cells at intervals and records coordinates with positive fuel and zero burn state.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3b91ce77-5c77-4806-bc6c-84dc3451df3f-77","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917\" && node --input-type=module -e '\nimport { Engine } from \"./pixel-engine.js\";\nimport { createGame } from \"./src/game.js\";\nconst game = createGame();\nawait Engine.headless(game, { seed: 1 });\nconst w = game.world;\nw.startMission(\"end\");\nconst near = [];\nfor (let z = -500; z <= -340; z += 8) {\n  for (let x = -640; x <= -480; x += 8) {\n    const c = w.fire.cellAt(x, z);\n    if (!c) continue;\n    if (w.fire.fuel[c.i] > 0 && w.fire.state[c.i] === 0) {\n      const d = Math.hypot(x + 590, z + 430);\n      if (d < 80) near.push([x, z, Math.round(d), Math.round(w.ground(x, z))]);\n    }\n  }\n}\nnear.sort((a, b) => a[2] - b[2]);\nconsole.log(near.slice(0, 25).map((p) => p.join(\",\")).join(\"\\n\"));\n'","description":"Find fresh grass near the pass for the ending flare"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":673,"output_tokens":944,"cache_read_input_tokens":129280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"d31591dc-c344-4de5-8a9f-1e3e75a8077b"}
