dger, dialogue, music, voices, bot playthrough\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"shell: Title, menus, settings, touch gate, attract, dev sliders, About/Credits\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"content\":\"cashrun: Cash Run multiplayer, verification, exit-interview.json, PROGRESS.md\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}],\"state\":{\"todos\":{\"titles\":{\"content\":\"titles: List 50 titles, RNG-pick one, create dev folder, unzip kit, vendor hub, prove pixel-engine.js match\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"scaffold\":{\"content\":\"scaffold: Syntax-check sim, boot headless world, wire game.js/main.js and single-file build\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},\"locomotion\":{\"content\":\"locomotion: Basin, locomotion, look, actions, glyphs, HUD, pause + headless tests\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},\"combat\":{\"content\":\"combat: Weapons wear/jam/break, hits, soldiers, health, syrette, surgery, fever\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},\"worldsys\":{\"content\":\"worldsys: Fire grid, ignition, day/night, vehicles, held map, safehouses, stones, save/load\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},\"story\":{\"content\":\"story: Missions through both endings, buddies, Ledger, dialogue, music, voices, bot playthrough\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"shell\":{\"content\":\"shell: Title, menus, settings, touch gate, attract, dev sliders, About/Credits\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},\"cashrun\":{\"content\":\"cashrun: Cash Run multiplayer, verification, exit-interview.json, PROGRESS.md\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0aed478f-d52e-42f7-9469-35a62c7da024-96","content":"{\"type\":\"BackgroundTaskStarted\",\"task_id\":\"a5137122-0c62-45a5-bb4f-bc82127cbf61\",\"task_type\":\"bash\",\"ou