{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_246","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Merc moves at 3.2 m/s. The distance covered in 30 frames is being calculated.\n\nMerc exits the beam after 1.6 m in 0.5 s, well past the 0.8 m threshold. The test will re-aim. Damage is 24, so five hits kill the merc. Five bursts of holdFire(8) yield about five shots. Tick order was fixed: player fires first, then mission ticks, then round moves Merc.\n\nThe solo test will re-aim until the merc is down, with logging added for any remaining failures. Reviving the merc takes about 3.33 seconds, which is enough. The player teleports to the merc's seat, and the distance is under three meters. For the pickup case, the player will teleport to the box and tap E.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe5d54fa-f0c0-42ff-90cd-2d4c999acba6-103","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  const foe = game.world.actors.find((a) => a.kind === 'merc' && a.seat === merc.id);\n  placeFacing(foe.x, foe.z);\n  arm('tractor');\n  holdFire(30);\n  assert(merc.hp < startHp, 'friendly fire did nothing');\n  if (!merc.down) {\n    holdFire(80);\n  }\n  assert(merc.down, 'merc did not drop');","new_string":"  arm('tractor');\n  for (let n = 0; n < 10 && !merc.down; n++) {\n    const foe = game.world.actors.find((a) => a.seat === merc.id);\n    if (!foe) break;\n    placeFacing(foe.x, foe.z);\n    holdFire(10);\n  }\n  assert(merc.hp < startHp, 'friendly fire did nothing ' + merc.hp);\n  assert(merc.down, 'merc did not drop ' + merc.hp);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2490,"output_tokens":724,"cache_read_input_tokens":152832,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df