{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b9b871ec-c43e-431d-af50-2ef2de134515-138","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"420→  w.stones = 50;\\n  engine.step(26 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.stones <= 40.01, 'ignore did not cost stones ' + w.stones);\\n  w.hp = 15;\\n  tap('KeyQ');\\n  assert(w.surgeryT > 0, 'no surgery');\\n  engine.step(5 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.hp >= 40, 'surgery hp ' + w.hp);\\n  w.startMission('m3');\\n  w.lines = [];\\n430→  w.hp = 1;\\n  w.hurt(50, 'bullet', true);\\n  assert(w.rescueT > 0, 'no rescue');\\n  engine.step(4 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.hp >= 40 && w.rescueT <= 0, 'rescue failed ' + w.hp + ' t ' + w.rescueT);\\n  w.syrettes = 1;\\n  w.downBuddy('ines', { burning: false });\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  const ines = w.buddies.find((b) => b.id === 'ines');\\n  assert(!ines.down && w.syrettes === 0, 'syrette did not pick the buddy up');\\n440→  w.syrettes = 0;\\n  w.downBuddy('ines', { burning: false });\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  assert(w.deadBuddies.has('ines'), 'finish-it did not record the death');\\n});\\n\\ntest('map while driving and sliders', async () => {\\n  await boot();\\n  const w = game.world;\\n  w.startMission('m1');\\n450→  engine.step(2, DT);\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  assert(w.inVehicle, 'did not enter');\\n  const z0 = w.feet().z;\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', true);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', true);\\n  engine.step(20, DT);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', false);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', false);\\n  assert(w.map.up && w.inVehicle, 'map not held while driving');\",\"content_concise\":\"420→  w.stones = 50;\\n  engine.step(26 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.stones <= 40.01, 'ignore did not cost stones ' + w.stones);\\n  w.hp = 15;\\n  tap('KeyQ');\\n  assert(w.surgeryT > 0, 'no surgery');\\n  engine.step(5 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.hp >= 40, 'surgery hp ' + w.hp);\\n  w.startMission('m3');\\n  w.lines = [];\\n430→  w.hp = 1;\\n  w.hurt(50, 'bullet', true);\\n  assert(w.rescueT > 0, 'no rescue');\\n  engine.step(4 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.hp >= 40 && w.rescueT <= 0, 'rescue failed ' + w.hp + ' t ' + w.rescueT);\\n  w.syrettes = 1;\\n  w.downBuddy('ines', { burning: false });\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  const ines = w.buddies.find((b) => b.id === 'ines');\\n  assert(!ines.down && w.syrettes === 0, 'syrette did not pick the buddy up');\\n440→  w.syrettes = 0;\\n  w.downBuddy('ines', { burning: false });\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  assert(w.deadBuddies.has('ines'), 'finish-it did not record the death');\\n});\\n\\ntest('map while driving and sliders', async () => {\\n  await boot();\\n  const w = game.world;\\n  w.startMission('m1');\\n450→  engine.step(2, DT);\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  assert(w.inVehicle, 'did not enter');\\n  const z0 = w.feet().z;\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', true);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', true);\\n  engine.step(20, DT);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', false);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', false);\\n  assert(w.map.up && w.inVehicle, 'map not held while driving');\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs\",\"offset\":420,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"  w.stones = 50;\\n  engine.step(26 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.stones <= 40.01, 'ignore did not cost stones ' + w.stones);\\n  w.hp = 15;\\n  tap('KeyQ');\\n  assert(w.surgeryT > 0, 'no surgery');\\n  engine.step(5 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.hp >= 40, 'surgery hp ' + w.hp);\\n  w.startMission('m3');\\n  w.lines = [];\\n  w.hp = 1;\\n  w.hurt(50, 'bullet', true);\\n  assert(w.rescueT > 0, 'no rescue');\\n  engine.step(4 * 60, DT);\\n  assert(w.hp >= 40 && w.rescueT <= 0, 'rescue failed ' + w.hp + ' t ' + w.rescueT);\\n  w.syrettes = 1;\\n  w.downBuddy('ines', { burning: false });\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  const ines = w.buddies.find((b) => b.id === 'ines');\\n  assert(!ines.down && w.syrettes === 0, 'syrette did not pick the buddy up');\\n  w.syrettes = 0;\\n  w.downBuddy('ines', { burning: false });\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  assert(w.deadBuddies.has('ines'), 'finish-it did not record the death');\\n});\\n\\ntest('map while driving and sliders', async () => {\\n  await boot();\\n  const w = game.world;\\n  w.startMission('m1');\\n  engine.step(2, DT);\\n  tap('KeyE');\\n  assert(w.inVehicle, 'did not enter');\\n  const z0 = w.feet().z;\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', true);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', true);\\n  engine.step(20, DT);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', false);\\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', false);\\n  assert(w.map.up && w.inVehicle, 'map not held while driving');\\n\",\"total_lines\":634}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"ac3c8aa2-d0f7-4dec-ab6e-4f5e4c7fd7be"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_275","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"When health reaches 1, the down() function searches for a buddy.\n\nThe m3 setup uses a buddy, so the engine keeps running after the down event. Locomotion fails first. The suite continues despite that failure. Guns passes. Map fails because the vehicle is not held while driving.\n\nThe map toggle only fires on the first frame of KeyM press. It does not stay active while the key is held. The map likely dropped because the player left the vehicle or the mission state reset.\n\nThe map toggle should remain active. The failure likely means the player exited the vehicle during those 20 frames, or the map was closed. A collision destroying the vehicle seems unlikely in that short time.\n\nThe map test passes when run alone. This suggests the key was already held down from a prior test. If KeyM is already down, the engine sees no new press and never toggles the map up.\n\nGuns and locomotion both release their keys, so neither leaves KeyM down. The map test sets KeyM true itself, which should generate a press edge. The engine's setKey behavior is being questioned.\n\nThe map test passed its entry check, so the vehicle was occupied. KeyE is not stuck down from the prior tap. The failure is isolated to the suite, meaning shared state between tests is the culprit. The startMission setup clears lines correctly.\n\napplySetup clears choice and rescue timers, but it does not reset surgeryT. The guns test finishes its surgery, so that timer is fine. Map starts closed and KeyM opens it. The mouse button state from holdFire is now being checked.\n\nThe plan is to add a full world-state reset at the start of boot() so each test starts fresh. A reproduction script will run fire, locomotion, guns, and map in sequence with logging. If locomotion still fails after that reset, it will be fixed separately.\n\nThe boot() reset now explicitly clears the engine, timeScale, mode, screen, attract, ending, session, round, inVehicle, crouch, sprint, map state, lines, choice, surgeryT, rescueT, dead, and god flags.\n\nCalling resetDynamic in boot() is dangerous. It spawns town blocks and stacks static colliders every test, which would trap the player or launch them. The reset should only clear leaking fields like timeScale, mode, map, keys, sliders, round, and inVehicle. Locomotion's 8.34 failure still needs investigation.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-af30ab2f-a1ee-4b61-b6e6-327a6e080f64-139","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917\" && node --input-type=module -e '\nimport { Engine } from \"./pixel-engine.js\";\nimport { createGame } from \"./src/game.js\";\nimport { TUNING } from \"./src/core/tuning.js\";\nconst DT = 1/60;\nconst game = createGame();\nconst engine = await Engine.headless(game, { seed: 1 });\nengine.step(16*60, DT);\nconst w = game.world;\nw.startMission(\"m7\");\nw.lines = [];\ngame.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\nconst z0 = w.feet().z;\nconst y0 = w.feet().y;\nengine.input.setKey(\"KeyW\", true);\nengine.step(60, DT);\nengine.input.setKey(\"KeyW\", false);\nconst z1 = w.feet().z;\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({\n  run: +(z0-z1).toFixed(2),\n  dy: +(w.feet().y-y0).toFixed(2),\n  speed: TUNING.playerSpeed,\n  inVehicle: w.inVehicle,\n  crouch: w.crouch,\n  sprint: w.sprint,\n  mode: game.mode,\n  scale: engine.timeScale,\n  x: +w.feet().x.toFixed(2),\n  z: +w.feet().z.toFixed(2),\n}));\n'","description":"Measure run speed after a long fire step"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":830,"output_tokens":1833,"cache_read_input_tokens":196480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"3c3f8615-b7b3-4924-b2fb-150939a8e4ab"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-af30ab2f-a1ee-4b61-b6e6-327a6e080f64-139","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[123,34,114,117,110,34,58,56,46,48,57,44,34,100,121,34,58,48,46,54,51,44,34,115,112,101,101,100,34,58,49,44,34,105,110,86,101,104,105,99,108,101,34,58,116,114,117,101,44,34,99,114,111,117,99,104,34,58,102,97,108,115,101,44,34,115,112,114,105,110,116,34,58,102,97,108,115,101,44,34,109,111,100,101,34,58,34,112,108,97,121,34,44,34,115,99,97,108,101,34,58,49,44,34,120,34,58,45,49,50,48,46,53,51,44,34,122,34,58,49,52,49,46,57,49,125,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\n{\\\"run\\\":8.09,\\\"dy\\\":0.63,\\\"speed\\\":1,\\\"inVehicle\\\":true,\\\"crouch\\\":false,\\\"sprint\\\":false,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"play\\\",\\\"scale\\\":1,\\\"x\\\":-120.53,\\\"z\\\":141.91}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd \\\"A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917\\\" && node --input-type=module -e '\\nimport { Engine } from \\\"./pixel-engine.js\\\";\\nimport { createGame } from \\\"./src/game.js\\\";\\nimport { TUNING } from \\\"./src/core/tuning.js\\\";\\nconst DT = 1/60;\\nconst game = createGame();\\nconst engine = await Engine.headless(game, { seed: 1 });\\nengine.step(16*60, DT);\\nconst w = game.world;\\nw.startMission(\\\"m7\\\");\\nw.lines = [];\\ngame.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\\nconst z0 = w.feet().z;\\nconst y0 = w.feet().y;\\nengine.input.setKey(\\\"KeyW\\\", true);\\nengine.step(60, DT);\\nengine.input.setKey(\\\"KeyW\\\", false);\\nconst z1 = w.feet().z;\\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({\\n  run: +(z0-z1).toFixed(2),\\n  dy: +(w.feet().y-y0).toFixed(2),\\n  speed: TUNING.playerSpeed,\\n  inVehicle: w.inVehicle,\\n  crouch: w.crouch,\\n  sprint: w.sprint,\\n  mode: game.mode,\\n  scale: engine.timeScale,\\n  x: +w.feet().x.toFixed(2),\\n  z: +w.feet().z.toFixed(2),\\n}));\\n'\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Measure run speed after a long fire step\",\"current_