{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_276","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The inVehicle flag is true after startMission m7.\n\nThe title screen step sets inVehicle to true. m7's applySetup does not clear it. Attract mode is ruled out.\n\nThe 16-second title step triggers attract mode after 10 seconds. Attract beat 0 forces inVehicle true and places the player in the truck. startMission does not clear this flag, so the player drives instead of walking. This causes the 8-meter run.\n\nThe fire test passed because it only checks the fire grid. Locomotion alone passes because attract has not started during boot. The fix is to set inVehicle false in applySetup and startMission unless the setup explicitly places the player in a truck.\n\nThe fire test stepping 16 seconds on the title screen is what triggers attract mode. The proper fix is to reset inVehicle, disable god mode, and re-enable the hero collider inside startMission and applySetup. If attract left a car behind, the player should exit it.\n\nstartMission must also clear god and infAmmo. Otherwise attract mode leaves god active through the mission. The suite order is fire first, then locomotion.\n\nAttract mode also leaves map.up true. startMission does not clear it, so the map test fails when KeyM tries to close the map.\n\nThe story goto at the clinic is stuck because the player remains in the attract truck. The goTo camera yaw conflicts with the vehicle yaw, and the early-exit steering logic cannot throttle while the car is present. This causes the hero to spin in place near the start position.\n\nSolo revive might pass once mission starts clear leftover state. The failure could come from a stuck vehicle, the map intercepting KeyE, or incorrect merc positions from attract soldiers. The menus attract test resets attract mode and steps 600; it should restart unless freshInput blocks it.\n\nThe story goTo throw does not release keys, so KeyW stays held. This blocks attract mode and causes solo revive to fail because KeyE fights the stuck forward input.\n\ngoTo should release keys before throwing. The test runner catch block must also clear keys and timeScale. startMission needs to reset the attract flag and bot reference. applySetup will explicitly disable god mode, infAmmo, map.up, and inVehicle, then enable the hero collider.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6c9020da-55b1-4a3e-bbd3-60373dda8571-140","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    this.carrying = null;\n    this.jamScript = 0;\n    this.shotCount = 0;","new_string":"    this.carrying = null;\n    this.inVehicle = false;\n    this.map.up = false;\n    this.god = false;\n    this.infAmmo = false;\n    this.crouch = false;\n    if (this.hero?.collider) this.hero.collider.setEnabled(true);\n    this.jamScript = 0;\n    this.shotCount = 0;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6c9020da-55b1-4a3e-bbd3-60373dda8571-141","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  const p = w.feet();\n  throw new Error('goto stuck at ' + p.x.toFixed(1) + ',' + p.z.toFixed(1) + ' wanting ' + x + ',' + z);\n}","new_string":"  const p = w.feet();\n  release();\n  throw new Error('goto stuck at ' + p.x.toFixed(1) + ',' + p.z.toFixed(1) + ' wanting ' + x + ',' + z);\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6c9020da-55b1-4a3e-bbd3-60373dda8571-142","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  } catch (err) {\n    failed += 1;","new_string":"  } catch (err) {\n    f