{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ebedf32b-3ce9-4850-90b0-1dd2b6613f2f-144","content":"{\"type\":\"TaskOutput\",\"Result\":{\"task_id\":\"ae94fd31-9495-44f0-b771-edad7d4f5b6c\",\"command\":\"cd \\\"A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917\\\" && node tests/run.mjs --all\",\"status\":\"failed\",\"exit_code\":1,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T10:05:53Z\",\"ended\":\"2026-11-05T10:06:04Z\",\"duration_secs\":11.027151578,\"output\":\"FAIL map while driving and sliders\\nError: did not enter\\n    at assert (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:27:20)\\n    at Object.fn (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:453:3)\\n    at async file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:627:5\\nFAIL menus attract pause touch\\nError: attract did not start\\n    at assert (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:27:20)\\n    at Object.fn (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:561:3)\\n    at async file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A%20Cry%20Too%20Far-Far%20Cry%202-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs:627:5\\npassed 8 failed 2\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c%2Fwork/01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df/terminal/call-e7bea604-