{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_279","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Eight items passed, including locomotion, guns, story, and solo.\n\nMap and menus attract failed. Map entry is blocked, likely because the truck has low health and KeyE triggers repair instead of entering.\n\nThe attract test created a car at 8, 40. The map setup then called ensureTruck, which exited early because a car already existed. The truck remained at 8, 40 while the player teleported to 12, 55. The distance is now 15.5 meters, exceeding the 8-meter entry threshold.\n\nThe fix for the map entry bug is to move an existing truck to the setup point and restore its health instead of skipping. The menus attract failure remains unexplained, since story and solo passed and keys should be released.\n\nThe menus attract failure is being traced to the freshInput logic. The map test released all keys, but the release list omits some keys like KeyG and Tab. A stuck key or lingering mouse delta could be blocking attract.\n\nThe menus attract failure is being traced to the session flag. If a session was set during the solo test, trackIdle would return immediately and prevent attract from starting. The solo test runs before menus in the file order.\n\nThe menus attract failure is confirmed. The solo test sets `this.session`, but `toTitle` never clears it. Because `trackIdle` exits early when a session exists, attract never starts. The fix is to clear the session inside `toTitle`.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c8c91a3d-0abb-4bd1-8357-241ff94f65d9-145","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    if (setup.truck) this.ensureTruck(setup.x + 6, setup.z);","new_string":"    if (setup.truck) {\n      const tx = setup.x + 6;\n      const tz = setup.z;\n      if (!this.car) this.ensureTruck(tx, tz);\n      else {\n        this.car.reset([tx, this.ground(tx, tz) + 1.2, tz], Math.PI);\n        this.vehicleHp = 100;\n      }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c8c91a3d-0abb-4bd1-8357-241ff94f65d9-146","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","old_string":"  toTitle() {\n    this.mode = 'title';\n    this.screen = 'title';\n    this.focus = 0;\n    this.ending = null;","new_string":"  toTitle() {\n    this.mode = 'title';\n    this.screen = 'title';\n    this.focus = 0;\n    this.ending = null;\n    this.session = null;\n    this.round = null;\n    if (this.world) this.world.round = null;"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":881,"output_tokens":1488,"cache_read_input_tokens":201856,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"401dcb24-4920-4122-b40c-94c69372349d"}
