{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_290","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to run a diagnostic.\n\nThe story test reaches step m8 in 7 seconds. I'll add temporary logs to playMission to inspect hold, health, dead, mode, timeScale, blocks, lines, and rescueT. I also need to check if timeScale 0 causes fixedUpdate to receive zero delta time.\n\nThe player dies at 0,70 because the god mode flag drops to false. Previously fire damage was ignored, but now the player burns to death at spawn if a scar is present. This explains why hold freezes and the position stays at 0,70.\n\nIf the player dies immediately, hold is only about 10 seconds and the position stays at 0,70. That matches the observed behavior perfectly.\n\nIf a buddy rescue triggers instead, the player might survive fire damage through repeated rescues. I need to check whether hurt() can still call down() during rescue, and whether rescueT blocks fire damage while the buddy is available.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-be1aaa79-5e64-4228-bf97-e1e5f8831cd1-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/sites.js","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-be1aaa79-5e64-4228-bf97-e1e5f8831cd1-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":140,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-be1aaa79-5e64-4228-bf97-e1e5f8831cd1-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fireDamage|enemyVision|playerDamageTaken|feverMinutes","glob":"**/*.{js}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_seque