{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_292","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Soldiers only spawn on clear steps and cash rounds.\n\nRanger-post soldiers are too far away to see the player at the halt. They cannot shoot. The player's death likely comes from another cause. I will check if lines survive when advancing to hold.\n\nThe Enter key consumes the last line and sets _linesDone. tickPlayer runs before tickMission in the same frame, so the lines step completes immediately after the line is consumed.\n\nThe hold step runs for 7230 frames. The stuck-mission throw is avoided because the mission index advances. If this works in isolation, prior missions are leaking state. I am checking what survives across applySetup: actors, props, car, deadBuddies, ledger, rng, burning, and rescue or surgery timers.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d0716cc7-017b-4bd0-a5b1-e74ecef152e1-26","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^test\\(","glob":"**/run.mjs","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d0716cc7-017b-4bd0-a5b1-e74ecef152e1-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":800,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1548,"output_tokens":791,"cache_read_input_tokens":58112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"fd74c364-5812-43c1-bb7a-021c3e346051"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d0716cc7-017b-4bd0-a5b1-e74ecef152e1-26","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,57,49,55,95,95,120,48,55,51,57,51,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,57,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,57,49,55,95,95,120,48,55,51,57,51,99,47,119,111,114,107,47,65,32,67,114,121,32,84,111,111,32,70,97,114,45,70,97,114,32,67,114,121,32,50,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,57,49,55,47,116,101,115,116,115,47,114,117,110,46,109,106,115,10,50,52,54,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,115,116,97,116,105,99,32,102,105,108,101,115,39,44,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,50,56,50,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,116,105,116,108,101,32,109,117,115,105,99,32,97,110,100,32,98,97,115,105,110,39,44,32,97,115,121,110,99,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,50,57,57,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,102,105,114,101,32,115,112,114,101,97,100,32,115,99,97,114,115,32,97,110,100,32,114,101,98,117,114,110,39,44,32,97,115,121,110,99,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,51,52,49,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,108,111,99,111,109,111,116,105,111,110,39,44,32,97,115,121,110,99,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,51,55,54,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,103,117,110,115,32,102,101,118,101,114,32,115,117,114,103,101,114,121,32,114,101,115,99,117,101,32,102,105,110,105,115,104,39,44,32,97,115,121,110,99,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,52,52,55,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,109,97,112,32,119,104,105,108,101,32,100,114,105,118,105,110,103,32,97,110,100,32,115,108,105,100,101,114,115,39,44,32,97,115,121,110,99,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,52,57,49,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,115,116,111,114,121,32,98,111,116,104,32,101,110,100,105,110,103,115,39,44,32,97,115,121,110,99,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,53,49,53,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,115,111,108,111,32,114,111,117,110,100,39,44,32,97,115,121,110,99,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,53,53,48,58,116,101,115,116,40,39,109,101,110,117,115,32,97,116,116,114,97,99,116,32,112,97,117,115,101,32,116,111,117,99,104,39,44,32,97,115,121,110,99,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":9,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":246,\"content\":\"test('static files', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":282,\"content\":\"test('title music and basin', async () => {\"},{\"line_number\":299,\"content\":\"test('fire spread scars and reburn', async () => {\"},{\"line_number\":341,\"content\":\"test('locomotion', async () => {\"},{\"line_number\":376,\"content\":\"test('guns fever surgery rescue finish', async () => {\"},{\"line_number\":447,\"content\":\"test('map while driving and sliders', async () => {\"},{\"line_number\":491,\"content\":\"test('story both endings', async () => {\"},{\"line_number\":515,\"content\":\"test('solo round', async () => {\"},{\"line_number\":550,\"content\":\"test('menus attract pause touch', async () => {\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d0716cc7-017b-4bd0-a5b1-e74ecef152e1-27","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"800→    if (this.rescueT > 0) return;\\n    this.readNeeds(dt, input, bot);\\n    if (this.choice) return;\\n    if (this.map.up && input) {\\n      let dx = input.mouseDelta.x;\\n      let dy = input.mouseDelta.y;\\n      const px = input.pointer?.x || 0;\\n      const py = input.pointer?.y || 0;\\n      if (dx === 0 && dy === 0 && this.map.px != null) {\\n        dx = (px - this.map.px) * 800;\\n810→        dy = (py - this.map.py) * 800;\\n      }\\n      this.map.px = px;\\n      this.map.py = py;\\n      this.map.cx = clamp(this.map.cx + dx * 0.35, -640, 640);\\n      this.map.cz = clamp(this.map.cz - dy * 0.35, -640, 640);\\n    } else if (this.map) {\\n      this.map.px = null;\\n    }\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n820→    const wading = nearRiver(p.x, p.z, 8) && !onBridge(p.x, p.z);\\n    let speed = 5.4;\\n    if (this.crouch) speed = 2;\\n    else if (this.walk) speed = 3.6;\\n    const sprinting = this.sprint && this.stamina > 0 && !wading && !this.carrying;\\n    if (sprinting) speed = 7.4;\\n    if (wading) speed = 2.7;\\n    if (this.carrying) speed *= 0.85;\\n    speed *= TUNING.playerSpeed;\\n    if (sprinting && (bot ? bot.move : true)) this.stamina = Math.max(0, this.stamina - dt);\\n830→    else this.stamina = Math.min(6, this.stamina + dt * (6 / 8));\\n    this.hero.speed = speed;\\n    const yaw = this.ctx.camera.yaw || 0;\\n    let ax = 0;\\n    let ay = 0;\\n    if (bot) {\\n      ax = bot.x || 0;\\n      ay = bot.y || 0;\\n    } else {\\n      const m = input.moveAxis();\\n840→      ax = m.x;\\n      ay = m.y;\\n    }\\n    const fx = -Math.sin(yaw);\\n    const fz = -Math.cos(yaw);\\n    const rx = Math.cos(yaw);\\n    const rz = -Math.sin(yaw);\\n    MOVE.set(fx * ay + rx * ax, 0, fz * ay + rz * ax);\\n    if (MOVE.length() > 1) MOVE.normalize();\\n    const jump = !!(bot ? bot.jump : consumeAction(input, 'jump'));\\n850→    if (!this.inVehicle && !this.noclip) {\\n      this.hero.setInput(MOVE, jump, jump);\\n      this.hero.fixedUpdate(dt);\\n    } else if (this.noclip) {\\n      const f = this.hero.feet;\\n      this.hero.teleport([f.x + MOVE.x * dt * 12, f.y, f.z + MOVE.z * dt * 12]);\\n    }\\n    if (this.inVehicle && this.car) this.drive(dt, input, bot, ax, ay);\\n    if (!bot) {\\n      this.combat(dt, input);\\n860→      this.handleUse(dt, input);\\n    } else if (bot.fire) this.combat(dt, { isDown: () => true, consumePress: () => false, consumeAny: () => false, anyDown: () => true, wasPressed: () => false });\\n    this.nearPrompt();\\n  }\\n\\n  drive(dt, input, bot, ax, ay) {\\n    this.car.o.topSpeed = TUNING.vehicleTopSpeed * (this.vehicleHp < 35 ? 0.6 : 1);\\n    const throttle = this.vehicleHp <= 0 ? 0 : (bot ? (bot.y || 0) : ay);\\n    const steer = bot ? (bot.x || 0) : ax;\\n    this.car.drive({ throttle, steer, brake: throttle < 0, handbrake: false }, dt);\\n870→    if (this.vehicleHp < 10 && this.vehicleHp > 0 && this.burning > 0) {\\n      this.explodeT += dt;\\n      if (this.explodeT > 8) {\\n        this.vehicleHp = 0;\\n        const t = this.car.body.translation();\\n        this.fire.ignite(t.x, t.z, 6);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n880→  readNeeds(dt, input, bot) {\\n    if (bot) return;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.guns.length && i < 4; i++) {\\n      if (input.consumePress('Digit' + (i + 1))) this.slot = i;\\n    }\\n    if (input.consumePress('PadTriangle') && this.guns.length > 1) this.slot = (this.slot + 1) % this.guns.length;\\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'crouch')) this.crouch = !this.crouch;\\n    if (input.consumePress('CapsLock')) this.walk = !this.walk;\\n    this.sprint = heldAction(input, 'sprint') || input.isDown('ShiftLeft');\\n    if (consumeAction(input, 'map')) {\\n890→      this.map.up = !this.map.up;\\n      if (this.map.up) {\\n        const p = this.feet();\\n        this.map.cx = p.x;\\n        this.map.cz = p.z;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (this.map.up) this.map.anim = Math.min(1, this.map.anim + dt / 0.4);\\n    else this.map.anim = Math.max(0, this.map.anim - dt / 0.4);\\n    if (this.feverOn && (heldAction(input, 'tablet') || input.isDown('KeyH'))) {\\n900→      this.holdT.tablet += dt;\\n      if (this.holdT.tablet >= 1 && this.tablets > 0) {\\n        this.tablets -= 1;\\n        this.feverClear = 5;\\n        this.holdT.tablet = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'tablet') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.tablet = 0;\\n    const healHeld = heldAction(input, 'heal') || input.isDown('KeyQ');\\n    if (this.hp < 20 && this.hp > 0 && consumeAction(input, 'heal')) {\\n910→      this.surgeryT = 4;\\n      this.subtitle = this.lastHurt === 'fire' ? 'THE LIGHTER' : 'HOLD STILL.';\\n    } else if (healHeld && this.syrettes > 0 && this.hp >= 20) {\\n      this.holdT.heal += dt;\\n      if (this.holdT.heal >= 0.8) {\\n        this.syrettes -= 1;\\n        this.hp = Math.min(100, this.hp + 40);\\n        this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'syrette') this.completeStep();\\n      }\",\"content_concise\":\"800→    if (this.rescueT > 0) return;\\n    this.readNeeds(dt, input, bot);\\n    if (this.choice) return;\\n    if (this.map.up && input) {\\n      let dx = input.mouseDelta.x;\\n      let dy = input.mouseDelta.y;\\n      const px = input.pointer?.x || 0;\\n      const py = input.pointer?.y || 0;\\n      if (dx === 0 && dy === 0 && this.map.px != null) {\\n        dx = (px - this.map.px) * 800;\\n810→        dy = (py - this.map.py) * 800;\\n      }\\n      this.map.px = px;\\n      this.map.py = py;\\n      this.map.cx = clamp(this.map.cx + dx * 0.35, -640, 640);\\n      this.map.cz = clamp(this.map.cz - dy * 0.35, -640, 640);\\n    } else if (this.map) {\\n      this.map.px = null;\\n    }\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n820→    const wading = nearRiver(p.x, p.z, 8) && !onBridge(p.x, p.z);\\n    let speed = 5.4;\\n    if (this.crouch) speed = 2;\\n    else if (this.walk) speed = 3.6;\\n    const sprinting = this.sprint && this.stamina > 0 && !wading && !this.carrying;\\n    if (sprinting) speed = 7.4;\\n    if (wading) speed = 2.7;\\n    if (this.carrying) speed *=