{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_296","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Merc damage logic applies damageActor to mercs during rounds, using hurtSeat.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-26987f4a-3c1f-4cbe-97a5-8b5072a514ca-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/round.js","limit":220}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1622,"output_tokens":202,"cache_read_input_tokens":66048,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"69c068fe-bf8e-467e-81ae-a733de20878f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-26987f4a-3c1f-4cbe-97a5-8b5072a514ca-32","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Cash Run. The host owns the cases, the fire and the downs. */\\n\\nconst SPAWNS = [[80, -220], [220, -360], [40, -400], [260, -250]];\\nconst ROUND_CASES = [\\n  { id: 'r1', x: 120, z: -280, stones: 4 },\\n  { id: 'r2', x: 180, z: -340, stones: 5 },\\n  { id: 'r3', x: 90, z: -360, stones: 3 },\\n  { id: 'r4', x: 200, z: -260, stones: 6 },\\n  { id: 'r5', x: 150, z: -400, stones: 4 },\\n10→  { id: 'r6', x: 250, z: -320, stones: 5 },\\n];\\n\\nexport class CashRound {\\n  constructor(world, session) {\\n    this.world = world;\\n    this.session = session;\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.limit = 360;\\n    this.localDown = false;\\n20→    this.finished = false;\\n    this.truck = { x: 150, z: -160 };\\n    this.cases = ROUND_CASES.map((c) => ({ ...c, taken: false, carrier: null }));\\n    const players = session.players || [];\\n    this.seats = players.map((p, i) => ({\\n      id: p.id,\\n      name: String(p.name || 'MERC').toUpperCase().replace(/[^A-Z0-9 .,:;!?'\\\"+=/()[\\\\]%_#&*@<>|\\\\\\\\~^$`-]/g, ''),\\n      color: p.color,\\n      hp: 100,\\n      stones: 0,\\n30→      carrying: null,\\n      down: false,\\n      bleed: 25,\\n      revives: 0,\\n      kills: 0,\\n      lit: 0,\\n      downs: 0,\\n      ai: session.kind === 'hub' ? false : p.id !== session.me,\\n      x: SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][0],\\n      z: SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][1],\\n40→      yaw: Math.PI,\\n      reviveT: 0,\\n      actor: null,\\n    }));\\n    this.me = session.server ? null : session.me;\\n    world.mission = null;\\n    world.buddies = [];\\n    world.guns = [];\\n    world.giveGun('cane', 100);\\n    world.giveGun('flare', 100);\\n50→    world.giveGun('tractor', 70);\\n    world.syrettes = 2;\\n    world.tablets = 0;\\n    world.feverT = 99999;\\n    world.feverOn = false;\\n    world.hour = 16;\\n    world.windPin = { dir: 0.4, speed: 5 };\\n    const mine = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (mine) world.teleport(mine.x, mine.z);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\\n60→      world.spawnSoldier({ x: 130 + (i % 4) * 14, z: -300 - Math.floor(i / 4) * 12, faction: i % 2 ? 'harvest' : 'concord' });\\n    }\\n    for (const s of this.seats) {\\n      if (s.id === this.me) continue;\\n      const actor = world.spawnSoldier({ id: 'merc-' + s.id, x: s.x, z: s.z, faction: 'merc' });\\n      actor.kind = 'merc';\\n      actor.seat = s.id;\\n      actor.hp = 100;\\n      s.actor = actor;\\n    }\\n70→  }\\n\\n  seat(id) {\\n    return this.seats.find((s) => s.id === id) || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  noteDown() {\\n    const s = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    this.downSeat(s);\\n80→    this.localDown = true;\\n    this.world.hp = 0;\\n    this.world.dead = false;\\n  }\\n\\n  downSeat(s) {\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    s.down = true;\\n    s.hp = 0;\\n    s.downs += 1;\\n90→    s.bleed = 25;\\n    s.reviveT = 0;\\n    if (s.carrying) this.drop(s);\\n    if (s.actor) s.actor.hp = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  drop(s) {\\n    const c = this.cases.find((item) => item.id === s.carrying);\\n    if (c) {\\n      c.carrier = null;\\n100→      c.x = s.x;\\n      c.z = s.z;\\n    }\\n    s.carrying = null;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) this.world.carrying = null;\\n  }\\n\\n  hurtSeat(id, dmg) {\\n    const s = this.seat(id);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n110→    s.hp = Math.max(0, s.hp - dmg);\\n    if (s.actor) s.actor.hp = s.hp;\\n    if (s.hp <= 0) {\\n      this.downSeat(s);\\n      if (s.id === this.me) {\\n        this.localDown = true;\\n        this.world.hp = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n120→\\n  revive(s, by) {\\n    s.down = false;\\n    s.hp = 60;\\n    s.bleed = 25;\\n    s.reviveT = 0;\\n    if (s.actor) {\\n      s.actor.hp = 60;\\n      s.actor.alive = true;\\n    }\\n130→    if (by) by.revives += 1;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) {\\n      this.localDown = false;\\n      this.world.hp = 60;\\n      this.world.dead = false;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  respawn(s) {\\n    const i = this.seats.indexOf(s);\\n140→    s.x = SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][0];\\n    s.z = SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][1];\\n    this.revive(s, null);\\n    s.hp = 100;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) {\\n      this.world.hp = 100;\\n      this.world.teleport(s.x, s.z);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n150→  tryUse(world) {\\n    const s = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return false;\\n    const p = world.feet();\\n    const input = world.ctx.input;\\n    const held = input.isDown('KeyE') || input.isDown('PadSquare');\\n    if (s.carrying && Math.hypot(this.truck.x - p.x, this.truck.z - p.z) < 6) {\\n      const c = this.cases.find((item) => item.id === s.carrying);\\n      const stones = c ? c.stones : 1;\\n      s.stones += stones;\\n160→      world.stones += stones;\\n      world.ledger.stonesEarned += stones;\\n      if (c) {\\n        c.taken = true;\\n        c.carrier = null;\\n      }\\n      s.carrying = null;\\n      world.carrying = null;\\n      return true;\\n    }\\n170→    for (const other of this.seats) {\\n      if (other.id === s.id || !other.down) continue;\\n      if (Math.hypot(other.x - p.x, other.z - p.z) < 3 && held) {\\n        other.reviveT += 1 / 60;\\n        if (other.reviveT >= 3) this.revive(other, s);\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!s.carrying) {\\n      const c = this.cases.find((item) => !item.taken && item.carrier == null && Math.hypot(item.x - p.x, item.z - p.z) < 2.6);\\n180→      if (c) {\\n        c.carrier = s.id;\\n        s.carrying = c.id;\\n        world.carrying = c;\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n190→  think(s, dt) {\\n    if (s.down) {\\n      s.bleed -= dt;\\n      if (s.bleed <= 0) this.respawn(s);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const downed = this.seats.find((o) => o.down && Math.hypot(o.x - s.x, o.z - s.z) < 18);\\n    let tx = this.truck.x;\\n    let tz = this.truck.z;\\n    if (downed) {\\n200→      tx = downed.x;\\n      tz = downed.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(tx - s.x, tz - s.z) < 2.2) {\\n        downed.reviveT += dt;\\n        if (downed.reviveT >= 3) this.revive(downed, s);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n    } else if (!s.carrying) {\\n      let best = null;\\n      let bd = 1e9;\\n210→      for (const c of this.cases) {\\n        if (c.taken || c.carrier != null) continue;\\n        const d = Math.hypot(c.x - s.x, c.z - s.z);\\n        if (d < bd) {\\n          bd = d;\\n          best = c;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      if (best && bd < 2.4) {\\n        best.carrier = s.id;\\n220→        s.carrying = best.id;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Cash Run. The host owns the cases, the fire and the downs. */\\n\\nconst SPAWNS = [[80, -220], [220, -360], [40, -400], [260, -250]];\\nconst ROUND_CASES = [\\n  { id: 'r1', x: 120, z: -280, stones: 4 },\\n  { id: 'r2', x: 180, z: -340, stones: 5 },\\n  { id: 'r3', x: 90, z: -360, stones: 3 },\\n  { id: 'r4', x: 200, z: -260, stones: 6 },\\n  { id: 'r5', x: 150, z: -400, stones: 4 },\\n10→  { id: 'r6', x: 250, z: -320, stones: 5 },\\n];\\n\\nexport class CashRound {\\n  constructor(world, session) {\\n    this.world = world;\\n    this.session = session;\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.limit = 360;\\n    this.localDown = false;\\n20→    this.finished = false;\\n    this.truck = { x: 150, z: -160 };\\n    this.cases = ROUND_CASES.map((c) => ({ ...c, taken: false, carrier: null }));\\n    const players = session.players || [];\\n    this.seats = players.map((p, i) => ({\\n      id: p.id,\\n      name: String(p.name || 'MERC').toUpperCase().replace(/[^A-Z0-9 .,:;!?'\\\"+=/()[\\\\]%_#&*@<>|\\\\\\\\~^$`-]/g, ''),\\n      color: p.color,\\n      hp: 100,\\n      stones: 0,\\n30→      carrying: null,\\n      down: false,\\n      bleed: 25,\\n      revives: 0,\\n      kills: 0,\\n      lit: 0,\\n      downs: 0,\\n      ai: session.kind === 'hub' ? false : p.id !== session.me,\\n      x: SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][0],\\n      z: SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][1],\\n40→      yaw: Math.PI,\\n      reviveT: 0,\\n      actor: null,\\n    }));\\n    this.me = session.server ? null : session.me;\\n    world.mission = null;\\n    world.buddies = [];\\n    world.guns = [];\\n    world.giveGun('cane', 100);\\n    world.giveGun('flare', 100);\\n50→    world.giveGun('tractor', 70);\\n    world.syrettes = 2;\\n    world.tablets = 0;\\n    world.feverT = 99999;\\n    world.feverOn = false;\\n    world.hour = 16;\\n    world.windPin = { dir: 0.4, speed: 5 };\\n    const mine = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (mine) world.teleport(mine.x, mine.z);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\\n60→      world.spawnSoldier({ x: 130 + (i % 4) * 14, z: -300 - Math.floor(i / 4) * 12, faction: i % 2 ? 'harvest' : 'concord' });\\n    }\\n    for (const s of this.seats) {\\n      if (s.id === this.me) continue;\\n      const actor = world.spawnSoldier({ id: 'merc-' + s.id, x: s.x, z: s.z, faction: 'merc' });\\n      actor.kind = 'merc';\\n      actor.seat = s.id;\\n      actor.hp = 100;\\n      s.actor = actor;\\n    }\\n70→  }\\n\\n  seat(id) {\\n    return this.seats.find((s) => s.id === id) || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  noteDown() {\\n    const s = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    this.downSeat(s);\\n80→    this.localDown = true;\\n    this.world.hp = 0;\\n    this.world.dead = false;\\n  }\\n\\n  downSeat(s) {\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    s.down = true;\\n    s.hp = 0;\\n    s.downs += 1;\\n90→    s.bleed = 25;\\n    s.reviveT = 0;\\n    if (s.carrying) this.drop(s);\\n    if (s.actor) s.actor.hp = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  drop(s) {\\n    const c = this.cases.find((item) => item.id === s.carrying);\\n    if (c) {\\n      c.carrier = null;\\n100→      c.x = s.x;\\n      c.z = s.z;\\n    }\\n    s.carrying = null;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) this.world.carrying = null;\\n  }\\n\\n  hurtSeat(id, dmg) {\\n    const s = this.seat(id);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n110→    s.hp = Math.max(0, s.hp - dmg);\\n    if (s.actor) s.actor.hp = s.hp;\\n    if (s.hp <= 0) {\\n      this.downSeat(s);\\n      if (s.id === this.me) {\\n        this.localDown = true;\\n        this.world.hp = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n120→\\n  revive(s, by) {\\n    s.down = false;\\n    s.hp = 60;\\n    s.bleed = 25;\\n    s.reviveT = 0;\\n    if (s.actor) {\\n      s.actor.hp = 60;\\n      s.actor.alive = true;\\n    }\\n130→    if (by) by.revives += 1;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) {\\n      this.localDown = false;\\n      this.world.hp = 60;\\n      this.world.dead = false;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  respawn(s) {\\n    const i = this.seats.indexOf(s);\\n140→    s.x = SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][0];\\n    s.z = SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][1];\\n    this.revive(s, null);\\n    s.hp = 100;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) {\\n      this.world.hp = 100;\\n      this.world.teleport(s.x, s.z);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n150→  tryUse(world) {\\n    const s = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return false;\\n    const p = world.feet();\\n    const input = world.ctx.input;\\n    const held = input.isDown('KeyE') || input.isDown('PadSquare');\\n    if (s.carrying && Math.hypot(this.truck.x - p.x, this.truck.z - p.z) < 6) {\\n      const c = this.cases.find((item) => item.id === s.carrying);\\n      const stones = c ? c.stones : 1;\\n      s.stones += stones;\\n160→      world.stones += stones;\\n      world.ledger.stonesEarned += stones;\\n      if (c) {\\n        c.taken = true;\\n        c.carrier = null;\\n      }\\n      s.carrying = null;\\n      world.carrying = null;\\n      return true;\\n    }\\n170→    for (const other of this.seats) {\\n      if (other.id === s.id || !other.down) continue;\\n      if (Math.hypot(other.x - p.x, other.z - p.z) < 3 && held) {\\n        other.reviveT += 1 / 60;\\n        if (other.reviveT >= 3) this.revive(other, s);\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!s.carrying) {\\n      const c = this.cases.find((item) => !item.taken && item.carrier == null && Math.hypot(item.x - p.x, item.z - p.z) < 2.6);\\n180→      if (c) {\\n        c.carrier = s.id;\\n        s.carrying = c.id;\\n        world.carrying = c;\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n190→  think(s, dt) {\\n    if (s.down) {\\n      s.bleed -= dt;\\n      if (s.bleed <= 0) this.respawn(s);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const downed = this.seats.find((o) => o.down && Math.hypot(o.x - s.x, o.z - s.z) < 18);\\n    let tx = this.truck.x;\\n    let tz = this.truck.z;\\n    if (downed) {\\n200→      tx = downed.x;\\n      tz = downed.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(tx - s.x, tz - s.z) < 2.2) {\\n        downed.reviveT += dt;\\n        if (downed.reviveT >= 3) this.revive(downed, s);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n    } else if (!s.carrying) {\\n      let best = null;\\n      let bd = 1e9;\\n210→      for (const c of this.cases) {\\n        if (c.taken || c.carrier != null) continue;\\n        const d = Math.hypot(c.x - s.x, c.z - s.z);\\n        if (d < bd) {\\n          bd = d;\\n          best = c;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      if (best && bd < 2.4) {\\n        best.carrier = s.id;\\n220→        s.carrying = best.id;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/round.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":220,\"raw_output\":\"/** Cash Run. The host owns the cases, the fire and the downs. */\\n\\nconst SPAWNS = [[80, -220], [220, -360], [40, -400], [260, -250]];\\nconst ROUND_CASES = [\\n  { id: 'r1', x: 120, z: -280, stones: 4 },\\n  { id: 'r2', x: 180, z: -340, stones: 5 },\\n  { id: 'r3', x: 90, z: -360, stones: 3 },\\n  { id: 'r4', x: 200, z: -260, stones: 6 },\\n  { id: 'r5', x: 150, z: -400, stones: 4 },\\n  { id: 'r6', x: 250, z: -320, stones: 5 },\\n];\\n\\nexport class CashRound {\\n  constructor(world, session) {\\n    this.world = world;\\n    this.session = session;\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.limit = 360;\\n    this.localDown = false;\\n    this.finished = false;\\n    this.truck = { x: 150, z: -160 };\\n    this.cases = ROUND_CASES.map((c) => ({ ...c, taken: false, carrier: null }));\\n    const players = session.players || [];\\n    this.seats = players.map((p, i) => ({\\n      id: p.id,\\n      name: String(p.name || 'MERC').toUpperCase().replace(/[^A-Z0-9 .,:;!?'\\\"+=/()[\\\\]%_#&*@<>|\\\\\\\\~^$`-]/g, ''),\\n      color: p.color,\\n      hp: 100,\\n      stones: 0,\\n      carrying: null,\\n      down: false,\\n      bleed: 25,\\n      revives: 0,\\n      kills: 0,\\n      lit: 0,\\n      downs: 0,\\n      ai: session.kind === 'hub' ? false : p.id !== session.me,\\n      x: SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][0],\\n      z: SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][1],\\n      yaw: Math.PI,\\n      reviveT: 0,\\n      actor: null,\\n    }));\\n    this.me = session.server ? null : session.me;\\n    world.mission = null;\\n    world.buddies = [];\\n    world.guns = [];\\n    world.giveGun('cane', 100);\\n    world.giveGun('flare', 100);\\n    world.giveGun('tractor', 70);\\n    world.syrettes = 2;\\n    world.tablets = 0;\\n    world.feverT = 99999;\\n    world.feverOn = false;\\n    world.hour = 16;\\n    world.windPin = { dir: 0.4, speed: 5 };\\n    const mine = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (mine) world.teleport(mine.x, mine.z);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\\n      world.spawnSoldier({ x: 130 + (i % 4) * 14, z: -300 - Math.floor(i / 4) * 12, faction: i % 2 ? 'harvest' : 'concord' });\\n    }\\n    for (const s of this.seats) {\\n      if (s.id === this.me) continue;\\n      const actor = world.spawnSoldier({ id: 'merc-' + s.id, x: s.x, z: s.z, faction: 'merc' });\\n      actor.kind = 'merc';\\n      actor.seat = s.id;\\n      actor.hp = 100;\\n      s.actor = actor;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  seat(id) {\\n    return this.seats.find((s) => s.id === id) || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  noteDown() {\\n    const s = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    this.downSeat(s);\\n    this.localDown = true;\\n    this.world.hp = 0;\\n    this.world.dead = false;\\n  }\\n\\n  downSeat(s) {\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    s.down = true;\\n    s.hp = 0;\\n    s.downs += 1;\\n    s.bleed = 25;\\n    s.reviveT = 0;\\n    if (s.carrying) this.drop(s);\\n    if (s.actor) s.actor.hp = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  drop(s) {\\n    const c = this.cases.find((item) => item.id === s.carrying);\\n    if (c) {\\n      c.carrier = null;\\n      c.x = s.x;\\n      c.z = s.z;\\n    }\\n    s.carrying = null;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) this.world.carrying = null;\\n  }\\n\\n  hurtSeat(id, dmg) {\\n    const s = this.seat(id);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    s.hp = Math.max(0, s.hp - dmg);\\n    if (s.actor) s.actor.hp = s.hp;\\n    if (s.hp <= 0) {\\n      this.downSeat(s);\\n      if (s.id === this.me) {\\n        this.localDown = true;\\n        this.world.hp = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  revive(s, by) {\\n    s.down = false;\\n    s.hp = 60;\\n    s.bleed = 25;\\n    s.reviveT = 0;\\n    if (s.actor) {\\n      s.actor.hp = 60;\\n      s.actor.alive = true;\\n    }\\n    if (by) by.revives += 1;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) {\\n      this.localDown = false;\\n      this.world.hp = 60;\\n      this.world.dead = false;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  respawn(s) {\\n    const i = this.seats.indexOf(s);\\n    s.x = SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][0];\\n    s.z = SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][1];\\n    this.revive(s, null);\\n    s.hp = 100;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) {\\n      this.world.hp = 100;\\n      this.world.teleport(s.x, s.z);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  tryUse(world) {\\n    const s = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return false;\\n    const p = world.feet();\\n    const input = world.ctx.input;\\n    const held = input.isDown('KeyE') || input.isDown('PadSquare');\\n    if (s.carrying && Math.hypot(this.truck.x - p.x, this.truck.z - p.z) < 6) {\\n      const c = this.cases.find((item) => item.id === s.carrying);\\n      const stones = c ? c.stones : 1;\\n      s.stones += stones;\\n      world.stones += stones;\\n      world.ledger.stonesEarned += stones;\\n      if (c) {\\n        c.taken = true;\\n        c.carrier = null;\\n      }\\n      s.carrying = null;\\n      world.carrying = null;\\n      return true;\\n    }\\n    for (const other of this.seats) {\\n      if (other.id === s.id || !other.down) continue;\\n      if (Math.hypot(other.x - p.x, other.z - p.z) < 3 && held) {\\n        other.reviveT += 1 / 60;\\n        if (other.reviveT >= 3) this.revive(other, s);\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!s.carrying) {\\n      const c = this.cases.find((item) => !item.taken && item.carrier == null && Math.hypot(item.x - p.x, item.z - p.z) < 2.6);\\n      if (c) {\\n        c.carrier = s.id;\\n        s.carrying = c.id;\\n        world.carrying = c;\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  think(s, dt) {\\n    if (s.down) {\\n      s.bleed -= dt;\\n      if (s.bleed <= 0) this.respawn(s);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const downed = this.seats.find((o) => o.down && Math.hypot(o.x - s.x, o.z - s.z) < 18);\\n    let tx = this.truck.x;\\n    let tz = this.truck.z;\\n    if (downed) {\\n      tx = downed.x;\\n      tz = downed.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(tx - s.x, tz - s.z) < 2.2) {\\n        downed.reviveT += dt;\\n        if (downed.reviveT >= 3) this.revive(downed, s);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n    } else if (!s.carrying) {\\n      let best = null;\\n      let bd = 1e9;\\n      for (const c of this.cases) {\\n        if (c.taken || c.carrier != null) continue;\\n        const d = Math.hypot(c.x - s.x, c.z - s.z);\\n        if (d < bd) {\\n          bd = d;\\n          best = c;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      if (best && bd < 2.4) {\\n        best.carrier = s.id;\\n        s.carrying = best.id;\\n\",\"total_lines\":322}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"24a65084-bd21-4e74-a45e-d90e8b2b28fa"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_297","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Running a solo test by calling `game.toTitle()`.\n\nThe solo test now calls `game.startSolo()` and uses `placeFacing` to teleport the player 4 meters ahead of the foe with yaw set to 0. The forward direction correctly targets the enemy. No damage is being applied, so the weapon state is being checked.\n\nThe raycast may miss due to a lingering town truce or merc kind check. The story might have left the player dead with timeScale at zero, though startSolo should recover from that. combat() could be returning early. I also suspect damageActor might fail to reduce merc HP through round.hurtSeat.\n\nThe weapon slot, jam state, and vehicle status are being checked as possible causes for missed shots. A lingering `map.up` flag might also block combat. The story failure on m8 hold is being examined as a potential source of leftover state.\n\nThe hold step is being ruled out as the cause of missed shots. If lines were still present, tickPlayer would return early before combat runs. The hold step should have cleared those lines when it began.\n\nLines are confirmed empty, so they are not blocking combat. The focus is shifting to the combat function and raycast logic. A possible cause for missed shots is that the merc actor moves during the 10-frame hold, while the player re-aims each burst; if the AI shifts the seat position, the raycast would miss the updated target.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-932bacce-3799-4b78-a5f5-fc5fad10fb6f-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"startSolo|function combat|raycast|shots","glob":"**/{game.js,world.js}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2549,"output_tokens":1057,"cache_read_input_tokens":67584,"ca