{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_299","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A critical solo task is being identified.\n\ntoTitle() clears the round state so beginRound() can proceed. Merc spawns are outside town, so they avoid the truce check. A stuck ShiftLeft key leaves sprint active, which blocks all shooting.\n\nrelease() in the story failure catch clears ShiftLeft. The sprint flag should reset on the next frame when readNeeds re-evaluates the shift state.\n\nAnother blocker: an uncleared `choice` field causes `tickPlayer` to return early before combat. The hold step does not clear this field, so a leftover choice from a previous mission would prevent combat from starting.\n\nSolo does not call applySetup, but the story already cleared choice during m8 hold. The solo player therefore starts with no leftover choice or lines. map.up is irrelevant to combat. tickPlayer also exits early if the player is dead and rescueT has expired.\n\nThe solo bug is now clear. If the player dies during m8, `dead` remains true when `startSolo` begins. `tickPlayer` exits early because `dead && rescueT <= 0`, so combat never starts and the merc stays at full health.\n\nThe death during m8 likely comes from fire spreading from the long field burned in m6. The player stands still for 120 seconds, and the fire state is 2 rather than 1.\n\napplySetup resets all fire state and lays scars at the start of m8, so no fire is active when the hold begins. Fever collapse and buddy attacks are ruled out as causes for the death during that hold. The player may not actually die during the hold; another reason for the stuck state must be found.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-56c2e40b-9f60-4c14-aac3-23b01a5109cd-36","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fall|void|hp -=|hurt\\(","glob":"**/world.js","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-56c2e40b-9f60-4c14-aac3-23b01a5109cd-37","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"step\\(n|timeScale|clock\\.scale","glob":"**/pixel-engine.js","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2695,"output_tokens":1967,"cache_read_input_tokens":71424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"88b39a16-6103-4ebe-a623-e7ad5b87acbc"}
