{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_310","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The m2 clear spawns a cage-guard at the ranger-post (42, -170).\n\nThe m2 clear kills the guard. The m8 guard is dead. Civilians do not shoot. A merc from a previous solo run might be the culprit.\n\nStory runs before solo, so no mercs exist yet. The 18 damage equals one soldier. I will add actor positions and seeing flags to the MID log to find the attacker. Ines does not rescue because the guns test left her buddies dead.\n\nThe shared suite has a real bug. applySetup treats deadBuddies as permanent, so the guns test kills ines permanently and prevents her from being alive for m8. The story test only adds dov as dead.\n\nThe shared world state is intentional. The guns test records ines's death as a real action, so the story test cannot simply revive her. A cleanup step that clears deadBuddies after the assertion would be a fake workaround.\n\nThe guns test should remove ines from deadBuddies after its assertion. The story test should also reset deadBuddies before play.\n\nThe guns test will clear ines from deadBuddies after its assertion. The story test will reset deadBuddies at the start of each run. The ledger.friends counter was also incremented by the guns test.\n\nReversing the guns test's death will lower the friends count until dov dies. The hold-phase death is caused by a soldier, not a missing buddy. Even with ines alive, rescue only happens once and restores 40 health for a full day. The soldier keeps shooting, so the player dies again within seconds. A 120-second hold cannot survive that.\n\nThe m1 goto at -200, 30 spawns no soldiers. The hold-phase death is caused by a different actor. I will log actors to find the attacker.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-31e12a36-f52c-4ee7-a073-a622953fccae-51","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"      console.log('MID', id, step.do, 'hold', w.mission.hold.toFixed(2), 'hp', w.hp.toFixed(1),\n        'dead', w.dead, 'mode', game.mode, 'scale', engine.timeScale,\n        'at', p0.x.toFixed(1), p0.z.toFixed(1), 'burn', w.burning, 'god', w.god);","new_string":"      const who = w.actors.filter((a) => a.alive).map((a) => a.kind + '@' + a.x.toFixed(0) + ',' + a.z.toFixed(0) + (a.sees ? '!' : '')).join(' ');\n      const buds = w.buddies.map((b) => b.id + (b.alive ? '' : 'x') + (b.down ? 'd' : '')).join(' ');\n      console.log('MID', id, step.do, 'hold', w.mission.hold.toFixed(2), 'hp', w.hp.toFixed(1),\n        'dead', w.dead, 'mode', game.mode, 'scale', engine.timeScale,\n        'at', p0.x.toFixed(1), p0.z.toFixed(1), 'burn', w.burning, 'god', w.god,\n        'buds', buds, 'who', who);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2352,"output_tokens":1593,"cache_read_input_tokens":86528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"c038db89-1451-4487-a94c-a018c2280a28"}
