{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_317","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`this.ended` remains true after the cash round.\n\n`blocksSim` stops `tickPlayer` when ended, but `update()` still runs with zero delta time. The engine likely does not freeze time on an ended flag. I will check if `freshInput` is the issue and review `trackIdle`.\n\n`trackIdle` adds `dt` to the idle counter only when input is fresh. If `dt` is zero, the counter never reaches ten and attract mode never starts. The test sets the screen but forgets to restore `timeScale`, so the engine remains frozen.\n\nThe engine's `timeScale` setter may not stick while the session is ended. The session object might still be alive after `toTitle` nulls `this.session`, so its timer could fire again and reset `timeScale` to zero.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71ac0fb9-7d20-4683-a95f-d9089c3b873c-67","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function soloSession|emit\\(|on\\('end'|time-up|timeScale","glob":"**/session.js","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3438,"output_tokens":635,"cache_read_input_tokens":100864,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"599dbd3d-a51d-448e-abc5-0d12e4e9e7b1"}
