{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_324","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Damage systems will stop when the simulation is blocked. Round actors will be cleared when returning to the title.\n\nReviving the player prevents a finished round from leaving them dead. The title death occurred because actors were shot before tickActors stopped after blocksSim. Moving the guard up fixes this even if mercenaries remain. Clearing mercenaries on toTitle is still correct for attract mode and the next mission. The mode should not become gameover after the fix. The assert message will be restored to its short version once the test passes. Idle damage of 0.45 means roughly 27 frames before death.\n\nThe title death was caused by real shots after round=null, not just noteDown. toTitle must also set dead false and hp so a downed player is alive on the title screen. Moving blocksSim alone will stop tickActors from shooting on the title, keeping mode at title and preserving attract.\n\nMercenaries will remain during attract mode because god protection keeps them safe. Non-civil actors still need clearing on toTitle to prevent shooting in the attract world. The player's health was zeroed by noteDown but dead was not set, so toTitle must restore a playable body.\n\nThe fire test runs on the title screen before any mission. Fire must still step there for the test to pass. Moving blocksSim before fire.step would break it. Fire and wind will keep stepping while damage ticks are skipped.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ef1a4a8-c7d3-4062-b70e-cb9634c854ea-77","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    this.fire.rain = this.rain;\n    this.fire.step(dt);\n    this.tickFever(dt);\n    this.tickBurn(dt);\n    this.tickRegen(dt);\n    this.tickActors(dt);\n    this.tickBuddies(dt);\n    this.tickPosts();\n    if (this.game.blocksSim()) return;\n    this.tickPlayer(dt);\n    this.tickMission(dt);\n    if (this.round) this.round.tick(dt);\n    if ((this.clock * 2) % 1 < dt) this.refreshMap();","new_string":"    this.fire.rain = this.rain;\n    this.fire.step(dt);\n    if (this.game.blocksSim()) return;\n    this.tickFever(dt);\n    this.tickBurn(dt);\n    this.tickRegen(dt);\n    this.tickActors(dt);\n    this.tickBuddies(dt);\n    this.tickPosts();\n    this.tickPlayer(dt);\n    this.tickMission(dt);\n    if (this.round) this.round.tick(dt);\n    if ((this.clock * 2) % 1 < dt) this.refreshMap();"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ef1a4a8-c7d3-4062-b70e-cb9634c854ea-78","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","old_string":"    this.session = null;\n    this.round = null;\n    if (this.world) this.world.round = null;","new_string":"    this.session = null;\n    this.round = null;\n    this.ended = false;\n    if (this.world) {\n      this.world.round = null;\n      this.world.actors = this.world.actors.filter((a) => a.kind === 'civil');\n      this.world.dead = false;\n      this.world.rescueT = 0;\n      this.world.surgeryT = 0;\n      if (this.world.hp <= 0) this.world.hp = 40;\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ef1a4a8-c7d3-4062-b70e-cb9634c854ea-79","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  engine.step(600, DT);\n  assert(!game.attract && game.idle < 10.01, 'attract early ' + game.idle + ' ended ' + game.ended + ' scale ' + engine.timeScale + ' mode ' + game.mode + ' screen ' + game.screen + ' session ' + !!game.session);\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n  assert(game.attract && game.state().attract, 'attract did not start idle ' + game.idle + ' ended ' + game.ended + ' scale ' + engine.timeScale + ' mode ' + game.mode + ' screen ' + game.screen);","new_string":"  engine.step(600, DT);\n  assert(!game.attract && game.idle < 10.01, 'attract early ' + game.idle);\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n  assert(game.attract && game.state().attract, 'attract did not start');"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1201,"output_tokens":1694,"cache_read_input_tokens":112640,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"b679176e-8f70-44aa-b088-289bc558790e"}
