6,104,105,115,46,95,103,101,116,66,108,101,110,100,70,97,99,116,111,114,40,114,41,44,100,115,116,70,97,99,116,111,114,58,116,104,105,115,46,95,103,101,116,66,108,101,110,100,70,97,99,116,111,114,40,115,41,44,111,112,101,114,97,116,105,111,110,58,116,104,105,115,46,95,103,101,116,66,108,101,110,100,79,112,101,114,97,116,105,111,110,40,99,41,125,125,101,108,115,101,123,108,101,116,32,105,61,101,46,112,114,101,109,117,108,116,105,112,108,105,101,100,65,108,112,104,97,44,97,61,40,101,44,114,44,105,44,97,41,61,62,123,116,61,123,115,114,99,70,97,99,116,111,114,58,101,44,100,115,116,70,97,99,116,111,114,58,114,44,111,112,101,114,97,116,105,111,110,58,65,80,46,65,100,100,125,44,110,61,123,115,114,99,70,97,99,116,111,114,58,105,44,100,115,116,70,97,99,116,111,114,58,97,44,111,112,101,114,97,116,105,111,110,58,65,80,46,65,100,100,125,125,59,105,102,40,105,41,115,119,105,116,99,104,40,114,41,123,99,97,115,101,32,49,58,97,40,107,80,46,79,110,101,44,107,80,46,79,110,101,77,105,110,117,115,83,114,99,65,108,112,104,97,44,107,80,46,79,110,101,44,107,80,46,79,110,101,77,105,110,117,115,83,114,99,65,108,112,104,97,41,59,98,114,101,97,107,59,32,91,46,46,46,32,116,114,117,110,99,97,116,101,100,32,40,49,48,51,53,32,99,104,97,114,115,32,116,111,116,97,108,41,93,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":37,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/GUIDE.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":517,\"content\":\"Each recipe is a whole game, built into the kit as `examples/<name>.html`. Steal from them.\"},{\"line_number\":1059,\"content\":\"node check.mjs examples/side-scroller.html --cameras --looks noir,handheld\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/LIBRARY.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"Every built-in model (`MODEL_LIBRARY`, 151) and texture (`TEXTURE_LIBRARY`, 126) by family, then every imported pack (575 models, 264 textures in `packs/`), generated from the defs. A model's variants (`rock-large-a` … `-f`) share a row. Search it; don't read it whole.\"},{\"line_number\":354,\"content\":\"76 models, 0 textures, CC0-1.0 by Kenney (https://kenney.nl/assets/castle-kit). Load it: `const kit = await loadPack('packs/kenney-castle.json')`, then `buildModel(id, { catalog: kit })`.\"},{\"line_number\":437,\"content\":\"140 models, 0 textures, CC0-1.0 by Kenney (https://kenney.nl/assets/furniture-kit). Load it: `const kit = await loadPack('packs/kenney-furniture.json')`, then `buildModel(id, { catalog: kit })`.\"},{\"line_number\":584,\"content\":\"30 models, 0 textures, CC0-1.0 by Kenney (https://kenney.nl/assets/mini-dungeon). Load it: `const kit = await loadPack('packs/kenney-mini-dungeon.json')`, then `buildModel(id, { catalog: kit })`.\"},{\"line_number\":621,\"content\":\"329 models, 0 textures, CC0-1.0 by Kenney (https://kenney.nl/assets/nature-kit). Load it: `const kit = await loadPack('packs/kenney-nature.json')`, then `buildModel(id, { catalog: kit })`.\"},{\"line_number\":879,\"content\":\"0 models, 132 textures, CC0-1.0 by Kenney (https://kenney.nl/assets/tiny-dungeon). Load it: `const kit = await loadPack('packs/kenney-tiny-dungeon.json', { textures: TEXTURE_LIBRARY })`, then `buildModel(id, { catalog: kit })` and `hudSprite(id)` / `textureMap(id)`.\"},{\"line_number\":1018,\"content\":\"0 models, 132 textures, CC0-1.0 by Kenney (https://kenney.nl/assets/tiny-town). Load it: `const kit = await loadPack('packs/kenney-tiny-town.json', { textures: TEXTURE_LIBRARY })`, then `buildModel(id, { catalog: kit })` and `hudSprite(id)` / `textureMap(id)`.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/examples/market-models.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\"// examples/market-models.js` can draw them.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/ASSETS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"packs (`library.json` holds the same as data), `check.mjs --sheets` draws what you write, and `examples/market.html` is a scene built this way\"},{\"line_number\":165,\"content\":\"- **Packs** (`packs/`, listed in `packs/index.json` and LIBRARY.md): kits by other artists,\"},{\"line_number\":166,\"content\":\"  imported into this format and palette. `const kit = await loadPack('packs/<id>.json',\"},{\"line_number\":174,\"content\":\"Market Corner, the kit's `examples/market.html`: library models (one re-coloured, three with\"},{\"line_number\":176,\"content\":\"the game's own in a module of its own. `node check.mjs examples/market.html` plays it;\"},{\"line_number\":177,\"content\":\"`node check.mjs --sheets examples/market-models.js` draws its stall.\"},{\"line_number\":181,\"content\":\"// examples/market-models.js` can draw them.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/CHANGELOG.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":222,\"content\":\"The kit carries its first imported packs (`packs/`, listed in `packs/index.json`, LIBRARY.md and\"},{\"line_number\":231,\"content\":\"  `const kit = await loadPack('packs/kenney-nature.json')`, then\"},{\"line_number\":235,\"content\":\"  tile are marked). `await loadPack('packs/kenney-tiny-town.json', { textures: TEXTURE_LIBRARY })`,\"},{\"line_number\":251,\"content\":\"- **Packs hold textures:** a pack file (`packs/<id>.json`) can carry `textures` beside its models\"},{\"line_number\":256,\"content\":\"- **The pack index:** `loadPackIndex(url = 'packs/index.json')` lists the packs a site carries\"},{\"line_number\":270,\"content\":\"- `packs/`: the imported packs (`packs/index.json` lists them), and CREDITS.md credits each one's\"},{\"line_number\":296,\"content\":\"  (`examples/market.html`, and `examples/market-models.js`, the game's own models): library\"},{\"line_number\":407,\"content\":\"  (`public/packs/<pack>.json`), fetched at runtime the way `loadModel` fetches a GLB and never\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/check.mjs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\"//   node check.mjs examples/looks.html   any page (served from the folder that holds pixel-engine.js)\"},{\"line_number\":441,\"content\":\"  // Serve from the folder that holds pixel-engine.js (so examples/x.html can import\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/API.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2854,\"content\":\"Reads an asset's bytes by its path (`assets/hero.glb`, `packs/kenney-nature.json`). Set one with\"},{\"line_number\":3028,\"content\":\"Load a pack of imported models and textures (`public/packs/<pack>.json`, docs/assets/importing.md\"},{\"line_number\":3031,\"content\":\"every `packs/<id>.json` path the built code names, cut to the models it names), counted by\"},{\"line_number\":3040,\"content\":\"function loadPackIndex(url = 'packs/index.json'): Promise<PackIndex>\"},{\"line_number\":3043,\"content\":\"The packs a site carries (`public/packs/index.json`, written by the importers): each pack's\"},{\"line_number\":3045,\"content\":\"and author. Load one with `loadPack(new URL(entry.file, indexUrl))`, or `packs/<file>`.\"},{\"line_number\":3252,\"content\":\"One line of `public/packs/index.json`: a pack, what it holds and where it came from.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"| `examples/` | The guides' other recipes as pages (`side-scroller`, `top-down`, `looks`, `market`) and the modules they import (`market-models.js`) |\"},{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"| `packs/` | Imported packs (`packs/index.json` lists them): `loadPack('packs/<id>.json')` |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/pixel-engine.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":543,\"content\":\"`);for(let r of e.messages){let e=r.lineNum>0?` at line ${r.lineNum}${r.linePos>0?`:${r.linePos}`:``}`:``,a=`WebGPURenderer [${t} / ${n.stage} ${r.type}]${e}: ${r.message}`,o=``;r.lineNum>0&&r.lineNum<=i.length&&(o=`\\\\n  ${i[r.lineNum-1]}`,r.linePos>0&&(o+=`\\\\n  ${` `.repeat(r.linePos-1)}^`)),(r.type===`error`?E:T)(a+o)}}}_getBlending(e){let t,n,r=e.blending,i=e.blendSrc,a=e.blendDst,o=e.blendEquation;if(r===5){let r=e.blendSrcAlpha===null?i:e.blendSrcAlpha,s=e.blendDstAlpha===null?a:e.blendDstAlpha,c=e.blendEquationAlpha===null?o:e.blendEquationAlpha;t={srcFactor:this._getBlendFactor(i),dstFactor:this._getBlendFactor(a),operation:this._getBlendOperation(o)},n={srcFactor:this._getBlendFactor(r),dstFactor:this._getBlendFactor(s),operation:this._getBlendOperation(c)}}else{let i=e.premultipliedAlpha,a=(e,r,i,a)=>{t={srcFactor:e,dstFactor:r,operation:AP.Add},n={srcFactor:i,dstFactor:a,operation:AP.Add}};if(i)switch(r){case 1:a(kP.One,kP.OneMinusSrcAlpha,kP.One,kP.OneMinusSrcAlpha);break;case [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d584ea99-2416-49dd-9cef-33ffb7b3b1b9-94","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Credits (Pixel Engine 0.46.0)\\n\\nWhat this kit carries and where it came from, generated by `npm run bundle` from each built-in model's and texture's `source` (the data the engine repository's `npm run model -- credits` reads) and from the bundled packages' own licence files. Ship this file with a game built on the kit.\\n\\n## Models and textures\\n\\n- **The engine's own work**, made in its repository: 151 of the 151 library models (`MODEL_LIBRARY`), 126 of the 126 textures (`TEXTURE_LIBRARY`) and the built-in models (`assets/coin.glb`, `assets/hero.glb`, `assets/tree.glb`). Nothing to credit.\\n- **kenney-castle** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/castle-kit/a395102d20-1711543616/kenney_castle-kit.zip. Models: kenney-castle/bridge-draw, kenney-castle/bridge-straight-pillar, kenney-castle/bridge-straight, kenney-castle/door, kenney-castle/flag-banner-long, kenney-castle/flag-banner-short, kenney-castle/flag-pennant, kenney-castle/flag-wide, kenney-castle/flag, kenney-castle/gate, kenney-castle/ground-hills, kenney-castle/ground, kenney-castle/metal-gate, kenney-castle/rocks-large, kenney-castle/rocks-small, kenney-castle/siege-ballista-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-ballista, kenney-castle/siege-catapult-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-catapult, kenney-castle/siege-ram-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-ram, kenney-castle/siege-tower-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-tower, kenney-castle/siege-trebuchet-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-trebuchet, kenney-castle/stairs-stone-square, kenney-castle/stairs-stone, kenney-castle/tower-base, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-base, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-mid, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-roof-secondary, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-roof, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-top-wood, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-top, kenney-castle/tower-slant-roof, kenney-castle/tower-square-arch, kenney-castle/tower-square-base-border, kenney-castle/tower-square-base-color, kenney-castle/tower-square-base, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid-color, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid-door, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid-open-simple, kenney-castle/tower-