{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_334","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing the files now. I'll also check the hub harness briefly to understand the wait condition during the build.\n\nAvoiding forbidden words like \"placeholder\" in the files. Writing build.mjs with the exact replace pattern from the plan, using the work folder as the output path.\n\nConfirmed the build script path resolves to the work folder. The esbuild command must run from the dev folder so src/main.js resolves correctly.\n\nThe build script will run esbuild from the dev folder with a 512MB buffer. The HTML template will inject the session into a script tag, escaping any `</script>` tags. Hub metadata will be copied exactly from index.html. A console log will show bytes written. The build may take a while and produce a 6–15MB file. Afterward, tests will be rerun to verify the about.js change.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e13e5cbe-7af4-4577-8101-661ca76d4a2e-102","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"dataset.complete|__hubCheck|game=","glob":"vendor/hub/*","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e13e5cbe-7af4-4577-8101-661ca76d4a2e-103","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tools/build.mjs","old_string":"","new_string":"/** Pack one HTML file that boots from file://. Run from the dev folder: node tools/build.mjs */\nimport { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nimport { dirname, join } from 'node:path';\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\n\nconst dev = dirname(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)));\nconst OUT = join(dirname(dev), 'A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html');\n\nconst js = execFileSync('esbuild', [\n  'src/main.js',\n  '--bundle',\n  '--format=esm',\n  '--target=esnext',\n  '--legal-comments=inline',\n  '--log-level=warning',\n], { cwd: dev, maxBuffer: 1 << 29 }).toString();\n\nconst session = readFileSync(join(dev, 'vendor', 'session.js'), 'utf8');\nconst hide = (text) => text.replace(/<\\/script/gi, '<\\\\/script');\n\nconst html = `<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<script>${hide(session)}</script>\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"shared-world\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"6\">\n<meta name=\"hub:webgpu\" content=\"required\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Carry the most diamond cases out of the burning mine\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Stick/WASD move, R2/mouse fire, Square/E use, carry cases to the truck\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>A Cry Too Far</title>\n</head><body><div id=\"app\"></div><script type=\"module\">${hide(js)}</script></body></html>\n`;\n\nconst credits = readFileSync(join(dev, 'CREDITS.md'), 'utf8').replace(/-->/g, '--&gt;');\nwriteFileSync(OUT, html + '\\n<!--\\n' + credits + '\\n-->\\n');\nconsole.log('wrote ' + OUT + ' ' + (html.length + credits.length) + ' chars');\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e13e5cbe-7af4-4577-8101-661ca76d4a2e-104","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/about.js","old_string":"export const TESTING_FEEDBACK = [\n  ['TESTING FEEDBACK', 'How many issues did testing catch?', 'See the count written after the run.', 'The number is filled in ISSUES and here.'],\n  ['CRITICAL ISSUES', 'How many would be game breaking?', 'Filled after the run.'],\n  ['MOST HELPFUL TEST', 'The headless mission playthrough.', 'It drives the shipped actions.'],\n  ['LEAST HELPFUL TEST', 'A blank WebGPU screenshot.', 'State checks told the truth.'],\n];","new_string":"export const TESTING_FEEDBACK = [\n  ['TESTING FEEDBACK', 'How many issues did testing catch?', '11. Listed in tests/ISSUES.md.'],\n  ['CRITICAL ISSUES', 'How many would be game breaking?', '11. Each one stopped a required path.'],\n  ['MOST HELPFUL TEST', 'node tests/run.mjs --all.', 'One shared engine showed the leaks.'],\n  ['LEAST HELPFUL TEST', 'A blank WebGPU screenshot.', 'The state read is the proof.'],\n];"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e13e5cbe-7af4-4577-8101-661ca76d4a2e-105","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md","old_string":"","new_string":"# Issues testing caught\n\n11 game-breaking defects. Each one stopped a path the suite has to finish. The fixes are in the shipped game.\n\n1. A mouse click counted as a controller, so the touch gate closed and the title's first item opened the menu instead of Settings.\n2. Attract left the player in the truck, in god mode, with the map up. The next mission inherited that and could not walk.\n3. A truck that already existed stayed at the attract spawn, so the clinic enter failed.\n4. Returning to the title left the solo session attached, so attract never started.\n5. Mission setup left earlier soldiers alive. One of them killed the player during the train hold.\n6. Cash Run did not revive a dead player, so friendly fire never left the gun.\n7. The title still ran soldier damage. Mercs from a finished round opened the death screen and froze the clock, so attract could not start.\n8. The flare's click dismissed the ending card on the same frame.\n9. The last burn sat on ground that cannot burn, so the ending mission could not finish. Completion now accepts fresh flame inside the radius.\n10. The payroll case was hidden on the convoy, so the shots that stopped the truck destroyed the case too.\n11. A random jam cleared the scripted jam count, so the scripted jam never arrived.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":656,"output_tokens":1984,"cache_read_input_tokens":152704,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"0d338291-e145-45c5-8352-9552d54fbf3f"}
