{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_340","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"callReady(t) is called for both start and headless modes.\n\nWriting a Playwright launch script for the scratch directory. HTML paths with spaces require URL encoding.\n\nDefining Chromium launch flags for WebGPU and SwiftShader. The launchOnce function opens a headless browser at 1920x1080 and captures console logs and page errors.\n\nThe script also captures failed requests. It navigates to the HTML file and waits for the game state to load. Then it evaluates page state including title, AIHub status, and game state.\n\nThe script also reads `__PIXEL_ENGINE__.errors`. WebGPU warnings are acceptable, but actual console errors and page errors will fail the run. Terrain boot may take up to 60 seconds. `__GAME__` is assigned after setup completes.\n\nThe script will also read `game.ctx.engine.errors` and save all logs as JSON. For touch testing, the iPhone 14 device object is being spread into `newContext`, with `defaultBrowserType` removed to avoid passing an unknown option.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-370a4818-71e5-4d14-abec-c930975fdc3f-113","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function touchGateActive|matchMedia|ontouch","glob":"**/*.js","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1355,"output_tokens":977,"cache_read_input_tokens":163584,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"82d9e1ad-0bc7-4cb7-8b17-795499b577da"}
