{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_350","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both launches passed. The title is correct. AIHub.active is false. No errors occurred.\n\nTouch input opened the settings menu. The phone page likely generates phantom input, preventing attract mode from starting. Playwright mobile may be sending pointer events that reset idle time.\n\nThe 20-second wait may be too short. If the engine caps delta time at 1/60, 20 frames equals only 2 seconds of idle time. That would prevent attract mode from starting.\n\nThe headless test forces time with capped delta. The browser runs at roughly 1 fps on software WebGPU. I need to check whether the engine uses uncapped real-time delta. If it does, 10 wall seconds equals 10 game seconds even at low frame rates.\n\nIf delta time is capped at 0.05 seconds, one frame per second yields only 0.05 seconds of idle time per wall second. Reaching the 10-second attract threshold would require roughly 200 wall seconds. This explains why the phone test failed despite the verification claiming attract is not blocked.\n\nI will re-run only the phone test and log idle, frame count, and timeScale over 15 seconds. If idle climbs, I will wait until it reaches 10 seconds. If idle stays at zero, phantom input is resetting it. I also need to check whether the touch gate disables attract and whether freshInput is active.\n\nI will skip relaunching the desktop boots. The phone probe will run alone. If attract starts within 90 seconds, I will update touch.log with success. The previous log shows attract is still false, which would fail the gate. I am checking whether Playwright's touch emulation or the page's pointer is injecting phantom input. I also noticed that passing `touch: false` does not prevent the engine from creating touch controls if `wanted()` returns true.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fabbbadf-4889-4f23-9805-cc792a7c4788-123","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/phone.mjs","old_string":"","new_string":"import { createRequire } from 'node:module';\nimport { pathToFileURL } from 'node:url';\nconst require = createRequire('/home/micha/dev/my-3d2dge/package.json');\nconst { chromium, devices } = require('playwright');\nconst url = pathToFileURL('/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html').href;\nconst flags = ['--enable-unsafe-webgpu','--enable-features=Vulkan','--use-vulkan=swiftshader','--use-angle=swiftshader','--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader'];\nconst phone = devices['iPhone 14'];\nconst browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true, args: flags });\nconst context = await browser.newContext({\n  viewport: phone.viewport,\n  userAgent: phone.userAgent,\n  deviceScaleFactor: phone.deviceScaleFactor,\n  isMobile: phone.isMobile,\n  hasTouch: phone.hasTouch,\n});\nconst page = await context.newPage();\npage.on('console', (msg) => { if (msg.type() === 'error') console.log('ERR', msg.text()); });\npage.on('pageerror', (err) => console.log('PAGE', err.message));\nawait page.goto(url, { waitUntil: 'load', timeout: 90000 });\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__ && window.__GAME__.state, null, { timeout: 90000 });\nconst samples = [];\nfor (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\n  await page.waitForTimeout(2000);\n  const s = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const g = window.__GAME__;\n    return { idle: g.idle, attract: g.attract, mode: g.mode, screen: g.screen, frame: g.frame, scale: g.ctx?.engine?.timeScale, notice: g.notice, touch: g.touchGate };\n  });\n  samples.push(s);\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(s));\n  if (s.attract) break;\n}\nawait browser.close();\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":756,"output_tokens":1584,"cache_read_input_tokens":171904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"ac7da68d-e5c2-415f-bb92-206cb8fb8871"}
