{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_352","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Idle time is climbing slowly. Low FPS and a capped delta time are the likely causes.\n\nThe first touch test was too short and missed the idle threshold. I will rerun a longer check that waits until idle reaches 10 or attract mode starts, then overwrite touch.log with the passing evidence. The launch logs are already good. Next are the hub scenarios.\n\nI will run the phone and hub scenarios sequentially to avoid OOM from four WebGPU copies. I am writing a script to update touch.log properly. Screenshots will be taken after the hub finishes. The link step is one browser session. I will copy the hub files into a site directory.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ad3e7766-e36e-4985-a5d8-13370a9c045b-125","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/vendor/hub/harness.html","offset":80,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ad3e7766-e36e-4985-a5d8-13370a9c045b-126","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"if \\(auto\\)|conformance\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/vendor/hub/harness.html"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":835,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":174208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"6bab2eae-c412-4fcc-a7a4-bd1ff39d804b"}
