{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_354","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hello check requires a 10-second wait plus an additional 1-second wait.\n\nParallel terrain boots could exceed 11 seconds. Hello is sent before Engine.start, so it should arrive before the heavy terrain build.\n\nReady() fires after setup, so the 20-second timeout begins only after hello. The first boot took roughly 8–10 seconds including terrain, meaning four parallel boots might exceed the ready deadline. Next is the phone script and then the hub. A script will wait for attract mode, tap settings, and write touch.log.\n\nThe screenshots plan comes next. A link test using two file:// pages and BroadcastChannel will run after the hub is ready. The hub directory can be prepared in parallel with the phone script, since copying files is fast and does not use a browser. The site directory will contain game.html, harness.html, bridge.js, round.js, and session.js.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ceff349-db81-45c3-bdaa-481c4ccb00e2-128","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nSITE=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/.site\"\nmkdir -p \"$SITE\"\ncp \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html\" \"$SITE/game.html\"\ncp \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/vendor/hub/harness.html\" \"$SITE/harness.html\"\ncp \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/vendor/hub/bridge.js\" \"$SITE/bridge.js\"\ncp \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__2