{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_358","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All four hub tests passed. The touch test also passed.\n\nLaunches and tests passed. Next steps include a link test across file:// pages, screenshots after ten seconds, optional webkit logs, exit-interview.json, PROGRESS.md, and checklist flips. The link feature may be cut if BroadcastChannel fails across file://. A playwright script will verify round sharing before deciding.\n\nThe link test will drive two file:// pages through one shared round. It verifies matching standings and a shared fire or case, logging the result to link.log.\n\nIf the link test fails, the feature will be removed from the HTML and rebuilt. A full hub re-run is needed afterward to confirm file:// still boots.\n\nA playwright script is being written to test link across two file:// pages in one browser context. It will launch both pages, wait for the game state, and drive host and join through startLink.\n\nThe script will verify both pages enter a round. It then checks if the host's fire message reaches the joiner, since only the host applies client messages.\n\nThe link test script is being abandoned. The host sends round snapshots, but the joiner never applies them because bindSession only processes client messages on the host. The worlds will not share fires or cases across file:// pages.\n\nThe hub test only checked that bytes flow both ways. It did not verify shared game state. The link feature needs clients to apply host snapshots. Otherwise the worlds will not share fires or cases.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b5f861c4-5b1c-49aa-abd5-4e82c7b2ba85-133","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"applySnapshot|snapshot|t === 's'|msg.t","glob":"**/{round.js,game.js,session.js}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src"}}],"stop_reason