{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_362","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"BroadcastChannel works between two file:// pages in the same Chromium context.\n\nWiring the client snapshot application into CashRound. The message handler will apply snapshots on non-host clients. A quick test round will verify that fire, cases, and standings stay synchronized.\n\nThe snapshot will include a capped list of burning cells. Clients will use this to re-ignite fires locally. Cases are already covered.\n\nThe client message handler will process finish messages to end the session and apply snapshots to the active round.\n\nThe applySnapshot method updates remote seat positions, health, stones, and down state. It also syncs case ownership and carrier status. The host's applyClient already handles the {t:'me'} message format.\n\nThe host will set a temporary `linkSpark` on the world when it ignites fire. The snapshot method reads this spark and immediately clears it, so only one snapshot carries the ignition. The client then calls `world.fire.ignite` with those coordinates to re-light the fire locally.\n\nA test case will teleport the host onto a case and press E, letting the client snapshot confirm the carrier state.\n\nThe host will emit a time-up event, then finish the round so the client receives the outcome and standings. The join flow needs a start message carrying the seed; the join side must open its channel before the host posts it to avoid a race.\n\nBroadcastChannel does not buffer messages for late subscribers, so the join page must open its channel before the host posts the start message. The test will boot both pages, start the join link first, then start the host link, and wait until both sides reach the round state.\n\nThe host will teleport directly to a case using `world.teleport` via `evaluate`, then trigger the pickup action through the browser's input system. This avoids calling internal round logic directly and keeps the test realistic.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bf9acdf0-dec5-443d-a87f-c654d3df4f5e-137","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","offset":280,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bf9acdf0-dec5-443d-a87f-c654d3df4f5e-138","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":973,"limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":322,"output_tokens":2226,"cache_read_input_tokens":185984,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"9fcd6041-7acb-4022-8d74-b0920dd75445"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-bf9acdf0-dec5-443d-a87f-c654d3df4f5e-137","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"280→    this.world.tablets = data.tablets ?? 0;\\n    this.world.syrettes = data.syrettes ?? 0;\\n    this.world.hour = data.hour ?? 9;\\n    this.world.gameHours = this.world.hour;\\n    this.world.flags = new Set(data.flags || []);\\n    this.world.sheet = data.sheet || null;\\n    if (data.ledger) this.world.ledger = { ...this.world.ledger, ...data.ledger };\\n    if (data.fire) this.world.fire.decode(data.fire);\\n    this.world.teleport(data.x || 0, data.z || 40);\\n    this.mode = 'play';\\n290→    this.screen = 'play';\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  storeSettings() {\\n    writeSettings({ volumes: this.volumes, glyphSet: this.glyphSet, invertY: this.look.invertY, sensX: this.look.sensX });\\n  }\\n\\n  items() {\\n300→    if (this.touchGate && (this.screen === 'title' || this.screen === 'menu')) return [{ id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }];\\n    if (this.screen === 'title') return [{ id: 'menu', label: 'PRESS TO START' }];\\n    if (this.screen === 'menu') {\\n      const rows = [];\\n      if (readSave()) rows.push({ id: 'continue', label: 'CONTINUE' });\\n      rows.push({ id: 'new', label: 'NEW GAME' }, { id: 'cash', label: 'CASH RUN' }, { id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }, { id: 'about', label: 'ABOUT AND CREDITS' });\\n      return rows;\\n    }\\n    if (this.screen === 'cash') {\\n      return [\\n310→        { id: 'solo', label: 'SOLO WITH HIRED GUNS' },\\n        { id: 'host', label: 'HOST ON THIS COMPUTER' },\\n        { id: 'join', label: 'JOIN ON THIS COMPUTER' },\\n        { id: 'back', label: 'BACK' },\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    if (this.screen === 'pause') {\\n      if (this.session) return [{ id: 'resume', label: 'RESUME' }, { id: 'settings', label: 'SETTINGS' }];\\n      return [\\n  