{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f79ae8f2-4187-41b3-9c37-0b2fd061ef28-152","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"42→export class BasinGame {\\n  constructor(options = {}) {\\n    this.name = GAME_TITLE;\\n    this.options = options;\\n    this.session = options.session || null;\\n    this.mode = this.session ? 'card' : 'title';\\n    this.screen = this.mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n50→    this.device = 'pad';\\n    this.glyphSet = 'playstation';\\n    this.notice = '';\\n    this.touchGate = false;\\n    this.attract = false;\\n    this.idle = 0;\\n    this.frame = 0;\\n    this.page = 0;\\n    this.musicName = '';\\n    this.musicT = 0;\\n60→    this.saveDisabled = false;\\n    this.saves = 0;\\n    this.ending = null;\\n    this.card = null;\\n    this.round = null;\\n    this.ended = false;\\n    this.world = null;\\n    this.ctx = null;\\n    this.netTimer = null;\\n    this.returnScreen = 'title';\\n70→    this.beat = 0;\\n    this.beatT = 0;\\n    this.look = { override: null, enabled: false, sensX: 1, sensY: 1, invertY: false };\\n    this.bot = null;\\n    this.volumes = { music: 0.1, sfx: 1, voice: 1 };\\n    this.devTab = 0;\\n    this.rows = [];\\n    if (this.session) this.bindSession(this.session);\\n  }\\n\\n80→  bindSession(session) {\\n    session.on('card', (card) => { this.card = card; });\",\"content_concise\":\"42→export class BasinGame {\\n  constructor(options = {}) {\\n    this.name = GAME_TITLE;\\n    this.options = options;\\n    this.session = options.session || null;\\n    this.mode = this.session ? 'card' : 'title';\\n    this.screen = this.mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n50→    this.device = 'pad';\\n    this.glyphSet = 'playstation';\\n    this.notice = '';\\n    this.touchGate = false;\\n    this.attract = false;\\n    this.idle = 0;\\n    this.frame = 0;\\n    this.page = 0;\\n    this.musicName = '';\\n    this.musicT = 0;\\n60→    this.saveDisabled = false;\\n    this.saves = 0;\\n    this.ending = null;\\n    this.card = null;\\n    this.round = null;\\n    this.ended = false;\\n    this.world = null;\\n    this.ctx = null;\\n    this.netTimer = null;\\n    this.returnScreen = 'title';\\n70→    this.beat = 0;\\n    this.beatT = 0;\\n    this.look = { override: null, enabled: false, sensX: 1, sensY: 1, invertY: false };\\n    this.bot = null;\\n    this.volumes = { music: 0.1, sfx: 1, voice: 1 };\\n    this.devTab = 0;\\n    this.rows = [];\\n    if (this.session) this.bindSession(this.session);\\n  }\\n\\n80→  bindSession(session) {\\n    session.on('card', (card) => { this.card = card; });\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js\",\"offset\":42,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"export class BasinGame {\\n  constructor(options = {}) {\\n    this.name = GAME_TITLE;\\n    this.options = options;\\n    this.session = options.session || null;\\n    this.mode = this.session ? 'card' : 'title';\\n    this.screen = this.mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n    this.device = 'pad';\\n    this.glyphSet = 'playstation';\\n    this.notice = '';\\n    this.touchGate = false;\\n    this.attract = false;\\n    this.idle = 0;\\n    this.frame = 0;\\n    this.page = 0;\\n    this.musicName = '';\\n    this.musicT = 0;\\n    this.saveDisabled = false;\\n    this.saves = 0;\\n    this.ending = null;\\n    this.card = null;\\n    this.round = null;\\n    this.ended = false;\\n    this.world = null;\\n    this.ctx = null;\\n    this.netTimer = null;\\n    this.returnScreen = 'title';\\n    this.beat = 0;\\n    this.beatT = 0;\\n    this.look = { override: null, enabled: false, sensX: 1, sensY: 1, invertY: false };\\n    this.bot = null;\\n    this.volumes = { music: 0.1, sfx: 1, voice: 1 };\\n    this.devTab = 0;\\n    this.rows = [];\\n    if (this.session) this.bindSession(this.session);\\n  }\\n\\n  bindSession(session) {\\n    session.on('card', (card) => { this.card = card; });\\n\",\"total_lines\":772}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"751849fe-5ae1-48d9-9934-fc572e3b599a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_372","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The constructor sets the session and then calls bindSession to start the timer.\n\nThe host's message handler ignores its own finish messages. The client handles them instead. Join messages are safe because the client is not the host. Snapshot handling is also correct: the host sends the snapshot object directly, and the client applies it.\n\nThe case carrier snapshot timing looks correct. The host captures the carrier before the spark fires, and the client applies it properly.\n\nA potential race exists for flares: if setButtons does not register a press during step, spark will be null.\n\nThere is also concern that engine.step might conflict with the running animation frame loop. The net timer change could cause double-sends on the hub, so a rebuild and quick retest is needed.\n\nThe hub already passed. The new bundle includes a double-timer fix in ensureNet, but the hub should still pass because that logic was already present. The finish-order change is link-only, and the snapshot spark field is ignored by the hub. Re-running all four hub scenarios would take ninety seconds, so I will skip that unless something looks broken.\n\nThe message handler change affects all sessions, including the hub. Previously applyClient only ran for hosts, but now it runs for any non-host message. The hub relays snapshot data from the host and {t:'me'} from clients, so the host will receive its own messages through applyClient instead of being ignored.\n\nClients receiving snapshots is not a protocol violation. The hub should tolerate the extra spark field. I will re-run the hub tests after the link tests pass.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b807b80-a437-4372-9af7-00827ef1a88c-153","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\ncd \"A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-