{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_373","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The link works. Both rounds have started.\n\nThe host and joiner are both burning. Standings match. The menu shows host and join. The shared case is correct. I will re-run the hub to verify the new net code handles all four scenarios. I must copy the updated game.html to tests/.site/game.html first. Screenshots, webkit log, and docs are also needed.\n\nI will write a shot script to capture desktop screenshots after ten seconds of rendering. I will read the PNGs directly and then write PROGRESS.md, the exit interview, and flip the checklist.\n\nThe webkit attempt failed. I will log the error and proceed without gating.\n\nI found two new game-breaking link bugs. Link updates never left the machine because the network timer started before a same-computer session existed. The finish message was dropped because the session ended too early. I will add both to ISSUES.md and update the total count to 13.\n\nI will update about.js and rebuild the bundle because the about text is embedded in it. The headless tests do not verify the issue count, so \"13\" is acceptable. I will run --all to refresh the test log.\n\nThe two new issues are critical because they blocked the link round. I will record the final test log with --all after rebuilding. The goal checklist flips to done only after the hub and screenshots succeed. Deviations will be logged in PROGRESS.md.\n\nI will check the goal plan for a Deviations section. The tests/.site copy is fine to leave. The webkit script will be short. The screenshot script will create a shots directory, wait ten seconds, title the shot, start a mission, and capture the map. I will verify that launch logs still describe the same title.\n\nI will skip re-launching the final HTML to save time. The title boot path is unchanged, so the existing launch logs remain valid. I will run the tests, rebuild, copy the bundle to the site, start the hub, and then capture screenshots and the webkit log.\n\nI will re-run the two launches inside the shot script to overwrite launch-1.log and launch-2.log with the final file. This keeps the logs synchronized without extra boots.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5f613829-e006-417e-b00f-1e1402e71921-154","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/about.js","old_string":"  ['TESTING FEEDBACK', 'How many issues did testing catch?', '11. Listed in tests/ISSUES.md.'],\n  ['CRITICAL ISSUES', 'How many would be game breaking?', '11. Each one stopped a required path.'],","new_string":"  ['TESTING FEEDBACK', 'How many issues did testing catch?', '13. Listed in tests/ISSUES.md.'],\n  ['CRITICAL ISSUES', 'How many would be game breaking?', '13. Each one stopped a required path.'],"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5f613829-e006-417e-b00f-1e1402e71921-155","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md","old_string":"# Issues testing caught\n\n11 game-breaking defects. Each one stopped a path the suite has to finish. The fixes are in the shipped game.","new_string":"# Issues testing caught\n\n13 game-breaking defects. Each one stopped a path the suite has to finish. The fixes are in the shipped game."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5f613829-e006-417e-b00f-1e1402e71921-156","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md","old_string":"11. A random jam cleared the scripted jam count, so the scripted jam never arrived.","new_string":"11. A random jam cleared the scripted jam count, so the scripted jam never arrived.\n12. A same-computer session started after boot never opened its network timer, so the join never saw the host.\n13. The link finish message was dropped because the session marked itself ended before the send."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1449,"output_tokens":1646,"cache_read_input_tokens":203008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"9ae8dffe-4fb4-466b-a6ca-e1d8cae9fd8b"}
