ead is the proof.'],\\n];\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5f613829-e006-417e-b00f-1e1402e71921-155","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"# Issues testing caught\\n\\n11 game-breaking defects. Each one stopped a path the suite has to finish. The fixes are in the shipped game.\",\"new_string\":\"# Issues testing caught\\n\\n13 game-breaking defects. Each one stopped a path the suite has to finish. The fixes are in the shipped game.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"# Issues testing caught\\n\\n11 game-breaking defects. Each one stopped a path the suite has to finish. The fixes are in the shipped game.\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Issues testing caught\\n\\n13 game-breaking defects. Each one stopped a path the suite has to finish. The fixes are in the shipped game.\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\\n1. A mouse click counted as a controller, so the touch gate closed and the title's first item opened the menu instead of Settings.\\n2. Attract left the player in the truck, in god mode, with the map up. The next mission inherited that and could not walk.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5f613829-e006-417e-b00f-1e1402e71921-156","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"11. A random jam cleared the scripted jam count, so the scripted jam never arrived.\",\"new_string\":\"11. A random jam cleared the scripted jam count, so the scripted jam never arrived.\\n12. A same-computer session started after boot never opened its network timer, so the join never saw the host.\\n13. The link finish message was dropped because the session marked itself ended before the send.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/ISSUES.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"11. A random jam cleared the scripted jam count, so the scripted jam never arrived.\",\"old_line\":15,\"new_string\":\"11. A random jam cleared the scripted jam count, so the scripted jam never arrived.\\n12. A same-computer session started after boot never opened its network timer, so the join never saw the host.\\n13. The link finish message was dropped because the session marked itself ended before the send.\",\"new_line\":15,\"context_before\":\"8. The flare's click dismissed the ending card on the same frame.\\n9. The last burn sat on ground that cannot burn, so the ending mission could not finish. Completion now accepts fresh flame inside the radius.\\n10. The payroll case was hidden on the convoy, so the shots that stopped the truck destroyed the case too.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-707