ber\":6,\"content\":\"## Acceptance criteria\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"## Non-goals\"},{\"line_number\":27,\"content\":\"## Assumed scope\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"## Implementation approach\"},{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"## Task checklist\"},{\"line_number\":37,\"content\":\"- [ ] List 50 titles, pick one with a real RNG, record the list and the pick, create the dev subfolder, unzip the kit, vendor the hub client and harness, and prove `pixel-engine.js` matches the zip.\"},{\"line_number\":38,\"content\":\"- [ ] Scaffold the single-file build and a booting game so `file://` opens and all four hub scenarios pass. Start `PROGRESS.md`.\"},{\"line_number\":39,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add the basin, player locomotion, look and pointer-lock fixes, actions, device glyphs, minimal HUD, and pause. Cover them with headless tests.\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add weapons (wear, jam, break), hits, soldiers, health, syrette, surgery, and fever, with the system tests in criterion 2.\"},{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add the fire grid, ignition weapons, day and night, vehicles and repair, the held map, safehouses, stones, and save/load.\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add missions through both endings, buddies (rescue and finish-it), the Ledger, dialogue, music at 0.1, and code voices and effects. Add the bot playthrough.\"},{\"line_number\":43,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add title, menus, settings, the touch gate, attract, dev-mode sliders with reset, and About/Credits.\"},{\"line_number\":44,\"content\":\"- [ ] Finish Cash Run (host, client, solo bots, card listeners). Re-run `node tests/run.mjs --all`, the two `file://` launches, the phone-profile check, and the four hub scenarios. Write `exit-interview.json` and finish `PROGRESS.md`, including any §26 cuts.\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"## Risks / Contradictions\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":nul