{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1b8248d6-3d14-4435-9a30-4d869d6f3533-48","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"516→  trackIdle(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session || this.mode === 'attract') return;\\n    if (this.screen !== 'title' && this.screen !== 'menu') return;\\n    if (this.idle >= 10) {\\n520→      if (!this.freshInput(ctx)) this.startAttract();\\n      else this.idle = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.freshInput(ctx)) this.idle = 0;\\n    else this.idle += dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  startAttract() {\\n    this.returnScreen = this.screen;\\n530→    this.mode = 'attract';\\n    this.attract = true;\\n    this.saveDisabled = true;\\n    this.beat = 0;\\n    this.beatT = 0;\\n    this.world.god = true;\\n    this.world.infAmmo = true;\\n    this.world.noJam = false;\\n    this.bot = { x: 0, y: 1, jump: false, fire: false };\\n    this.look.override = null;\\n540→  }\\n\\n  exitAttract() {\\n    const back = this.returnScreen || 'title';\\n    this.attract = false;\\n    this.mode = back;\",\"content_concise\":\"516→  trackIdle(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session || this.mode === 'attract') return;\\n    if (this.screen !== 'title' && this.screen !== 'menu') return;\\n    if (this.idle >= 10) {\\n520→      if (!this.freshInput(ctx)) this.startAttract();\\n      else this.idle = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.freshInput(ctx)) this.idle = 0;\\n    else this.idle += dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  startAttract() {\\n    this.returnScreen = this.screen;\\n530→    this.mode = 'attract';\\n    this.attract = true;\\n    this.saveDisabled = true;\\n    this.beat = 0;\\n    this.beatT = 0;\\n    this.world.god = true;\\n    this.world.infAmmo = true;\\n    this.world.noJam = false;\\n    this.bot = { x: 0, y: 1, jump: false, fire: false };\\n    this.look.override = null;\\n540→  }\\n\\n  exitAttract() {\\n    const back = this.returnScreen || 'title';\\n    this.attract = false;\\n    this.mode = back;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js\",\"offset\":516,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"  trackIdle(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session || this.mode === 'attract') return;\\n    if (this.screen !== 'title' && this.screen !== 'menu') return;\\n    if (this.idle >= 10) {\\n      if (!this.freshInput(ctx)) this.startAttract();\\n      else this.idle = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.freshInput(ctx)) this.idle = 0;\\n    else this.idle += dt;\\n  }\\n\\n  startAttract() {\\n    this.returnScreen = this.screen;\\n    this.mode = 'attract';\\n    this.attract = true;\\n    this.saveDisabled = true;\\n    this.beat = 0;\\n    this.beatT = 0;\\n    this.world.god = true;\\n    this.world.infAmmo = true;\\n    this.world.noJam = false;\\n    this.bot = { x: 0, y: 1, jump: false, fire: false };\\n    this.look.override = null;\\n  }\\n\\n  exitAttract() {\\n    const back = this.returnScreen || 'title';\\n    this.attract = false;\\n    this.mode = back;\\n\",\"total_lines\":772}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"0f431b6b-c559-431d-b64f-10969ee19f96"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_394","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Setting both mode and screen to card prevents attract from starting.\n\ncardInput safely calls the session stub. Play scenes switch to mode play and wait four seconds per shot for a new frame to paint, plus twelve seconds on title. engine.manual is false because real Engine.start uses rAF. Night fire starts at hour 22 with front ignition and a look override toward it. Day gun starts at hour 8 with giveGun tractor.\n\nThe truck map shot needs ensureTruck, inVehicle true, map.up true, and map.anim 1. The camera may be first-person from the vehicle.\n\nTibor's rack starts at m2 with one advanceLines so the subtitle reads \"tibor:shop\". The 3D world is tibor's shed at x -18 z 62.\n\nA second dialogue shot of bakr or vance will be added because the plan treats dialogue separately from the rack.\n\nChoice UI is not drawn, so dialogue shots will use subtitle text. The surgery shot sets health to 15 and surgery timer to 4, displaying the subtitle \"HOLD STILL\" with the prompt \"FIELD SURGERY\". The dev shot opens pause and switches screen to dev.\n\nopenPause freezes timeScale at zero, yet the render loop still paints frames so the dev HUD remains visible. The draw function returns early for the dev screen, leaving the 3D world behind the HUD overlay. showEnding('walk') sets menuArm and the ending card will be captured.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c48eeea-0cf5-4155-af9e-36d0a4603f51-49","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","offset":223,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c48eeea-0cf5-4155-af9e-36d0a4603f51-50","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"override","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/core/look.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":491,"output_tokens":792,"cache_read_input_tokens":84352,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"3b6018aa-6eb2-4065-bf38-57299a3f7a8e"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0c48eeea-0cf5-4155-af9e-36d0a4603f51-49","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"223→  cameraTarget() {\\n    const f = this.world ? this.world.feet() : { x: 0, y: 42, z: 40 };\\n    const y = this.world?.crouch ? 1.15 : 1.62;\\n    return target.set(f.x, f.y + y, f.z);\\n  }\\n\\n  eyePosition() {\\n230→    return eye.copy(this.cameraTarget());\\n  }\\n\\n  onCameraChange(ctx) {\\n    installLook(ctx, this.look);\\n  }\\n\\n  onDeath() {\\n    this.mode = 'gameover';\\n    this.screen = 'gameover';\\n240→    this.menuArm = 0.6;\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 0;\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"223→  cameraTarget() {\\n    const f = this.world ? this.world.feet() : { x: 0, y: 42, z: 40 };\\n    const y = this.world?.crouch ? 1.15 : 1.62;\\n    return target.set(f.x, f.y + y, f.z);\\n  }\\n\\n  eyePosition() {\\n230→    return eye.copy(this.cameraTarget());\\n  }\\n\\n  onCameraChange(ctx) {\\n    installLook(ctx, this.look);\\n  }\\n\\n  onDeath() {\\n    this.mode = 'gameover';\\n    this.screen = 'gameover';\\n240→    this.menuArm = 0.6;\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 0;\\n  }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js\",\"offset\":223,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"  cameraTarget() {\\n    const f = this.world ? this.world.feet() : { x: 0, y: 42, z: 40 };\\n    const y = this.world?.crouch ? 1.15 : 1.62;\\n    return target.set(f.x, f.y + y, f.z);\\n  }\\n\\n  eyePosition() {\\n    return eye.copy(this.cameraTarget());\\n  }\\n\\n  onCameraChange(ctx) {\\n    installLook(ctx, this.look);\\n  }\\n\\n  onDeath() {\\n    this.mode = 'gameover';\\n    this.screen = 'gameover';\\n    this.menuArm = 0.6;\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 0;\\n  }\\n\",\"total_l