{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5b7fdd4c-1176-47a0-ab4d-c36a1dee6766-57","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"280→    this.hp = Math.max(0, this.hp - d);\\n    this.lastHurt = kind;\\n    this.regenT = 5;\\n    this.surgeryT = 0;\\n    if (this.hp <= 0) this.down();\\n  }\\n\\n  down() {\\n    if (this.round) {\\n      this.round.noteDown();\\n290→      return;\\n    }\\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && !b.down && (b.spentUntil || 0) <= this.clock);\\n    if (buddy) {\\n      this.rescueT = 2.2;\\n      this.rescueBuddy = buddy;\\n      this.subtitle = line('buddy:rescue');\\n      this.speaker = buddy.name;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n300→    this.dead = true;\\n    this.subtitle = line('death');\\n    this.game.onDeath();\\n  }\\n\\n  pay(amount) {\\n    const n = Math.round(amount * TUNING.stonesReward);\\n    this.stones += n;\\n    this.ledger.stonesEarned += n;\\n  }\\n310→\\n  applySetup(setup, deadIds = []) {\\n    this.flags = new Set(setup.flags || []);\\n    this.safehouses = new Set(setup.safehouses || []);\\n    this.stones = setup.stones ?? 0;\\n    this.tablets = setup.tablets ?? 0;\\n    this.syrettes = setup.syrettes ?? 3;\\n    this.hour = setup.hour ?? 9;\\n    this.gameHours = this.hour;\\n    this.truce = setup.truce !== false;\\n320→    this.column = !!setup.column;\\n    this.tracker = !!setup.tracker;\\n    this.hp = 100;\\n    this.dead = false;\\n    this.rescueT = 0;\\n    this.surgeryT = 0;\\n    this.burning = 0;\\n    this.actors = this.actors.filter((a) => a.kind === 'civil');\\n    this.feverOn = false;\\n    this.feverIgnore = 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"280→    this.hp = Math.max(0, this.hp - d);\\n    this.lastHurt = kind;\\n    this.regenT = 5;\\n    this.surgeryT = 0;\\n    if (this.hp <= 0) this.down();\\n  }\\n\\n  down() {\\n    if (this.round) {\\n      this.round.noteDown();\\n290→      return;\\n    }\\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && !b.down && (b.spentUntil || 0) <= this.clock);\\n    if (buddy) {\\n      this.rescueT = 2.2;\\n      this.rescueBuddy = buddy;\\n      this.subtitle = line('buddy:rescue');\\n      this.speaker = buddy.name;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n300→    this.dead = true;\\n    this.subtitle = line('death');\\n    this.game.onDeath();\\n  }\\n\\n  pay(amount) {\\n    const n = Math.round(amount * TUNING.stonesReward);\\n    this.stones += n;\\n    this.ledger.stonesEarned += n;\\n  }\\n310→\\n  applySetup(setup, deadIds = []) {\\n    this.flags = new Set(setup.flags || []);\\n    this.safehouses = new Set(setup.safehouses || []);\\n    this.stones = setup.stones ?? 0;\\n    this.tablets = setup.tablets ?? 0;\\n    this.syrettes = setup.syrettes ?? 3;\\n    this.hour = setup.hour ?? 9;\\n    this.gameHours = this.hour;\\n    this.truce = setup.truce !== false;\\n320→    this.column = !!setup.column;\\n    this.tracker = !!setup.tracker;\\n    this.hp = 100;\\n    this.dead = false;\\n    this.rescueT = 0;\\n    this.surgeryT = 0;\\n    this.burning = 0;\\n    this.actors = this.actors.filter((a) => a.kind === 'civil');\\n    this.feverOn = false;\\n    this.feverIgnore = 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js\",\"offset\":280,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"    this.hp = Math.max(0, this.hp - d);\\n    this.lastHurt = kind;\\n    this.regenT = 5;\\n    this.surgeryT = 0;\\n    if (this.hp <= 0) this.down();\\n  }\\n\\n  down() {\\n    if (this.round) {\\n      this.round.noteDown();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const buddy = this.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && !b.down && (b.spentUntil || 0) <= this.clock);\\n    if (buddy) {\\n      this.rescueT = 2.2;\\n      this.rescueBuddy = buddy;\\n      this.subtitle = line('buddy:rescue');\\n      this.speaker = buddy.name;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.dead = true;\\n    this.subtitle = line('death');\\n    this.game.onDeath();\\n  }\\n\\n  pay(amount) {\\n    const n = Math.round(amount * TUNING.stonesReward);\\n    this.stones += n;\\n    this.ledger.stonesEarned += n;\\n  }\\n\\n  applySetup(setup, deadIds = []) {\\n    this.flags = new Set(setup.flags || []);\\n    this.safehouses = new Set(setup.safehouses || []);\\n    this.stones = setup.stones ?? 0;\\n    this.tablets = setup.tablets ?? 0;\\n    this.syrettes = setup.syrettes ?? 3;\\n    this.hour = setup.hour ?? 9;\\n    this.gameHours = this.hour;\\n    this.truce = setup.truce !== false;\\n    this.column = !!setup.column;\\n    this.tracker = !!setup.tracker;\\n    this.hp = 100;\\n    this.dead = false;\\n    this.rescueT = 0;\\n    this.surgeryT = 0;\\n    this.burning = 0;\\n    this.actors = this.actors.filter((a) => a.kind === 'civil');\\n    this.feverOn = false;\\n    this.feverIgnore = 0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1400}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"7bdac764-d367-4f47-943f-9e28c1433590"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_400","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The m6 hour 22 will be recorded via gameHours.\n\nstartMission correctly applies the m6 setup hour 22. The night shot will set gameHours to 22 after ignite. Fire spreads normally in play mode. Opening pause freezes time and stops fire. The dev shot should be done last. SurgeryT counts down in fixed ticks, so a screenshot should be taken while it is still above zero.\n\nSurgeryT will be set to 60 so the surgery lasts longer. The map truck needs m1 setup, a nearby vehicle, and an inVehicle state. Any existing car from m0 attract must be handled.\n\nThe title screenshot must be taken before the attract demo begins. Waiting 12 wall seconds risks attract starting during that idle period. The plan is to boot, wait for a few rendered frames, and then capture the title screen.\n\nThe title screenshot should be taken immediately while the title is still visible. Then startMission to enter play mode and avoid attract. Wait 12 seconds in play, then capture the world screenshots.\n\nThe title screenshot will be taken after returning from play via toTitle(). This guarantees the shot occurs after at least ten seconds of rendering. The plan is to boot, wait for the game, enter play mode, wait twelve seconds, return to the title screen, and capture the title image.\n\nBoot itself may take longer than ten seconds, so the attract demo could already be running when the script begins. The plan is to check the state after boot. If attract is active, exitAttract() will return to the title screen. The title screenshot will be taken immediately upon returning. Then startMission and wait twelve seconds before capturing the remaining world shots.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dca19ea6-db1c-4c39-bcf0-4538aceceb9d-58","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","offset":448,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":671,"output_tokens":1071,"cache_read_input_tokens":90240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"04dc922e-1ab1-4f60-9526-fc3e09f3a40b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dca19ea6-db1c-4c39-bcf0-4538aceceb9d-58","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"448→  toTitle() {\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n450→    this.screen = 'title';\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n    this.ending = null;\\n    this.session = null;\\n    this.round = null;\\n    this.ended = false;\\n    if (this.world) {\\n      this.world.round = null;\\n      this.world.actors = this.world.actors.filter((a) => a.kind === 'civil');\\n      this.world.dead = false;\\n460→      this.world.rescueT = 0;\\n      this.world.surgeryT = 0;\\n      if (this.world.hp <= 0) this.world.hp = 40;\\n    }\\n    this.idle = 0;\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n    setWantLock(false);\\n    this.playSong('title');\\n  }\\n\\n470→  startSolo() {\\n    const session = soloSession(this.ctx.random.fork('solo'));\\n    this.session = session;\\n    this.bindSession(session);\\n    this.beginRound();\\n  }\\n\\n  startLink(role) {\",\"content_concise\":\"448→  toTitle() {\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n450→    this.screen = 'title';\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n    this.ending = null;\\n    this.session = null;\\n    this.round = null;\\n    this.ended = false;\\n    if (this.world) {\\n      this.world.round = null;\\n      this.world.actors = this.world.actors.filter((a) => a.kind === 'civil');\\n      this.world.dead = false;\\n460→      this.world.rescueT = 0;\\n      this.world.surgeryT = 0;\\n      if (this.world.hp <= 0) this.world.hp = 40;\\n    }\\n    this.idle = 0;\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n    setWantLock(false);\\n    this.playSong('title');\\n  }\\n\\n470→  startSolo() {\\n    const session = soloSession(this.ctx.random.fork('solo'));\\n    this.session = session;\\n    this.bindSession(session);\\n    this.beginRound();\\n  }\\n\\n  startLink(role) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js\",\"offset\":448,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"  toTitle() {\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n    this.screen = 'title';\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n    this.ending = null;\\n    this.session = null;\\n    this.round = null;\\n    this.ended = false;\\n    if (this.world) {\\n      this.world.round = null;\\n      this.world.actors = this.world.actors.filter((a) => a.kind === 'civil');\\n      this.world.dead = false;\\n      this.world.rescueT = 0;\\n      this.world.surgeryT = 0;\\n      if (this.world.hp <= 0) this.world.hp = 40;\\n    }\\n    this.idle = 0;\\n    if (this.ctx?.engine) this.ctx.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n    setWantLock(false);\\n    this.playSong('title');\\n  }\\n\\n  startSolo() {\\n    const session = soloSession(this.ctx.random.fork('solo'));\\n    this.session = session;\\n    this.bindSession(session);\\n    this.beginRound();\\n  }\\n\\n  startLink(role) {\\n\",\"total_lines\":772}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"43551da2-b832-48b0-ad6a-6caafdab373b"}
