{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_406","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"shots.mjs has a bug: grab('title') calls toTitle and then waits 3500ms before screenshot.\n\nThe 3.5s delay is fine because the attract sequence starts at 10s. The day-gun grab reads state without re-setup after the 12s wait. The title grab leaves play mode before waiting. Night-fire clears and ignites fire before waiting.\n\nmap-truck clears fire and map before setting map and vehicle. The camera override holds during the 3500ms wait. tibor sets lines and advances them twice. Subtitles remain visible after the wait.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b5c58f2-9bd4-440d-a779-4b4bad5b91a7-68","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":795,"limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4117,"output_tokens":527,"cache_read_input_tokens":95744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"5f3974ef-6c05-47bc-833f-45c0db1298a8"}
