{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_407","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`nearPrompt` is called after `tickPlayer`.\n\nSurgery returning early still triggers `nearPrompt` and keeps the subtitle on HOLD STILL. The dev-sliders pause flow works correctly during play mode. The ending menu blocks accidental quit for 0.6 seconds. The hub-card screen prevents idle attraction since it is not the title screen.\n\nThe day-gun grab evaluation reads the mission state without re-applying it. The weapon remains available after 12 seconds because setup places it and giveGun runs after startMission. The pipeline chain is ready to run with PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE set to ubuntu24.04-x64.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-14bdc21b-8e17-4347-98a9-1acb301b8947-69","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nSCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer\"\nnode \"$SCRATCH/boots.mjs\" && node \"$SCRATCH/shots.mjs\" && node \"$SCRATCH/touch-final.mjs\" && node \"$SCRATCH/webkit.mjs\" && node \"$SCRATCH/link.mjs\"","description":"Boot, screenshot, touch, WebKit, and link checks","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":809,"output_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":99840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"66f11284-6e7e-4481-9b27-05b2efdf0196"}
