{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_435","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to examine surgery healing more carefully.\n\nThe test shows a 15 HP character cannot use surgery. The readNeeds logic only triggers when HP drops below 20. tickRegen regenerates health in 20-point tiers up to 100. Hurt sets regenT to 5.\n\nSurgery sets surgeryT but never uses it to heal. The test directly sets HP to 15 without calling hurt, so regenT is likely zero or stale. Regen would only restore up to 20 HP in five seconds, not the 40 shown. Either healing code exists elsewhere or the test log is outdated.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d8cae68-03bf-43cb-8153-9453f49f6c5a-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"surgeryT","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d8cae68-03bf-43cb-8153-9453f49f6c5a-41","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":784,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d8cae68-03bf-43cb-8153-9453f49f6c5a-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/round.js","offset":250,"limit":200}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9435,"output_tokens":712,"cache_read_input_tokens":106752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"2acba338-f9cc-43eb-b747-4d947c6b905b"}
