{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_440","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The map is not rendered as a held object in the hands.\n\nThe `map-sheet` model exists but is never instantiated in the world or view. The map is only a data flag that toggles with M, moves a cursor from the mouse, sets waypoints, and does not pause the world. Criterion 2 requires the map to be held in the hands while walking and driving without pausing the world. The verification plan observation is weaker because it checks the data flag rather than the visual held object.\n\nThe held map is a never-cut pillar and the heart of pillar 3. First-person hands are defined but never spawned. The code must be read to verify whether this missing visual is a defect.\n\nThe HUD draw function also lacks any map overlay. When the map is active, nothing appears on screen at all.\n\nThe map is a no-op. Pressing M disables mouse look, yet the player sees nothing. The cursor math exists but has no visual output.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06298193-949d-46d6-81a3-863328b0c208-55","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"this\\.map|refreshMap|mapHasScar|DataTexture|mapTex|waypoint","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06298193-949d-46d6-81a3-863328b0c208-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":160,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06298193-949d-46d6-81a3-863328b0c208-57","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/art/models.js","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"to