{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_441","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Paper map pixels are computed into `mapPx` but never uploaded to a texture, drawn on the HUD, or attached to a hand mesh.\n\nThe held map is invisible. GPS and waypoints are missing. Criterion 2 requires the map to be held in the hands during walking and driving, but the world pauses when it should not.\n\nFirst-person hands and guns are missing from the scene. The camera is first-person preset, yet the player sees no arms or weapons. This violates the plan's requirement for FP arms and Criterion 2.\n\nThe about screen claims mixer poses for reload, map, and surgery, but those poses may not exist. The held map is explicitly required by Criterion 2, not just art polish. I am now checking whether the voice system actually produces sound when `say()` is called.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ab039267-a77a-4298-b3a2-cebf456c3c84-58","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":100,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ab039267-a77a-4298-b3a2-cebf456c3c84-59","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"applySky|Vehicle|new THREE|ctx\\.scene|addMesh|compileModel|instantiate|hero\\.|CharacterController|physics\\.vehicle|makeVehicle","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ab039267-a77a-4298-b3a2-cebf456c3c84-60","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/audio/voice.js","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ab039267-a77a-4298-b3a2-cebf456c3c84-61","name":"read_file",