{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_443","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A screenshot note about surgery was noted.\n\nThe `surgeryT` value of 60 in the screenshot notes conflicts with current code, which sets it to 4. This appears to be stale data from an earlier build rather than a bug. The strongest bug remains the map not rendering.\n\nSoldiers and vehicles are invisible. Soldiers have no meshes, and the physics Vehicle class may not create a visible mesh either. This is a significant presentation bug. It is unclear if it qualifies as a core issue, since the build criteria do not explicitly require enemy visibility.\n\nInvisible targets are a defect in the shipped play experience. Soldiers function as data-only placeholders that can be shot via raycast, so the core mechanics work headlessly. The visual map is specifically required as \"held in the hands.\" I will also check whether terrain recolors when burnt.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-98fe9c4b-9e0e-4786-8ac3-862e6ad93d72-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"paintScar|onBurnt","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-98fe9c4b-9e0e-4786-8ac3-862e6ad93d72-67","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/world/terrain.js","offset":100,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-98fe9c4b-9e0e-4786-8ac3-862e6ad93d72-68","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"audio\\.counts|counts\\[","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-98fe9c4b-9e0e-4786-8ac3-862e6ad93d72-69","name":"read_file","input":{