{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_448","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and proceed with the tasks.\n\nTwo critical bugs need fixing before completion. The held map and GPS never render because mapPx is painted but never drawn to the hands or HUD. Also, knockBuddy() always sets burning:true, which blocks syrette use during tryUse().\n\nknockBuddy() must assert the correct action through the buddy system rather than downBuddy(..., {burning:false}).\n\nSoldiers, mercs, buddies, and civilians are data-only. Their rig models never get instanced in the world.\n\nThe Dev Mode hit-test is off by the window offset. Once focus exceeds six, clicks activate the wrong slider.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The hub check is green. Four gameplay gaps are still open: the map never draws, the M6 down only offers finish-it, actors have no meshes, and Dev Mode clicks the wrong slider. I'll fix those in the shipped game and re-test each path."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-72824430-3369-4ea8-a330-c7dc3884bb66-103","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"map-draw","content":"Draw the held map from mapPx while walking and driving, and assert that path","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"m6-syrette","content":"Let knockBuddy offer syrette or finish-it, finish-it only with no syrette","status":"pending"},{"id":"actor-mesh","content":"Instance soldier rigs for soldiers, mercs, buddies, and civilians and move them with the actors","status":"pending"},{"id":"dev-hit","content":"Hit-test Dev Mode against the same 9-row window the HUD draws","status":"pending"},{"id":"reverify","content":"Rebuild HTML, rerun headless tests, file://, phone, hub, and refresh hand-in","status":"pending"}],"merge":false}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-72824430-3369-4ea8-a330-c7dc3884bb66-104","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/wo