n normalised device coordinates, pressed or not.\"},{\"line_number\":2337,\"content\":\"- `get mouseButtons: number`: Buttons held, as `PointerEvent.buttons` bits (1 left, 2 right, 4 middle; a finger is left): the same keys as `isDown('MouseLeft')`.\"},{\"line_number\":2338,\"content\":\"- `get buttonEvents: readonly ButtonEvent[]`: This frame's pointer button presses and releases, in order, each with where the pointer was: a drag shorter than a frame (a script's) still starts where it started and ends where it ended. Recorded with the frame. UI that acts on clicks reads these; play read…\"},{\"line_number\":2363,\"content\":\"- `clicks?: [string, 0 | 1, number, number][]`: Pointer buttons pressed (1) and let go (0) this frame, in order, each where the pointer was (`buttonEvents`).\"},{\"line_number\":2383,\"content\":\"Mouse buttons as key codes (`isDown('MouseLeft')`, `consumePress('MouseRight')`), each with\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"326cfdfb-dc83-4b6a-8689-3667ac82cf6d"}
