{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_468","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"ctx.camera might be the THREE camera or a rig.\n\nThe THREE camera is nested inside `ctx.camera.camera`. The rig holds `.yaw` and `.step`. Each map gets a unique DataTexture so toon materials won't share incorrectly.\n\nbuildModel accepts ModelDef objects directly, so passing the soldier definition is valid. Ten to twenty spawned soldiers during the story is acceptable. resetDynamic runs on attract exit to clear actors and respawn the town, dropping views.\n\nannounceStep now clears leftover lines when the step is not a lines step. This prevents a completed conversation from blocking the next step if a line ID was left behind.\n\nA `menuWindow` helper will keep the hover menu centered on the focused item. The draw loop now uses this window to render only the visible rows.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3c1aab7b-1886-4743-a172-a978477e7129-150","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"13\\.|ISSUES","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917","glob":"*.{js,mjs,md}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1501,"output_tokens":787,"cache_read_input_tokens":197504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"1fd2ad26-aea6-4fae-b1d7-2ec094fb9450"}
