{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_469","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No test specifically asserts the number 13. It only appears in displayed content.\n\nUpdating the number to 17 after tests pass. KnockBuddy will use downBuddy instead of burning. Adding a safety check in announceStep for non-lines steps. Implementing world.js changes in chunks with search_replace. Updating game.js menuWindow, hover, draw, update sync, and toTitle. Clearing buddies in round.js. Reviewing toTitle for exact replacement. Considering whether fixed() should call syncViews.\n\nConfirmed that both attract and play call update, so views stay synchronized even when actors are frozen. build() calls mountMap at the end, and update retries if the camera is missing. THREE.SRGBColorSpace is available in this engine version. Will catch toonMaterial node material errors in tests and switch if needed. Proceeding directly to implementation rather than writing a probe script.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The map buffer, the M6 down, the actor rigs, and the dev-menu hit test are all real gaps. I'll wire each one through the shipped path and test it."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1df51f7f-2f23-4921-aeda-898c8a46f6eb-151","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"import { CharacterController, PALETTE, THREE, Vehicle } from '../../pixel-engine.js';","new_string":"import { CharacterController, PALETTE, THREE, Vehicle, buildModel, toonMaterial } from '../../pixel-engine.js';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1df51f7f-2f23-4921-aeda-898c8a46f6eb-152","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"import { line } from '../content/dialogue.js';","new_string":"import { line } from '../content/dialogue.js';\nimport { soldier } from '../art/models.js';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1df51f7f-2f23-4921-aeda-898c8a46f6eb-153","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    this.actors.push({\n      id: 'civil-1', kind: 'civil', x: -250, z: 230, hp: 40, alive: true, faction: 'civil', fleeing: false,\n    });\n  }","new_string":"    const civil = {\n      id: 'civil-1', kind: 'civil', x: -250, z: 230, hp: 40, alive: true, faction: 'civil', fleeing: false,\n    };\n    this.actors.push(civil);\n    this.attachRig(civil);\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1df51f7f-2f23-4921-aeda-898c8a46f6eb-154","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"    this.paintMapBase();\n    this.spawnTown();","new_string":"    this.paintMapBase();\n    this.mountMap();\n    this.spawnTown();"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1df51f7f-2f23-4921-aeda-898c8a46f6eb-155","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","old_string":"  resetDynamic() {\n    this.fire.extinguish();","new_string":"  handsCamera() {\n    return this.ctx?.camera?.camera || null;\n  }\n\n  mountMap() {\n    const cam = this.handsCamera();\n    if (!cam || this.mapSheet) return;\n    const tex = new THREE.DataTexture(this.mapPx, 320, 240);\n    tex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\n    tex.magFilter = THREE.NearestFilter;\n    tex.minFilter = THREE.NearestFilter;\n    tex.generateMipmaps = false;\n    tex.flipY = true;\n    tex.needsUpdate = true;\n    this.mapTex = tex;\n    const sheet = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(0.5, 0.375), toonMaterial(0xffffff, { map: tex }));\n    sheet.name = 'held-map';\n    this.gpsPx = new Uint8Array(16 * 16 * 4);\n    const gtex = new THREE.DataTexture(this.gpsPx, 16, 16);\n    gtex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\n    gtex.magFilter = THREE.NearestFilter;\n    gtex.minFilter = THREE.NearestFilter;\n    gtex.generateMipmaps = false;\n    gtex.flipY = true;\n    gtex.needsUpdate = true;\n    this.gpsTex = gtex;\n    const gps = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(0.11, 0.11), toonMaterial(0xffffff, { map: gtex }));\n    gps.name = 'gps';\n    gps.position.set(0.16, 0.1, 0.012);\n    sheet.add(gps);\n    cam.add(sheet);\n    this.mapSheet = sheet;\n    this.poseMap();\n  }\n\n  paintGps() {\n    if (!this.gpsPx) return;\n    this.gpsPx.fill(24);\n    const ang = this.windPin ? this.windPin.dir : this.windDir;\n    const x = Math.max(0, Math.min(15, Math.round(8 + Math.cos(ang) * 6)));\n    const y = Math.max(0, Math.min(15, Math.round(8 + Math.sin(ang) * 6)));\n    const i = (x + y * 16) * 4;\n    this.gpsPx[i] = 220;\n    this.gpsPx[i + 1] = 48;\n    this.gpsPx[i + 2] = 32;\n    this.gpsPx[i + 3] = 255;\n    const hour = Math.max(0, Math.min(15, Math.floor(this.hour)));\n    const h = hour * 4;\n    this.gpsPx[h] = 240;\n    this.gpsPx[h + 1] = 220;\n    this.gpsPx[h + 2] = 160;\n    this.gpsPx[h + 3] = 255;\n  }\n\n  poseMap() {\n    if (!this.mapSheet) this.mountMap();\n    if (!this.mapSheet) return;\n    const cam = this.handsCamera();\n    if (cam && this.mapSheet.parent !== cam) cam.add(this.mapSheet);\n    const anim = this.map.anim || 0;\n    const mode = this.game?.mode;\n    const show = anim > 0.02 && (mode === 'play' || mode === 'round' || mode === 'attract');\n    this.mapSheet.visible = show;\n    this.mapSheet.position.set(0.02, -0.28 + anim * 0.16, -0.42);\n    this.mapSheet.rotation.set(-1.05, 0, 0.04);\n    this.paintGps();\n    if (this.mapTex) this.mapTex.needsUpdate = true;\n    if (this.gpsTex) this.gpsTex.needsUpdate = true;\n  }\n\n  dropView(actor) {\n    if (!actor?.view) return;\n    actor.view.removeFromParent();\n    actor.view = null;\n  }\n\n  attachRig(actor) {\n    if (!actor || actor.view || !this.ctx?.scene) return actor;\n    const built = buildModel(soldier);\n    const obj = built.object;\n    obj.name = actor.id || actor.kind || 'actor';\n    this.ctx.scene.add(obj);\n    actor.view = obj;\n    this.placeRig(actor);\n    return actor;\n  }\n\n  placeRig(actor) {\n    if (!actor?.view) return;\n    let x = actor.x;\n    let z = actor.z;\n    if (x == null || z == null) {\n      const p = this.feet();\n      x = p.x + 1.4;\n      z = p.z + 0.4;\n    }\n    actor.view.visible = actor.alive !== false;\n    actor.view.position.set(x, this.ground(x, z), z);\n    actor.view.rotation.set(0, actor.yaw || 0, actor.down ? 1.1 : 0);\n  }\n\n  syncViews() {\n    for (const a of this.actors) {\n      if (!a.view) this.attachRig(a);\n      this.placeRig(a);\n    }\n    for (const b of this.buddies) {\n      if (!b.view) this.attachRig(b);\n      this.placeRig(b);\n    }\n    this.poseMap();\n  }\n\n  keepCivilians() {\n    for (const a of this.actors) if (a.kind !== 'civil') this.dropView(a);\n    this.actors = this.actors.filter((a) => a.kind === 'civil');\n  }\n\n  clearBuddies() {\n    for (const b of this.buddies) this.dropView(b);\n    this.buddies = [];\n  }\n\n  resetDynamic() {\n    for (const a of this.actors) this.dropView(a);\n    this.fire.extinguish();"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2749,"output_tokens":2455,"cache_read_input_tokens":198912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"6619d448-799b-430e-8f39-bf5a329120de"}
