{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_475","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand startMission and applySetup to confirm buddies exist when m6 starts.\n\nChecking readNeeds toggle timing. Verifying m6 fever state and whether the tablet prompt steals KeyE. Outlining the syrette test steps.\n\nThe test must call knockBuddy() directly to assert the syrette prompt and KeyE behavior. Calling downBuddy with burning:false is not allowed.\n\nThe honest test path runs the full m6 mission. It starts the mission, taps Enter, teleports into range and steps to complete goto, ignites a fuel cell and steps to complete burn, then asserts through the real buddy-down knockBuddy() call. This avoids starting past the target behavior.\n\nChecking whether m6 starts with fever on, since tablets would override the syrette prompt. The lines step now clears lines on non-lines steps. After the mission finishes, calling knockBuddy again will down a remaining alive buddy.\n\nThe test needs two knockBuddy() calls. The first consumes the initial syrette and brings the buddy back up. The second runs with syrettes at zero, triggering the FINISH IT prompt and KeyE recording deadBuddies.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b76c4088-7258-4db5-b9ce-f0cc22361781-13","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"startMission|advanceLines|feverT|readNeeds|map\\.up|function fixed\\(","glob":"**/world.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b76c4088-7258-4db5-b9ce-f0cc22361781-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/content/tuning-defaults.js","limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b76c4088-7258-4db5-b9ce-f0cc22361781-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh