hile paused.\"},{\"line_number\":164,\"content\":\"- `get timeScale: number`: Game speed: 1 normal, 0.25 slow motion, 2 double, 0 frozen (a menu: key presses made meanwhile are dropped, like a pause). Scales game time, physics, animation, particles, tweens and the camera follow; not transitions, shake or the render loop. Back to 1 when…\"},{\"line_number\":165,\"content\":\"- `hitstop(seconds: number): void`: Freeze the game for `seconds` of real time: impact frames that sell a hit. Rendering, screen shake and transitions keep going; overlapping hitstops keep the longest. Key presses made during a hitstop still count afterwards (a buffered jump).\"},{\"line_number\":185,\"content\":\"- `state(): { version: string; game: string; seed: number; ready: boolean; paused: boolean; time: number; timeScale: number; hitstop: number; screen: ScreenFxState; backend: BackendName; ... 19 more ...; status: string; }`: Snapshot for tests, tooling and agents.\"},{\"line_number\":1010,\"content\":\"duplicates dropped (and `sceneOnly` filters from layer stacks), every parameter present\"},{\"line_number\":1144,\"content\":\"Unknown ids are dropped.\"},{\"line_number\":1429,\"content\":\"- `update(dt: number, standing = -1): void`: Per frame: tiles under `standing` (a collider handle: the character's `groundCollider`) start to shake, shaking tiles drop, dropped ones grow back; old chunks dissolve away.\"},{\"line_number\":1876,\"content\":\"- `track(...bodies: RAPIER_TYPE.RigidBody[]): void`: Record `body` from now on (the history so far is dropped: every frame holds the same bodies).\"},{\"line_number\":2316,\"content\":\"- `pressWindow: number`: Queued presses older than this many seconds of game time are dropped.\"},{\"line_number\":2326,\"content\":\"- `consumePress(...codes: string[]): boolean`: True once per physical key press, kept until consumed or until it is older than `pressWindow` (150 ms of game time). Use from fixed-step code (which may run zero or several times per frame) so no press is dropped, while a stale press (made during a pause, a l…\"},{\"line_number\":4186,\"content\":\"pads. Game time (they pause, slow down and freeze with `engine.timeScale` and hitstops)\"},{\"line_number\":4570,\"content\":\"is turned to its four quarter turns (unless `rotate: false`), repeats dropped.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"9f19b5be-db9d-497d-a743-fe28da9ee5c6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_487","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Key presses are dropped when the timeScale is zero.\n\nMouse button events may still populate buttonEvents. The hover code reads buttonEvents instead of consumePress. With timeScale at zero, step() might not call game.update. The pause test checks that the clock stays unchanged after stepping.\n\nI will search the minified pixel-engine.js for timeScale logic to see if input events are cleared when timeScale is zero.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eadc8a9d-58e7-4cc5-814c-bab3f4c1bd2b-43","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/pixel-engine.js\")\ntext = p.read_text()\nprint(\"len\", len(text), \"lines\", text.count(\"\\n\")+1)\nidx = 0\nn = 0\nneedle = \"timeScale\"\nwhile n < 15:\n    i = text.find(needle, idx)\n    if i < 0: break\n    print(\"\\n---\", i, \"---\")\n    print(text[max(0,i-180):i+220].replace(\"\\n\",\" \"))\n    idx = i+len(needle)\n    n += 1\nprint(\"TOTAL later\")\nPY","description":"Find timeScale handling in pixel-engine.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2347,"output_tokens":522,"cache_read_input_tokens":85504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"de04a924-2643-4b91-a8b3-4a47a299a576"}
