":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"91a69489-c61c-47ac-99c7-de70cdfe8fe9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_505","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The implementation is XG. Searching for a function assigned to \"toonMaterial=\" earlier.\n\nThe search for the XG function is too difficult. I will run the test instead. I also need to write test edits, replace the playMission burn block with a function call, check that site long-field exists, and verify whether the guns test name should stay for --only guns.\n\nThe map test moves the civilian 6 meters after the guns test already shot them. Solo and story tests do not depend on that position, so this ordering is safe.\n\nI will place assertRig calls for the civilian and soldier at the end of the map test, after the sliders reset. This avoids side effects from engine stepping during an active mission.\n\nA merc is spawned at 500,500 and checked with assertRig. The soldier remains alive because the slider test does not kill it. The buddy rig is already asserted in the syrette test. Stepping the soldier during mission m1 is safe since he is in town and will not shoot.\n\nThe dev menu test will use game.resetSliders via the click and assert the TUNING module directly. The menus test is the last shared test, so any slider dirtiness is harmless because --all runs in a fresh process. Stepping the soldier during mission m1 will not trigger fever.\n\nI am writing the code now. The long playMission burn block will be replaced by a new lightCurrentBurn function. The guns test runs after m6 while the mission is finished, so starting m1 in the map test is safe. If both buddies die during the burning test, knockBuddy auto-completes the buddy-down and the mission still finishes with the scar laid. I also need to handle the case where no live buddy exists for that test.\n\nThe story test ledger friends count is correct at three. The dead buddy dov remains in the set after m6. The story correctly asserts that a dead buddy is not kept. This scenario is solid.\n\nfinishMission does not trigger showEnding for mission m6, so the syrette test path is safe. Starting a new mission during the guns test replaces the active one and resets timeScale to 1.\n\nI checked a possible subtitle bug where announceStep sets the subtitle to step text, but knockBuddy overwrites it with the burn line. The test checks the prompt, not the subtitle, so this is harmless.\n\nI also verified that nearPrompt does not check distance, and tryUse does. The downBuddy placement logic is sound: it places the buddy at feet plus 1.2, and since knockBuddy runs after tickPlayer in the same frame, the player position is the flare position. After one step, the buddy stays put.\n\nThe 20-frame burn sequence in lightCurrentBurn is safe. The player is 18 meters away and the fire damage radius is small, so the player will not be hurt. Buttons are released during the burn, preventing any unwanted movement. Fever is not active.\n\nI will run the guns test first, then map, menus, and story. The \"guns\" string matches the guns test name. The \"menus attract\" string would also match the touch test name, so I need to be careful with that filter.\n\nI will run the tests in sequence. The story test is very long, so it must wait until the guns and map tests pass. I will use --only \"menus attract\" for menus and --only \"story both\" for story. The full --all run should take about one to two minutes. I am ready to edit the test file.\n\nI will skip the Three.js skill unless tests fail on camera parenting. I confirmed game.js hover is saved and round.js clearBuddies prevents solo leaks. I also spotted a possible bug in applySetup's dead buddy spread.\n\nThe dead buddy spread is safe. makeBuddy returns a plain object with an enumerable view property, so spreading it copies the Object3D by reference. placeRig works on the new object and alive=false hides the rig.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The campaign down, the held map, the actor rigs, and the dev-menu window are in the source. The tests still take the old shortcuts, so I'm pointing them at those real paths."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9258e5dd-d095-488d-ba62-b1535112c006-63","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"function placeFacing(x, z) {\n  const w = game.world;\n  if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\n  w.teleport(x, z + 4);\n  game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n}","new_string":"function placeFacing(x, z) {\n  const w = game.world;\n  if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\n  w.teleport(x, z + 4);\n  game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n}\n\nfunction texBytes(tex) {\n  const image = tex && tex.image;\n  if (image && image.data) return image.data;\n  const source = tex && tex.source && tex.source.data;\n  if (source && source.data) return source.data;\n  return source || image || null;\n}\n\nfunction assertHeldMap(w, label) {\n  const sheet = w.mapSheet;\n  const cam = game.ctx.camera.camera;\n  assert(sheet && sheet.visible, label + ' map is not in the hands');\n  assert(sheet.parent === cam, label + ' map is not parented to the camera');\n  assert(texBytes(w.mapTex) === w.mapPx, label + ' map texture does not read mapPx');\n  assert(sheet.material && sheet.material.map === w.mapTex, label + ' mesh does not sample mapPx');\n  const gps = sheet.getObjectByName('gps');\n  assert(gps, label + ' gps missing');\n  assert(texBytes(w.gpsTex) === w.gpsPx, label + ' gps texture does not read gpsPx');\n  assert(gps.material && gps.material.map === w.gpsTex, label + ' gps mesh does not sample gpsPx');\n  let marked = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < w.gpsPx.length; i += 4) {\n    if (w.gpsPx[i] === 220 && w.gpsPx[i + 1] === 48) marked = true;\n  }\n  assert(marked, label + ' gps did not paint');\n}\n\nfunction assertRig(actor, label) {\n  assert(actor && actor.view, label + ' has no rig');\n  assert(actor.view.parent === game.ctx.scene, label + ' rig is not in the scene');\n  actor.x = (actor.x || 0) + 6;\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n  const dx = Math.abs(actor.view.position.x - actor.x);\n  assert(dx < 0.05, label + ' rig did not follow ' + actor.view.position.x + ' vs ' + actor.x);\n}\n\nfunction lightCurrentBurn() {\n  const w = game.world;\n  const step = w.currentStep();\n  if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\n  const r = step.r || 12;\n  const origin = w.fire.cellAt(step.x, step.z);\n  let lx = step.x;\n  let lz = step.z;\n  const reach = Math.ceil(r / 5);\n  let best = Infinity;\n  for (let dz = -reach; dz <= reach; dz++) {\n    for (let dx = -reach; dx <= reach; dx++) {\n      const ix = origin.ix + dx;\n      const iz = origin.iz + dz;\n      if (ix < 0 || iz < 0 || ix >= 256 || iz >= 256) continue;\n      const i = w.fire.idx(ix, iz);\n      if (w.fire.fuel[i] <= 0 || w.fire.state[i] !== 0) continue;\n      const [cx, cz] = w.fire.center(ix, iz);\n      const d = Math.hypot(cx - step.x, cz - step.z);\n      if (d > r - 1 || d >= best) continue;\n      best = d;\n      lx = cx;\n      lz = cz;\n    }\n  }\n  w.teleport(lx, lz + 18);\n  game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\n  arm('flare');\n  tapFire();\n  engine.step(20, DT);\n}\n\nfunction clickHud(pixelY) {\n  engine.input.setPointer(0, 1 - (pixelY / 270) * 2, true);\n  engine.input.setButtons(1);\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n  engine.input.setButtons(0);\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9258e5dd-d095-488d-ba62-b1535112c006-64","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'burn') {\n      if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\n      const r = step.r || 12;\n      const origin = w.fire.cellAt(step.x, step.z);\n      let lx = step.x;\n      let lz = step.z;\n      const reach = Math.ceil(r / 5);\n      let best = Infinity;\n      for (let dz = -reach; dz <= reach; dz++) {\n        for (let dx = -reach; dx <= reach; dx++) {\n          const ix = origin.ix + dx;\n          const iz = origin.iz + dz;\n          if (ix < 0 || iz < 0 || ix >= 256 || iz >= 256) continue;\n          const i = w.fire.idx(ix, iz);\n          if (w.fire.fuel[i] <= 0 || w.fire.state[i] !== 0) continue;\n          const [cx, cz] = w.fire.center(ix, iz);\n          const d = Math.hypot(cx - step.x, cz - step.z);\n          if (d > r - 1 || d >= best) continue;\n          best = d;\n          lx = cx;\n          lz = cz;\n        }\n      }\n      w.teleport(lx, lz + 18);\n      game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\n      arm('flare');\n      tapFire();\n      engine.step(20, DT);\n    } else if (step.do === 'clear') {","new_string":"    } else if (step.do === 'burn') {\n      lightCurrentBurn();\n    } else if (step.do === 'clear') {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9258e5dd-d095-488d-ba62-b1535112c006-65","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  w.syrettes = 1;\n  w.downBuddy('ines', { burning: false });\n  tap('KeyE');\n  const ines = w.buddies.find((b) => b.id === 'ines');\n  assert(!ines.down && w.syrettes === 0, 'syrette did not pick the buddy up');\n  w.syrettes = 0;\n  w.downBuddy('ines', { burning: false });\n  tap('KeyE');\n  assert(w.deadBuddies.has('ines'), 'finish-it did not record the death');\n});","new_string":"  w.deadBuddies.clear();\n  assert(w.startMission('m6'), 'm6 missing');\n  assert(w.currentStep().do === 'lines', 'm6 did not open on its line');\n  tap('Enter');\n  assert(w.currentStep()?.do === 'goto', 'm6 line did not advance ' + w.currentStep()?.do);\n  const field = siteById('long-field');\n  w.teleport(field.x, field.z);\n  engine.step(2, DT);\n  assert(w.currentStep()?.do === 'burn', 'm6 goto did not finish ' + w.currentStep()?.do);\n  lightCurrentBurn();\n  assert(w.currentStep()?.do === 'buddy-down', 'm6 burn did not reach the down ' + w.currentStep()?.do);\n  const down = w.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && b.down);\n  assert(down && down.burning === false, 'knockBuddy forced the buddy to burn');\n  assert(down.view && down.view.parent === game.ctx.scene, 'downed buddy has no rig');\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n  assert(w.prompt === 'SYRETTE OR FINISH IT', 'campaign prompt ' + w.prompt);\n  assert(w.syrettes > 0, 'campaign down had no syrette');\n  const sid = down.id;\n  const shots = w.syrettes;\n  tap('KeyE');\n  const up = w.buddies.find((b) => b.id === sid);\n  assert(up && !up.down && up.hp > 0 && w.syrettes === shots - 1, 'syrette through knockBuddy failed');\n  assert(w.syrettes === 0, 'a syrette was left after the campaign down');\n  w.knockBuddy();\n  const down2 = w.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && b.down);\n  assert(down2 && down2.burning === false, 'second knockBuddy burned the buddy');\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n  assert(w.prompt === 'FINISH IT', 'empty syrette prompt ' + w.prompt);\n  const fid = down2.id;\n  tap('KeyE');\n  assert(w.deadBuddies.has(fid) && w.syrettes === 0, 'finish-it did not record the death');\n  const live = w.buddies.find((b) => b.alive && !b.down);\n  w.syrettes = 1;\n  w.downBuddy(live.id, { burning: true });\n  engine.step(1, DT);\n  assert(w.prompt === 'FINISH IT', 'a burning down still offered a syrette');\n  tap('KeyE');\n  assert(w.deadBuddies.has(live.id) && w.syrettes === 1, 'a burning down used the syrette');\n});"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9258e5dd-d095-488d-ba62-b1535112c006-66","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  w.startMission('m1');\n  engine.step(2, DT);\n  tap('KeyE');\n  assert(w.inVehicle, 'did not enter');\n  const z0 = w.feet().z;\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', true);\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', true);\n  engine.step(20, DT);\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', false);\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', false);\n  assert(w.map.up && w.inVehicle, 'map not held while driving');\n  assert(w.feet().z !== z0, 'world paused on the map');","new_string":"  w.startMission('m1');\n  engine.step(2, DT);\n  assert(!w.inVehicle, 'map walk started in the truck');\n  tap('KeyM');\n  engine.step(30, DT);\n  assert(w.map.up && w.map.anim > 0.9, 'map did not rise on foot ' + w.map.anim);\n  assertHeldMap(w, 'walking');\n  const zFoot = w.feet().z;\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', true);\n  engine.step(20, DT);\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', false);\n  assert(Math.abs(w.feet().z - zFoot) > 0.2, 'world paused while walking with the map');\n  assertHeldMap(w, 'walking');\n  tap('KeyM');\n  engine.step(30, DT);\n  assert(!w.map.up && w.map.anim < 0.02, 'map stayed up');\n  tap('KeyE');\n  assert(w.inVehicle, 'did not enter');\n  const z0 = w.feet().z;\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', true);\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', true);\n  engine.step(20, DT);\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyM', false);\n  engine.input.setKey('KeyW', false);\n  assert(w.map.up && w.inVehicle, 'map not held while driving');\n  assertHeldMap(w, 'driving');\n  assert(w.feet().z !== z0, 'world paused on the map');"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9258e5dd-d095-488d-ba62-b1535112c006-67","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  game.resetSliders();\n  for (const key of SLIDER_KEYS) assert(TUNING[key] === TUNING_DEFAULTS[key], 'reset ' + key);\n  assert(w.car.o.topSpeed === TUNING_DEFAULTS.vehicleTopSpeed, 'reset speed');\n});","new_string":"  game.resetSliders();\n  for (const key of SLIDER_KEYS) assert(TUNING[key] === TUNING_DEFAULTS[key], 'reset ' + key);\n  assert(w.car.o.topSpeed === TUNING_DEFAULTS.vehicleTopSpeed, 'reset speed');\n  const civil = w.actors.find((a) => a.kind === 'civil' && a.alive);\n  assertRig(civil, 'civilian');\n  const soldier = w.actors.find((a) => a.kind === 'soldier' && a.alive);\n  assertRig(soldier, 'soldier');\n  const merc = w.spawnSoldier({ id: 'merc-proof', x: 500, z: 500, faction: 'merc' });\n  merc.kind = 'merc';\n  assertRig(merc, 'merc');\n});"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9258e5dd-d095-488d-ba62-b1535112c006-68","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  const dev = game.items().some((item) => item.id === 'dev');\n  assert(dev, 'dev mode hidden');\n  game.focus = game.items().findIndex((item) => item.id === 'about');","new_string":"  const dev = game.items().some((item) => item.id === 'dev');\n  assert(dev, 'dev mode hidden');\n  game.focus = game.items().findIndex((item) => item.id === 'dev');\n  tap('Enter');\n  assert(game.screen === 'dev' && game.items().length > 9, 'dev list ' + game.items().length);\n  game.focus = 10;\n  const windowTop = Math.max(0, game.focus - 6);\n  clickHud(86);\n  assert(game.focus === windowTop, 'scrolled click focused ' + game.focus + ' wanted ' + windowTop);\n  const resetAt = game.items().findIndex((item) => item.id === 'reset-sliders');\n  game.focus = resetAt;\n  const resetRow = resetAt - Math.max(0, resetAt - 6);\n  game.applySlider('wearRate', TUNING_RANGES.wearRate[1]);\n  assert(TUNING.wearRate === TUNING_RANGES.wearRate[1], 'wear slider');\n  clickHud(86 + resetRow * 16);\n  assert(game.focus === resetAt, 'reset click focused ' + game.focus);\n  assert(TUNING.wearRate === TUNING_DEFAULTS.wearRate, 'reset click missed the drawn row');\n  engine.input.setPointer(0, 1, false);\n  game.focus = game.items().findIndex((item) => item.id === 'back');\n  tap('Enter');\n  assert(game.screen === 'pause', 'dev did not return to pause');\n  game.focus = game.items().findIndex((item) => item.id === 'about');"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":480,"output_tokens":6007,"cache_read_input_tokens":110208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"ee65ff2c-c7b2-4823-ad3e-8f819aa9b2e9"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9258e5dd-d095-488d-ba62-b1535112c006-63","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"function placeFacing(x, z) {\\n  const w = game.world;\\n  if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\\n  w.teleport(x, z + 4);\\n  game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\\n  engine.step(1, DT);\\n}\",\"new_string\":\"function placeFacing(x, z) {\\n  const w = game.world;\\n  if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\\n  w.teleport(x, z + 4);\\n  game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\\n  engine.step(1, DT);\\n}\\n\\nfunction texBytes(tex) {\\n  const image = tex && tex.image;\\n  if (image && image.data) return image.data;\\n  const source = tex && tex.source && tex.source.data;\\n  if (source && source.data) return source.data;\\n  return source || image || null;\\n}\\n\\nfunction assertHeldMap(w, label) {\\n  const sheet = w.mapSheet;\\n  const cam = game.ctx.camera.camera;\\n  assert(sheet && sheet.visible, label + ' map is not in the hands');\\n  assert(sheet.parent === cam, label + ' map is not parented to the camera');\\n  assert(texBytes(w.mapTex) === w.mapPx, label + ' map texture does not read mapPx');\\n  assert(sheet.material && sheet.material.map === w.mapTex, label + ' mesh does not sample mapPx');\\n  const gps = sheet.getObjectByName('gps');\\n  assert(gps, label + ' gps missing');\\n  assert(texBytes(w.gpsTex) === w.gpsPx, label + ' gps texture does not read gpsPx');\\n  assert(gps.material && gps.material.map === w.gpsTex, label + ' gps mesh does not sample gpsPx');\\n  let marked = false;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < w.gpsPx.length; i += 4) {\\n    if (w.gpsPx[i] === 220 && w.gpsPx[i + 1] === 48) marked = true;\\n  }\\n  assert(marked, label + ' gps did not paint');\\n}\\n\\nfunction assertRig(actor, label) {\\n  assert(actor && actor.view, label + ' has no rig');\\n  assert(actor.view.parent === game.ctx.scene, label + ' rig is not in the scene');\\n  actor.x = (actor.x || 0) + 6;\\n  engine.step(1, DT);\\n  const dx = Math.abs(actor.view.position.x - actor.x);\\n  assert(dx < 0.05, label + ' rig did not follow ' + actor.view.position.x + ' vs ' + actor.x);\\n}\\n\\nfunction lightCurrentBurn() {\\n  const w = game.world;\\n  const step = w.currentStep();\\n  if (w.inVehicle && w.vehicleHp >= 50) tap('KeyE');\\n  const r = step.r || 12;\\n  const origin = w.fire.cellAt(step.x, step.z);\\n  let lx = step.x;\\n  let lz = step.z;\\n  const reach = Math.ceil(r / 5);\\n  let best = Infinity;\\n  for (let dz = -reach; dz <= reach; dz++) {\\n    for (let dx = -reach; dx <= reach; dx++) {\\n      const ix = origin.ix + dx;\\n      const iz = origin.iz + dz;\\n      if (ix < 0 || iz < 0 || ix >= 256 || iz >= 256) continue;\\n      const i = w.fire.idx(ix, iz);\\n      if (w.fire.fuel[i] <= 0 || w.fire.state[i] !== 0) continue;\\n      const [cx, cz] = w.fire.center(ix, iz);\\n      const d = Math.hypot(cx - step.x, cz - step.z);\\n      if (d > r - 1 || d >= best) continue;\\n      best = d;\\n      lx = cx;\\n      lz = cz;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  w.teleport(lx, lz + 18);\\n  game.ctx.camera.yaw = 0;\\n  arm('flare');\\n  tapFire();\\n  engine.step(20, DT);\\n}\\n\\nfunction clickHud(pixelY) {\\n  engine.input.setPointer(0, 1 - (pixelY / 270) * 2, true);\\n  engine.input.setButtons(1);\\n  engine.step(1, DT);\\n  engine.input.setButtons(0);\\n  engine.step(1, DT);\\n}\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-