{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_513","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The held map assertions passed. The walk assertion is next.\n\nThe map is visible but the world does not move during walking. Fever and tablet states are ruled out as causes. The character may be colliding with the clinic block at 12, 55.\n\nThe player spawns inside the clinic block, so they are stuck in geometry and cannot move. The test should teleport to an open spot before walking with the map.\n\nTeleporting to 80, 120 places the player outside the town block. The map is already raised before the walk test begins.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-20996762-1cc0-488a-92c0-2c5515198be3-77","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  assert(w.map.up && w.map.anim > 0.9, 'map did not rise on foot ' + w.map.anim);\n  assertHeldMap(w, 'walking');\n  const zFoot = w.feet().z;","new_string":"  assert(w.map.up && w.map.anim > 0.9, 'map did not rise on foot ' + w.map.anim);\n  assertHeldMap(w, 'walking');\n  w.teleport(80, 120);\n  engine.step(2, DT);\n  const zFoot = w.feet().z;"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":832,"output_tokens":821,"cache_read_input_tokens":119936,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"2918ef3b-628a-4cb0-89d5-b2a5ee8c0188"}
