{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_521","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"game.update is called even when the scaled delta time e is zero.\n\nFocus is unexpectedly zero. Debug logging will be added to trace the cause. The HUD height needs verification. The arrow keys do not trigger the click handler. The MouseLeft button press might activate the first menu item.\n\nRe-examining the hover code from disk. Considering whether keyboard repeat or a `nudge` event is altering focus before the click step completes.\n\nThe test itself is likely at fault. With focus at 10, the first visible row is index 4, so clicking y=86 should set focus to 4, not 0. The developer suspects a bug in the test logic rather than the hover code.\n\nThe running hover code may still be the old version. If focus resets to 0, the new logic is not active. The developer will re-read src/game.js to verify the edit was saved.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8db67347-da89-4e55-95ce-0d5739640680-86","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"this\\.focus","glob":"**/src/game.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8db67347-da89-4e55-95ce-0d5739640680-87","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","offset":610,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":714,"output_tokens":751,"cache_read_input_tokens":126592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"3d8bb530-2d33-4355-8302-5ae56aa26df8"}
