{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_528","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Menus passed. Running the story test for m6, then --all.\n\nRunning --all once instead of story first. The m8 hold makes it long, so I'll set a high timeout and log output to scratch/tests-all.log.\n\nThe scratch directory is set. I'll run --all with a 5-minute timeout and tee output to the log. I'll wait for tests to finish before rebuilding.\n\nChecking a potential focus bug in the release-frame logic. A real mouse release may not match the test's pointer-park behavior. The reset button flow is also being verified.\n\nThe reset button flow is correct. The focus jump only happens when a click scrolls the window, which causes a minor highlight bug after activation. The activation itself was already fixed.\n\nThe code is correct and will not be changed. Story playMission buddy-down is included in --all. Shared state between tests is safe because story clears deadBuddies. Menu changes at the end reset glyphs and sliders. Solo test merc rigs and clearBuddies should work.\n\nNo forbidden strings were introduced. The pixel-engine file was not edited.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b2910ce-73bb-4df3-9b98-6c54d6e94106-96","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"dev-hit","status":"completed"},{"id":"reverify","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b2910ce-73bb-4df3-9b98-6c54d6e94106-97","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917\" && node tests/run.mjs --all > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/tests-all.log\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$?; tail -n 30 \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/tests-all.log\"","description":"Run full headless acceptance suite and save log","block_until_ms":300000}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b2910ce-73bb-4df3-9b98-6c54d6e94106-98","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/PROGRESS.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b2910ce-73bb-4df3-9b98-6c54d6e94106-99","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"build\\.mjs|OUT|game\\.html","glob":"**/tools/build.mjs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":266,"output_tokens":1279,"cache_read_input_tokens":138752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"6cccee3e-6794-4831-a08c-728fbf076eab"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1b2910ce-73bb-4df3-9b98-6c54d6e94106-96","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [completed] map-draw: Draw the held map from mapPx while walking and driving, and assert that path\\n- [completed] m6-syrette: Let knockBuddy offer syrette or finish-it, finish-it only with no syrette\\n- [completed] actor-mesh: Instance soldier rigs for soldiers, mercs, buddies, and civilians and move them with the actors\\n- [completed] dev-hit: Hit-test Dev Mode against the same 9-row window the HUD draws\\n- [in_progress] reverify: Rebuild HTML, rerun headless tests, file://, phone, hub, and refresh hand-in\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Draw the held map from mapPx while walking and driving, and assert that path\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Let knockBuddy offer syrette or finish-it, finish-it only with no syrette\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Instance soldier rigs for soldiers, mercs, buddies, and civilians and move them with the actors\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Hit-test Dev Mode against the same 9-row window the HUD draws\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Rebuild HTML, rerun headless tests, file://, phone, hub, and refresh hand-in\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}],\"state\":{\"todos\":{\"map-draw\":{\"content\":\"Draw the held map from mapPx while walking and driving, and assert that path\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"m6-syrette\":{\"content\":\"Let knockBuddy offer syrette or finish-it, finish-it only with no syrette\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"actor-mesh\":{\"content\":\"Instance soldier rigs for soldiers, mercs, buddies, and civilians and move them with the actors\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"dev-hit\":{\"conten