{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_529","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All tests passed. Now proceeding to the next steps.\n\nRebuilding HTML and copying it to tests/.site/game.html. Re-running boots, touch, hub, link, and screenshots next. Will update PROGRESS.md. The four bugs were not caught by the original suite; they were found after the suite turned green. The tests and code were fixed afterward.\n\nThe issue count in about.js will remain 13. The adversarial verifier caught the four bugs, not the original test suite. The new tests guard the fixes. The earlier test failures were only setup issues.\n\nThe scrolled-click focus bug was a test measurement error. The down frame was correct; the release frame was misread.\n\nPROGRESS.md will be updated to cover map mesh, actor rigs, syrette-on-knock, and dev hit-test. Re-run checks are noted.\n\nExisting scratch scripts will be reviewed before rebuilding.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e8b4169-49b1-4a2f-a4f2-899382430830-100","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/tools/build.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e8b4169-49b1-4a2f-a4f2-899382430830-101","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2473,"output_tokens":643,"cache_read_input_tokens":139008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"2894bd20-5e90-4e9b-a89f-ff1b48543fea"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3e8b4169-49b1-4a2f-a4f2-899382430830-100","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Pack one HTML file that boots from file://. Run from the dev folder: node tools/build.mjs */\\nimport { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';\\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { dirname, join } from 'node:path';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\n\\nconst dev = dirname(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)));\\nconst OUT = join(dirname(dev), 'A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html');\\n\\n10→const js = execFileSync('esbuild', [\\n  'src/main.js',\\n  '--bundle',\\n  '--format=esm',\\n  '--target=esnext',\\n  '--legal-comments=inline',\\n  '--log-level=warning',\\n], { cwd: dev, maxBuffer: 1 << 29 }).toString();\\n\\nconst session = readFileSync(join(dev, 'vendor', 'session.js'), 'utf8');\\n20→const hide = (text) => text.replace(/<\\\\/script/gi, '<\\\\\\\\/script');\\n\\nconst html = `<!doctype html><html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<script>${hide(session)}</script>\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session\\\" content=\\\"1\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-players\\\" content=\\\"1-4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-mode\\\" content=\\\"shared-world\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"6\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:webgpu\\\" content=\\\"required\\\">\\n30→<meta name=\\\"hub:session-goal\\\" content=\\\"Carry the most diamond cases out of the burning mine\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Stick/WASD move, R2/mouse fire, Square/E use, carry cases to the truck\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>A Cry Too Far</title>\\n</head><body><div id=\\\"app\\\"></div><script type=\\\"module\\\">${hide(js)}</script></body></html>\\n`;\\n\\nconst credits = readFileSync(join(dev, 'CREDITS.md'), 'utf8').replace(/-->/g, '--&gt;');\\nwriteFileSync(OUT, html + '\\\\n<!--\\\\n' + credits + '\\\\n-->\\\\n');\\nconsole.log('wrote ' + OUT + ' ' + (html.length + credits.length) + ' chars');\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Pack one HTML file that boots from file://. Run from the dev folder: node tools/build.mjs */\\nimport { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';\\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { dirname, join } from 'node:path';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\n\\nconst dev = dirname(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)));\\nconst OUT = join(dirname(dev), 'A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html');\\n\\n10→const js = execFileSync('esbuild', [\\n  'src/main.js',\\n  '--bundle',\\n  '--format=esm',\\n  '--target=esnext',\\n  '--legal-comments=inline',\\n  '--log-level=warning',\\n], { cwd: dev, maxBuffer: 1 << 29 }).toString();\\n\\nconst session = readFileSync(join(dev, 'vendor', 'session.js'), 'utf8');\\n20→const hide = (text) => text.replace(/<\\\\/script/gi, '<\\\\\\\\/script');\\n\\nconst html = `<!doctype html><html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<script>${hide(session)}</script>\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session\\\" content=\\\"1\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-players\\\" content=\\\"1-4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-mode\\\" content=\\\"shared-world\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"6\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:webgpu\\\" content=\\\"required\\\">\\n30→<meta name=\\\"hub:session-goal\\\" content=\\\"Carry the most diamond cases out of the burning mine\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Stick/WASD move, R2/mouse fire, Square/E use, carry cases to the truck\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>A Cry Too Far</title>\\n</head><body><div id=\\\"app\\\"></div><script type=\\\"module\\\">${hide(js)}</script></body></html>\\n`;\\n\\nconst credits = readFileSync(joi