{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_531","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Updating shots.mjs so the map-truck shot shows the held map in first person rather than a third-person view of the truck.\n\nAdding a fight frame with soldier rigs visible. The held map is parented to the first-person camera, but look.override may replace that camera with a third-person view of the truck. I need to understand how look.override works.\n\nI will skip look.override and keep the first-person camera. The held map will be animated with map.anim = 1 and map.up = true, then synced to the camera via syncViews. poseMap must run during that sync.\n\nI will explicitly set look.override to null so the first-person camera renders the held map. For the fight shot, I will spawn a soldier a few meters ahead and step a few frames so placeRig runs before screenshotting.\n\nThe next steps are rebuild, copy HTML, boots, touch, hub, link, and shots, running one browser at a time. I need to read the rest of shots.mjs to find the right insertion point for the fight shot. The map sheet faces +Z while the camera looks down -Z, so it should be visible in front of the held-map frame.\n\nThe held map plane may be culled. Its +Z normal faces away from the camera looking down -Z, so the backface could be hidden. The rotation tilts the plane, but it might not face the camera.\n\nI will rebuild and inspect the PNG to confirm the held map appears. If backface culling hides it, I will adjust the plane rotation so the textured side faces the camera.\n\nThe held map plane is backfaced to the camera. Its default +Z normal points away from the camera looking down -Z, so the front side is culled. Rotating the plane 180 degrees around Y will flip its normal toward the camera.\n\nThe held map plane's default +Z normal already faces the camera, so it is not backfaced. The prior rotation fix was unnecessary.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9f86d5f9-2ebe-44cc-81d8-75151b163243-107","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"override","glob":"**/src/core/look.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9f86d5f9-2ebe-44cc-81d8-75151b163243-108","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots.mjs","offset":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5373,"output_tokens":1536,"cache_read_input_tokens":142976,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"4a846d92-4b36-45bf-9ea8-6ff5e54aa140"}
