{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_558","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The dev menu hover fix is missing a test.\n\nThe missing test may be grounds to refute the change. The repo already has a way to test this behavior, and the prior gap explicitly required hit-testing the same window.\n\nThe prior gap is fixed. Existing menu tests already cover this behavior via tap and setPointer. A stronger test could be suggested, but it cannot be grounds to refute the change.\n\nThe prior gap required hit-testing the HUD window as a code fix, not a new test. The verification plan did not mandate a dev-hover test. A new objection must be a demonstrable defect or unmet gating criterion, not a stylistic preference.\n\nThe hover fix will be accepted if the code is correct. The menuWindow and hover logic are being inspected for any remaining bugs.\n\nA bug was found in the hover logic. It mutates `this.focus` inside the loop, but `menuWindow` was computed once from the old focus value. The hit test therefore uses the window drawn last frame instead of the current one.\n\nThe hover bug is harmless. Focus updates mid-loop are safe because rows do not overlap and only one row matches. A separate issue was noted: draw and hover both use focus minus six.\n\nThe hover fix is confirmed correct. The focused item stays six rows below the window start in both draw and hover. Reset and back remain on screen when focus is at index 22. The next check is soldiers: attachRig uses buildModel(soldier).\n\nbuildModel works headlessly. syncViews runs during engine.step. Civilians keep their views across mission reset. Buddies attach rigs correctly.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d1242bf0-3b7e-43f0-8943-1a2f7af9b720-92","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function toonMaterial|export function toonMaterial|toonMaterial =","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/world/terrain.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d1242bf0-3b7e-43f0-8943-1a2f7af9b720-93","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/world/terrain.js","offset":1,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d1242bf0-3b7e-43f0-8943-1a2f7af9b720-94","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":1,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d1242bf0-3b7e-43f0-8943-1a2f7af9b720-95","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","offset":200,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d1242bf0-3b7e-43f0-8943-1a2f7af9b720-96","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"held-map|mapSheet|attachRig|menuWindow","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3232,"output_tokens":1778,"cache_read_input_tokens":196096,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"f73ba74f-bd70-4fbe-94dc-1c68c3bd3fe5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d1242bf0-3b7e-43f0-8943-1a2f7af9b720-92","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,57,49,55,95,95,120,48,55,51,57,51,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d1242bf0-3b7e-43f0-8943-1a2f7af9b720-93","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { PALETTE, THREE, Terrain, createNoise, toonMaterial } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\\nimport { RIVER, ROADS, distToPoly, nearRiver, nearRoad } from '../content/roads.js';\\nimport { SITES } from '../content/sites.js';\\nimport { FIRE_CELL, FIRE_N, FIRE_ORIGIN } from './fire.js';\\n\\nconst { Color, Mesh, BoxGeometry } = THREE;\\n\\nexport function heightFn(seed) {\\n  const n = createNoise(seed);\\n10→  const fbm = (x, z, f) => n.fbm2(x * f, z * f, { octaves: 3 });\\n  return (x, z) => {\\n    let h = 40 + 14 * fbm(x, z, 0.0032) + 2.5 * fbm(x, z, 0.02);\\n    const rd = Math.hypot(x + 130, z + 520);\\n    if (rd < 260) {\\n      const t = 1 - rd / 260;\\n      h += 42 * t * t * (0.55 + 0.45 * n.ridged2(x * 0.008, z * 0.008, { octaves: 2 }));\\n    }\\n    if (x < -520) {\\n      const pass = Math.hypot(x + 590, z + 430);\\n20→      const cut = pass < 90 ? pass / 90 : 1;\\n      h += 30 * Math.min(1, (-520 - x) / 90) * cut;\\n    }\\n    const sd = Math.hypot(x - 200, z - 470);\\n    if (sd < 150) h = h * (sd / 150) + 36 * (1 - sd / 150);\\n    const md = Math.hypot(x - 150, z + 300);\\n    if (md < 70) h -= 24 * (1 - md / 70);\\n    const riverD = distToPoly(x, z, RIVER);\\n    if (riverD < 7) h -= 3 * (1 - riverD / 7);\\n    let roadD = 99;\\n30→    for (const road of ROADS) {\\n      const d = distToPoly(x, z, road.pts);\\n      if (d < roadD) roadD = d;\\n    }\\n    if (roadD < 8) h = h * (roadD / 8) + (h - 0.4) * (1 - roadD / 8);\\n    for (const s of SITES) {\\n      const d = Math.hypot(x - s.x, z - s.z);\\n      if (d < 18) h = h * (d / 18) + h * (1 - d / 18);\\n    }\\n    return h;\\n40→  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function buildLand(ctx, seed) {\\n  const sample = heightFn(seed);\\n  const land = new Terrain({\\n    size: [1280, 1280],\\n    cells: [512, 512],\\n    at: [0, 0, 0],\\n    bands: [\\n50→      { below: 34, color: PALETTE.teal },\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { PALETTE, THREE, Terrain, createNoise, toonMaterial } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\\nimport { RIVER, ROADS, distToPoly, nearRiver, nearRoad } from '../content/roads.js';\\nimport { SITES } from '../content/sites.js';\\nimport { FIRE_CELL, FIRE_N, FIRE_ORIGIN } from './fire.js';\\n\\nconst { Color, Mesh, BoxGeometry } = THREE;\\n\\nexport function heightFn(seed) {\\n  const n = createNoise(seed);\\n10→  const fbm = (x, z, f) => n.fbm2(x * f, z * f, { octaves: 3 });\\n  return (x, z) => {\\n    let h = 40 + 14 * fbm(x, z, 0.0032) + 2.5 * fbm(x, z, 0.02);\\n    const rd = Math.hypot(x + 130, z + 520);\\n    if (rd < 260) {\\n      const t = 1 - rd / 260;\\n      h += 42 * t * t * (0.55 + 0.45 * n.ridged2(x * 0.008, z * 0.008, { octaves: 2 }));\\n    }\\n    if (x < -520) {\\n      const pass = Math.hypot(x + 590, z + 430);\\n20→      const cut = pass < 90 ? pass / 90 : 1;\\n      h += 30 * Math.min(1, (-520 - x) / 90) * cut;\\n    }\\n    const sd = Math.hypot(x - 200, z - 470);\\n    if (sd < 150) h = h * (sd / 150) + 36 * (1 - sd / 150);\\n    const md = Math.hypot(x - 150, z + 300);\\n    if (md