{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_567","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Log files are newer than the source code. The tests, world.js, and HTML were all modified after the logs were generated.\n\ngame.js predates world.js. Both files were modified before the test log. The HTML rebuild also occurred before the tests ran.\n\nThe WebKit log is stale and was accepted in round one. The touch log is current. I will check launch logs, hub status, links, and screenshots to confirm the new HTML works.\n\nI will verify that Reset appears in game.js items() and that dev mode is active. I also need to check if shots.mjs renders synthetic screenshots instead of real frames. A possible clipping bug with the map camera child or GPS overlay will be visible in the images.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d44b3b-19b3-4bd1-9dbd-8f007c8d2174-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/game.js","offset":300,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d44b3b-19b3-4bd1-9dbd-8f007c8d2174-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/launch-1.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d44b3b-19b3-4bd1-9dbd-8f007c8d2174-25","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/launch-2.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d44b3b-19b3-4bd1-9dbd-8f007c8d2174-26","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/notes.json"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2d44b3b-19b3-4bd1-9dbd-8f007c8d2174-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":