{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_568","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will check the screenshots to confirm the map and soldier are visible.\n\nThe notes likely reflect state flags rather than pixel data, so I will read the PNGs directly. A potential bug remains: surgery notes still show a 60-second timer, though tests assert it works; this may be a mid-state snapshot rather than a failure. The dev-sliders menu also appears truncated to six items, which conflicts with the full list in state().\n\nThe dev-sliders menu discrepancy likely stems from the screenshot script truncating the log. The notes were captured at 04:24, after game.js was modified at 03:59, so the full key set should be present. I will inspect shots.mjs to confirm.\n\nThe truncated dev-sliders menu is likely just a screenshot artifact, not a real bug. I am now checking the map camera attachment and the truck sprite directly in the PNGs, since those state flags could be misleading.\n\nI am checking whether the map sheet is hidden behind the camera. The engine first-person rig looks down −Z, so a local z of −0.42 should place the map forward. The screenshot will confirm this.\n\nI am also checking whether the map sheet could be invisible despite its visible flag if the material is broken. I reviewed the dev-sliders hover logic and confirmed the prior index bug is fixed.\n\nI will verify the two screenshots are not blank or showing the wrong scene. I also need to check whether map-truck renders after holding the map. A new concern is that 1-pixel GPS scars on a 0.5-meter plane might be invisible.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-89edcbb2-aaf1-4b4b-97cd-ac19dd6c2475-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots.mjs","limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-89edcbb2-aaf1-4b4b-97cd-ac19dd6c2475-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/map-truck.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-89edcbb2-aaf1-4b4b-97cd-ac19dd6c2475-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/fight.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5177,"output_tokens":1178,"cache_read_input_tokens":76416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"fa343675-7ddd-42ef-96e7-ac56b7a28b04"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-89edcbb2-aaf1-4b4b-97cd-ac19dd6c2475-30","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Screenshots after the shipped page has been rendering. One browser. */\\nimport { mkdirSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { pathToFileURL } from 'node:url';\\nimport { createRequire } from 'node:module';\\nconst require = createRequire('/home/micha/dev/my-3d2dge/package.json');\\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\\n\\nconst html = '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html';\\nconst scratch = '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer';\\n10→const dir = scratch + '/shots';\\nmkdirSync(dir, { recursive: true });\\nconst flags = [\\n  '--enable-unsafe-webgpu',\\n  '--enable-features=Vulkan',\\n  '--use-vulkan=swiftshader',\\n  '--use-angle=swiftshader',\\n  '--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader',\\n];\\n\\n20→const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true, args: flags });\\nconst page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 1920, height: 1080 } });\\nconst errors = [];\\npage.on('console', (msg) => { if (msg.type() === 'error') errors.push(msg.text()); });\\npage.on('pageerror', (err) => errors.push('pageerror ' + err.message));\\nawait page.goto(pathToFileURL(html).href, { waitUntil: 'load', timeout: 90000 });\\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__ && window.__GAME__.state().title, null, { timeout: 90000 });\\n\\nawait page.evaluate(() => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n30→  if (g.attract) g.exitAttract();\\n  g.world.startMission('m1');\\n  g.world.giveGun('tractor', 100);\\n  g.look.override = null;\\n});\\nawait page.waitForTimeout(12000);\\n\\nconst notes = {};\\nasync function grab(name, setup) {\\n  const info = await page.evaluate(setup);\\n40→  await page.waitForTimeout(3500);\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: dir + '/' + name + '.png' });\\n  notes[name] = info;\\n}\\n\\nawait grab('day-gun', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  const s = g.state();\\n  return { screen: s.screen, hour: s.hour, weapon: s.weapon, frame: g.frame };\\n});\\n50→\\nawait grab('title', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.attract = false;\\n  g.look.override = null;\\n  g.toTitle();\\n  return { screen: g.screen, title: g.state().title, menu: g.state().menu };\\n});\\n\\nawait grab('night-fire', () => {\\n60→  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.world.startMission('m6');\\n  g.world.gameHours = 22;\\n  g.world.hour = 22;\\n  const p = g.world.feet();\\n  g.world.fire.ignite(p.x, p.z - 14, 8);\\n  const y = g.world.ground(p.x, p.z - 14);\\n  g.look.override = {\\n    position: [p.x, y + 10, p.z + 6],\\n    target: [p.x, y + 1, p.z - 14],\\n70→  };\\n  return { hour: g.world.hour, burning: g.world.fire.burning.length };\\n});\\n\\nawait grab('map-truck', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.look.override = null;\\n  g.world.startMission('m1');\\n  const t = g.world.truckPos();\\n  g.world.inVehicle = true;\\n80→  if (g.world.hero?.collider) g.world.hero.collider.setEnabled(false);\\n  g.world.hero.teleport([t.x, g.world.ground(t.x, t.z) + 1.7, t.z]);\\n  g.world.map.up = true;\\n  g.world.map.anim = 1;\\n  g.world.syncViews();\\n  const sheet = g.world.mapSheet;\\n  return {\\n    vehicle: g.world.inVehicle,\\n    map: g.world.map.up,\\n    sheet: !!(sheet && sheet.visible),\\n90→    inScene: !!(sheet && sheet.parent && sheet.parent.parent === g.ctx.scene),\\n    truck: t,\\n  };\\n});\\n\\nawait grab('fight', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.look.override = null;\\n  g.world.map.up = false;\\n  g.world.map.anim = 0;\\n100→  g.world.syncViews();\\n  const p = g.world.feet();\\n  const yaw = g.ctx.camera.yaw || 0;\\n  const x = p.x + Math.sin(yaw) * -7;\\n  const z = p.z + Math.cos(yaw) * -7;\\n  const foe = g.world.spawnSoldier({ id: 'shot-foe', x, z, yaw: yaw + Math.PI, faction: 'concord' });\\n  g.world.syncViews();\\n  const view = foe.view;\\n  return {\\n    rig: !!(view && view.parent === g.ctx.scene),\\n110→    at: view ? { x: view.position.x, y: view.position.y, z: view.position.z } : null,\\n    player: { x: p.x, z: p.z },\\n  };\\n});\\n\\nawait grab('tibor-rack', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.look.override = null;\\n  g.world.startMission('m2');\\n  g.world.advanceLines();\\n120→  g.world.advanceLines();\\n  return { subtitle: g.world.subtitle, speaker: g.world.speaker, screen: g.screen };\\n});\\n\\nawait grab('dialogue', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.world.startMission('m3');\\n  g.world.advanceLines();\\n  return { subtitle: g.world.subtitle, speaker: g.world.speaker };\\n});\\n130→\\nawait grab('surgery', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.world.startMission('m1');\\n  g.world.hp = 12;\\n  g.world.surgeryT = 60;\\n  g.world.subtitle = 'HOLD STILL.';\\n  g.world.prompt = 'FIELD SURGERY';\\n  g.look.override = null;\\n  return { hp: g.world.hp, surgeryT: g.world.surgeryT, prompt: g.world.prompt };\\n140→});\\n\\nawait grab('dev-sliders', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.look.override = null;\\n  if (g.mode !== 'play') g.world.startMission('m1');\\n  g.openPause();\\n  g.screen = 'dev';\\n  g.focus = 0;\\n  return { screen: g.screen, menu: g.items().map((item) => item.label).slice(0, 6) };\\n150→});\\n\\nawait grab('ending', () => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  if (g.ctx?.engine) g.ctx.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n  g.showEnding('walk');\\n  return { screen: g.screen, ending: g.ending, menu: g.state().menu };\\n});\\n\\nawait grab('hub-card', () => {\\n160→  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n  g.mode = 'card';\\n  g.screen = 'card';\\n  g.attract = false;\\n  g.card = { ready: [0], left: 9000 };\\n  g.session = { players: [{ id: 0, name: 'HOST' }, { id: 1, name: 'JOIN' }], answer() {} };\\n  return { mode: g.mode, players: 2 };\\n});\\n\\nwriteFileSync(dir + '/notes.json', JSON.stringify({ errors, notes }, null, 2) + '\\\\n');\\n170→console.log(JSON.stringify({ errors: errors.length, shots: Object.keys(notes) }, null, 2));\\nawait browser.close();\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Screenshots after the shipped page has been rendering. One browser. */\\nimport { mkdirSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { pathToFileURL } from 'node:url';\\nimport { createRequire } from 'node:module';\\nconst require = createRequire('/home/micha/dev/my-3d2dge/package.json');\\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\\n\\nconst html = '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html';\\nconst scratch = '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer';\\n10→const dir = scratch + '/shots';\\nmkdirSync(dir, { recursive: true });\\nconst flags = [\\n  '--enable-unsafe-webgpu',\\n  '--enable-features=Vulkan',\\n  '--use-vulkan=swiftshader',\\n  '--use-angle=swiftshader',\\n  '--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader',\\n];\\n\\n20→const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true, args: flags });\\nconst page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 1920, height: 1080 } });\\nconst errors = [];\\npage.on('console', (msg) => { if (msg.type() === 'error') errors.push(msg.text()); });\\npage.on('pageerror', (err) => errors.push('pageerror ' + err.message));\\nawait page.goto(pathToFileURL(html).href, { waitUntil: 'load', timeout: 90000 });\\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__ && window.__GAME__.state().title, null, { timeout: 90000 });\\n\\nawait page.evaluate(() => {\\n  const g = window.__GAME__;\\n30→  if (g.attract) g.exitAttract();\\n  g.world.startMission('m1');\\n  g.world.giveGun('tractor', 100);\\n  g.look.override = null;\\n});\\nawait page.waitForTimeout(12000);\\n\\nconst notes = {};\\nas