{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_573","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will act as an adversarial verifier for the Grok Build harness.I will act as an adversarial verifier for the Grok Build harness.\n\nI am checking whether prior implementation gaps have been fixed. The held map and GPS never appear because mapPx is painted but\n\nI will verify two  never read by the mesh,prior gaps. The map  DataTexture, or HUDis never rendered in blit. I will verify the hands; only a hidden that the map draws  cursor moves, and noin the hands during walking and driving. mesh or HUD reads the texture. M6 also forces burning on knockBuddy(), which blocks syrette use and leaves only the finish-it path.\n\nknockBuddy() always sets burning:true, which blocks syrette use and forces finish-it. I will allow syrette or finish-it on that down and assert it through knockBuddy(). spawnSoldier never adds a mesh to the scene, so first-person fights have nothing to aim at. I will instance the rig in the world and move it with the actor.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I'll audit the four prior gaps against the current game, plan, and captured tests before judging whether the hand-in\n\nI'll\n\n actually\n\n audit the four prior\n\n holds\n\n gaps against the shipped\n\n.\n\n code and the implementer's captured tests, not the summary."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5c3ee0b8-8b67-40e7-91ab-cacc2e7ee142-0","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5c3ee0b8-8b67-40e7-91ab-cacc2e7ee142-1","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5c3ee0b8-8b67-40e7-91ab-cacc2e7ee142-2","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"mapPx|knockBuddy|spawnSoldier|devMode|map-sheet