,52,54,58,35,35,32,82,105,115,107,115,32,47,32,67,111,110,116,114,97,100,105,99,116,105,111,110,115,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":13,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c%2Fwork/01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"## Goal kind\"},{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\"## Acceptance criteria\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"1. gating: From the dev subfolder run `node tests/run.mjs --all` and capture stdout and stderr to `{SCRATCH}/tests-all.log`. Pass only if the process exits 0 and the summary line reports 0 failed. Suites must call the shipped game (headless engine, real actions, `step` from a fresh start or a mission setup), not a copy of the rules. Required observations: fire head speed in the 2–5 m/s band at 5 m/s wind and slower flanks; a burnt cell does not ignite again; a jam blocks fire and repeated reload clears it; condition 0 empties the slot; a tablet clears fever and ignoring it costs stones; surgery, rescue, and finish-it behave as in criterion 2; the map can be raised while driving and its cursor sets a waypoint; clean-storage music volume is 0.1; every balance slider changes its system and Reset restores every default; attract does not start before the 10-second boundary, does start at that boundary with no input, and exits on input without a save write; a solo round banks a case, drops i [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\"2. gating: Launch the real built HTML from `file://` twice, in Chromium via Playwright at 1920×1080, with the WebGPU flags in PLAN.md §24. Capture `{SCRATCH}/launch-1.log` and `{SCRATCH}/launch-2.log`. Each run must show no page or console errors, `AIHub.active` false, and game state whose title string equals the RNG pick. The two runs must agree. If Playwright itself cannot start, write that failure to `{SCRATCH}/launch-env.log`; the headless suite in step 1 is then the accepted bar. A screenshot buffer that comes back blank is not proof of failure and not proof of success; the state assertion is the primary observable (this machine's software WebGPU canvas can be blank). Do not invent a stand-in page.\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\"3. gating: On Playwright's iPhone 14 profile under Chromium (drop the WebKit device default), open the same file and capture `{SCRATCH}/touch.log`. Pass only if the notice text is exactly `Controller or keyboard required`, a Settings control is shown, a tap opens Settings, and attract is not blocked. A WebKit iPhone load that fails for lack of WebGPU is evidence only; record it in `{SCRATCH}/webkit-iphone.log` and do not treat it as the gate.\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"4. gating: Copy the built HTML beside the hub harness files, serve that directory with `python3 -u -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`, confirm the page title is the chosen game title, then run the four PLAN.md §24 scenarios one at a time. Pass only when each reaches `document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'` and `window.__hubCheck.pass === true`. Capture `{SCRATCH}/hub.log`, including any failed `__hubCheck.checks`. Stop only that server, by its PID. If same-computer link was not cut, also drive two `file://` pages through one shared round to matching standings and a shared fire or case, logged in `{SCRATCH}/link.log`. If link was cut, that log must show the feature is absent (no menu entry).\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"## Non-goals\"},{\"line_number\":27,\"content\":\"## Assumed scope\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"## Implementation approach\"},{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"## Task checklist\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"- [x] Add weapons (wear, jam, break), hits, soldiers, health, syrette, surgery, and fever, with the system tests in criterion 2.\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"## Risks / Contradictions\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"57f34475-b922-45e1-bff9-41951147732a"}
