ipt>\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session\\\" content=\\\"1\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-players\\\" content=\\\"1-4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-mode\\\" content=\\\"shared-world\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"6\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:webgpu\\\" content=\\\"required\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-goal\\\" content=\\\"Carry the most diamond cases out of the burning mine\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Stick/WASD move, R2/mouse fire, Square/E use, carry cases to the truck\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>A Cry Too Far</title>\\n</head><body><div id=\\\"app\\\"></div><script type=\\\"module\\\">${hide(js)}</script></body></html>\\n`;\\n\\nconst credits = readFileSync(join(dev, 'CREDITS.md'), 'utf8').replace(/-->/g, '--&gt;');\\nwriteFileSync(OUT, html + '\\\\n<!--\\\\n' + credits + '\\\\n-->\\\\n');\\nconsole.log('wrote ' + OUT + ' ' + (html.length + credits.length) + ' chars');\\n\",\"total_lines\":39}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"629d6524-469b-4f3d-9102-005cf541bb1c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_587","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Soldiers stand and shoot rather than patrol.The fixes are in the HTML. game.js at the dev folder root is an engine example, not the actual game, so grep missed attachRig there.\n\nThe mesh now follows the actor via syncViews. The prior gap of no mesh is fixed. I am checking for real bugs in the four fixed areas and verifying gating evidence.\n\nThe actual game is src/game.js, bundled into the HTML. Screenshots\n\nThe test log shows will verify the map and soldiers are visible. ten passes and zero The prior gap was visual failures. I am checking absence. The new code its timestamp against creates a mesh and  world.js to confirmtests its scene presence, it reflects the fixed texture, and camera code. I will also review positioning. launch logs and hub.log for gating evidence.\n\nI am scrutinizing the clickHud test for adversarial validity.\n\nA potential bug surfaced: I need to verify whether the map cursor moves setPointer's third  but may not render argument actually fires buttonEvents, sinceon the map texture.  a passing test mightThe refreshMap and poseMap be misleading. functions do not appear to draw the cursor onto mapPx. The GPS display uses a wind arrow and hour bar instead.\n\nI am now investigating\n\nThe map is already a potential real bug in menuWindow. If focus drawn from mapPx during is reset to resetAt movement. The cursor before a click occurs, is a separate data  the interaction may fail.point that may not be blitted onto the texture.\n\nThe missing cursor mark may be a real \n\nThe menuWindow mathusability defect. The checks out. The focused map is visible but  item sits at the correct visual row, and clicking it resets focus to that item. A real bug was found: hover sets focus and activates the item on the samethe cursor is not drawn onto it, so waypoints cannot be placed by clicking. This could be a demonstrable defect in shipped behavior. The original gap will be re-read to confirm. step.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e31e083a-948b-4b82-8303-ebaa5b4935d9-26","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"map\\.cx|map\\.cz|stamp\\(","glob":"**/*.{js,mjs}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e31e083a-948b-4b82-8303-ebaa5b4935d9-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/map-truck.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e31e083a-948b-4b82-8303-ebaa5b4935d9-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/fight.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e31e083a-948b-4b82-8303-ebaa5b4935d9-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/dev-sliders.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2022,"output_tokens":980,"cache_read_input_tokens":77184,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"199a831d-a563-4bd7-b0a3-adb4d953f3a4"}
