{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_588","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe map sheet sits 0.42 units in front of the camera and slightly below, so it remains visible in the hands. A potential bug was noted: the map sheet may only be shown during play, round, or attract modes.\n\nThe map sheet is confirmed visible during the play test mode. The mountMap early return is safe because the test asserts the sheet exists. Three.js DataTexture identity is also acceptable since the test passed. I still need to verify the log timestamp against the source file modification time.The screenshots show a map visible in the hands while in a vehicle, featuring a tan sheet with a GPS black square and red dot.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7c2db55f-bad2-43a8-9d0d-6d382918c81a-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"keepCivilians|clearBuddies","glob":"**/*.js","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7c2db55f-bad2-43a8-9d0d-6d382918c81a-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/hub.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7c2db55f-bad2-43a8-9d0d-6d382918c81a-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/launch-1.log","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7c2db55f-bad2-43a8-9d0d-6d382918c81a-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/touch.log","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7c2db55f-bad2-43a8-9d0d-6d382918c81a-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/