{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_592","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" and makeBuddy spreading.\n\nThe `clearBuddies` loop spreads `makeBuddy(id)` into a new object. The copied `view` reference remains attached to the scene mesh, so the original buddy objectI need to inspect tickActors to verify soldier movement and rig behavior during is discarded but its combat. mesh persists.\n\nThe `keepCivilians` logic is sound. It drops soldier views and filters out non-civil actors before remaking buddies.\n\nThe map may be missing sites because `paintMapBase` fills sand, `refreshMap` stamps burnt cells and the player, but roads and sites might not be drawn onto `mapPx`. The prior gap was specifically that `mapPx` is not displayed.\n\nChecking for a bug where attachRig returns early if the scene is not ready at spawn time. makeBuddy handles this correctly by deferring attachment via syncViews. Also verifying that tickActors updates soldier positions and that placeRig copies x,z values so the mesh stays aligned with actor data. The buddy-down rotation logic looks correct.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88a71a20-5626-4e67-9caa-ac8309375539-38","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"map|syrette|finish|soldier|dev mode|slider|Reset","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88a71a20-5626-4e67-9caa-ac8309375539-39","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function toonMaterial|toonMaterial=|const toonMaterial","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/pixel-engine.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88a71a20-5626-4e67-9caa-ac8309375539-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/map-truck.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88a71a20-5626-4e67-9caa-ac8309375539-41","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/fight.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88a71a20-5626-4e67-9caa-ac8309375539-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer/shots/dev-sliders.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4318,"output_tokens":991,"cache_read_input_tokens":77824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"dc28a312-9e41-4008-a4eb-e23265e51ebc"}
