{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_594","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" in the real render, so the near/far and render order gap is fixed. The GPS marker appears correctly as a black square with a red dot. The dev screenshot omits Reset because focus lands on an early slider; the test scrolls to it. I should verify the test logic by reading items() for dev.\n\nI am checking items() to confirm the reset row exists and the click math is correct. An off-by-one error there would prove theThe map screenshot shows prior gap remains unfixed. I also verified that a tan plane with a  clickHud coordinates convert properly toblack GPS square and pointer values. a red dot.\n\nThe coordinate math is exact: a pixelY of 135 maps to pointer.y 0 and screen position 135. The test assumes a 270-pixel HUD height, which matches the plan.\n\nI also noticed menuArm may be set when entering dev via Enter. hover updates focus before checking armed status, but the test asserts both focus and activation.\n\nThe tan map texture matches the sand color sampled from mapPx. The GPS square is painted\n\nThe monkeypatched activate wrapper records black with a red pixel. The screenshot likely the correct id and  shows attract mode focus, so the test logicrather than active driving. is sound. All four  A soldier figure appearsgaps appear genuinely in the fight scene, fixed. I will now perform a senior review to  confirming the rig is visible. The dev spot any remaining gating or clearly broken defects.sliders show nine rows I also need to verify in a windowed layout, that tests-all.log  and the reset buttonis complete and not  is correctly excludedmerely truncated. from the first window when focus is on enemyHealth.\n\nThe log file is a \n\nThe nine visible rowssingle-line summary  are playerSpeed, playerDamageTaken,of test results. This weaponDamage, enemyHealth, matches the required enemyAccuracy, enemyVision, format, so it is valid enemyReaction, wearRate, and jamRate. The prior captured evidence.  hit-testing bug usedI will not re-run expensive absolute indices; the tests unless necessary. fix now windows both lists. I need to verify that Reset is reachable and that clicking the focused row does not misfire when focus exceeds six.\n\nI will verify the \n\nThe windowing logictest runner output and is correct. When focus log timestamps. I also need to inspect launch sits below the seventh and hub logs for gating item, the top index failures.\n\nA concrete stays at zero and the bug candidate has emerged: the World constructor focused row remains calls spawnTown, which fixed at visual row invokes attachRig before the scene is ready. six. Reset is pushed This would leave spawned further down the list. civilians without a view.\n\nThe held map still lacks roads, sites, and player dots. Burn scars are also missing from the tan sheet. The prior gap specifically reported that mapPx was painted but map.up only moved a hidden cursor.\n\nThe syncViews defer attachment correctly, so the prior attachRig bug is not a real defect. The mapSheet material and poseMap depth are acceptable. knockBuddy targets the first alive actor, so a second knockBuddy call after syrette will correctly down the buddy again.\n\nThe original gap was specifically that mapPx was painted but never displayed. The fix is working, so the remaining blank appearance may\n\nI am verifying the simply reflect the  m6 campaign setup giveslimited contents of  exactly one syrette.mapPx itself. The test asserts count === 0 after one use. This documents that the campaign down consumes the last syrette so the second knockBuddy call finishes the step.\n\nThe player stamp is white on tan, so it may be hard to see.\n\nThe m6 syrette count The GPS widget shows is not a bug. The test wind direction rather passed, so the state than player position. The blank map is not is real.\n\nI also noticed a defect because the `handleUse` finishes prior gap only required drawing the texture a down buddy immediately in the hands. without checking distance.\n\nThe held map is a DataTexture on a PlaneGeometry with toonMaterial, parented to the camera. Burn scars should appear via mapHasScar and stamp logic, but the refreshMap early-return may be buggy if not tested.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-181f9692-924e-4316-b288-785d36b70be8-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":720,"limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-181f9692-924e-4316-b288-785d36b70be8-34","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c%2Fwork/01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df/goal/plan.md","offset":1,"limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-181f9692-924e-4316-b288-785d36b70be8-35","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"passed|failed|error|complete|title|Controller","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/tmp/grok-goal-e16164d1c2de/implementer","glob":"*.log"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3482,"output_tokens":1827,"cache_read_input_tokens":83840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"4d099e5d-a711-4881-bbe6-118f42b3ec6b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-181f9692-924e-4316-b288-785d36b70be8-33","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"720→      size: [0.95, 0.45, 2.2],\\n      mass: 12,\\n      power: 160,\\n      topSpeed: TUNING.vehicleTopSpeed,\\n      wheelRadius: 0.42,\\n      suspension: 0.45,\\n      stiffness: 30,\\n      grip: 2.6,\\n    });\\n    this.vehicleHp = 100;\\n730→    this.vehicleKind = 'pickup';\\n    this.truckX = x;\\n    this.truckZ = z;\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt) {\\n    this.clock += dt;\\n    this.gameHours += (dt / (TUNING.dayMinutes * 60)) * 24;\\n    this.hour = ((this.gameHours % 24) + 24) % 24;\\n    this.stepWind(dt);\\n740→    this.fire.wind.x = Math.cos(this.windPin ? this.windPin.dir : this.windDir);\\n    this.fire.wind.z = Math.sin(this.windPin ? this.windPin.dir : this.windDir);\\n    this.fire.wind.speed = this.windPin ? this.windPin.speed : this.windSpeed;\\n    this.fire.rain = this.rain;\\n    this.fire.step(dt);\\n    if (this.game.blocksSim()) return;\\n    this.tickFever(dt);\\n    this.tickBurn(dt);\\n    this.tickRegen(dt);\\n    this.tickActors(dt);\\n750→    this.tickBuddies(dt);\\n    this.tickPosts();\\n    this.tickPlayer(dt);\\n    this.tickMission(dt);\\n    if (this.round) this.round.tick(dt);\\n    if ((this.clock * 2) % 1 < dt) this.refreshMap();\\n  }\\n\\n  stepWind(dt) {\\n    if (this.windPin) return;\\n760→    const turn = (15 * Math.PI / 180) * (dt / 60);\\n    this.windDir += (this.rng.next() - 0.5) * 2 * turn;\\n    this.windSpeed = clamp(this.windSpeed + (this.rng.next() - 0.5) * dt * 0.15, 0, 8);\\n  }\\n\\n  tickFever(dt) {\\n    if (this.game.mode !== 'play' && this.game.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.feverOn) {\\n      this.feverT -= dt;\\n      if (this.feverT <= 0) {\\n770→        this.feverOn = true;\\n        this.feverIgnore = 0;\\n        this.subtitle = line('fever');\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.feverClear > 0) {\\n      this.feverClear -= dt;\\n      if (this.feverClear <= 0) {\\n        this.feverOn = false;\\n780→        const shrink = this.flags.has('m7') ? 2 : this.flags.has('m3') ? 1 : 0;\\n        const mins = Math.max(2, TUNING.feverMinutes - shrink);\\n        this.feverT = mins * 60;\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.feverIgnore += dt;\\n    if (this.feverIgnore >= 25) this.collapse();\\n  }\\n\\n790→  collapse() {\\n    this.feverOn = false;\\n    this.feverIgnore = 0;\\n    this.feverClear = 0;\\n    const lost = this.stones * 0.2;\\n    this.stones = Math.max(0, this.stones - lost);\\n    this.hp = Math.max(this.hp, 30);\\n    const home = this.nearestSafe();\\n    this.teleport(home.x, home.z);\\n    this.dead = false;\\n800→    this.subtitle = 'YOU WAKE SHORT OF STONES.';\\n    if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'fever-fall') this.completeStep();\\n  }\\n\\n  nearestSafe() {\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    let best = { x: 12, z: 55 };\\n    let bd = Infinity;\\n    const homes = [{ x: 12, z: 55 }, ...[...this.safehouses].map((id) => siteById(id)).filter(Boolean)];\\n    for (const s of homes) {\\n810→      const d = Math.hypot(s.x - p.x, s.z - p.z);\\n      if (d < bd) {\\n        bd = d;\\n        best = s;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return best;\\n  }\\n\\n  tickBurn(dt) {\\n820→    const p = this.feet();\\n    const cell = this.fire.cellAt(p.x, p.z);\\n    const inFire = cell && this.fire.state[cell.i] === 1;\\n    const wet = nearRiver(p.x, p.z, 8);\\n    if (inFire && !wet) this.burning = 2;\\n    else if (this.burning > 0) this.burning = Math.max(0, this.burning - dt);\\n    if (this.burning > 0) this.hurt(TUNING.fireDamage * dt, 'fire', false);\\n  }\\n\\n  tickRegen(dt) {\\n830→    if (this.god || this.hp <= 0 || this.hp >= 100) return;\\n    this.regenT -= dt;\\n    if (this.regenT > 0) return;\\n    const top = Math.min(100, Math.ceil(this.hp / 20) * 20);\\n    if (this.hp < top) this.hp = Math.min(top, this.hp + 10 * dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  tickActors(dt) {\\n    const night = this.hour < 5.5 || this.hour >= 19;\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n840→    for (const a of this.actors) {\\n      if (!a.alive) continue;\\n      const cell = this.fire.cellAt(a.x, a.z);\\n      if (cell && this.fire.state[cell.i] === 1 && a.kind === 'soldier') {\\n        a.state = 'panic';\\n        a.burnT = (a.burnT || 0) + dt;\\n        a.x += Math.cos(a.burnT) * dt * 3;\\n        a.z += Math.sin(a.burnT * 1.3) * dt * 3;\\n        this.fire.ignite(a.x, a.z, 0);\\n        if (a.burnT > 5) a.alive = false;\\n850→        continue;\\n      }\\n      if (a.kind === 'civil') {\\n        if (a.fleeing) {\\n          a.x += dt * 2;\\n          a.z += dt;\\n        }\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      if (a.kind !== 'soldier') continue;\\n860→      const see = this.soldierSees(a, p, night);\\n      a.sees = see;\\n      if (see && this.hostile(a)) {\\n        a.react = (a.react || 0) + dt;\\n        a.state = 'alert';\\n        if (a.react >= TUNING.enemyReaction) {\\n          const dist = Math.hypot(a.x - p.x, a.z - p.z);\\n          this.aimError = (1.2 + (5 - 1.2) * Math.min(1, dist / 80)) / TUNING.enemyAccuracy;\\n          if (this.rng.next() < 0.5 * dt * 4) this.hurt(9, 'bullet', false);\\n        }\\n870→      } else {\\n        a.react = 0;\\n        a.state = see ? 'suspicious' : 'idle';\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  soldierSees(a, p, night) {\\n    if (this.invisible) return false;\\n    let range = TUNING.enemyVision;\\n880→    if (this.crouch) range *= 0.55;\\n    if (night) range *= 0.45;\\n    if (this.burning > 0) range *= 2;\\n    const dist = Math.hypot(a.x - p.x, a.z - p.z);\\n    if (dist > range) return false;\\n    const ang = Math.atan2(p.x - a.x, p.z - a.z);\\n    let diff = Math.abs(ang - (a.yaw || 0));\\n    while (diff > Math.PI) diff = Math.abs(diff - Math.PI * 2);\\n    return diff < (120 * Math.PI) / 360;\\n  }\\n890→\\n  hostile(a) {\\n    if (a.kind === 'civil') return false;\\n    if (this.pass && a.faction === this.pass && !this.provoked) return false;\\n    if (this.truce && this.inTown(a.x, a.z)) return false;\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  inTown(x, z) {\\n    return this.truce && Math.hypot(x, z - 40) < 70;\\n900→  }\\n\\n  tickBuddies(dt) {\\n    for (const b of this.buddies) {\\n      if (!b.alive || !b.down) continue;\\n      b.downLeft -= dt;\\n      if (b.downLeft <= 0) {\\n        b.alive = false;\\n        b.down = false;\\n        if (!this.deadBuddies.has(b.id)) {\\n910→          this.deadBuddies.add(b.id);\\n          this.ledger.friends += 1;\\n        }\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'buddy-down') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (this.rescueT > 0) {\\n      this.rescueT -= dt;\\n      if (this.rescueT <= 0 && this.rescueBuddy) {\\n        const mags = this.rescueBuddy.id === 'mags';\",\"content_concise\":\"720→      size: [0.95, 0.45, 2.2],\\n      mass: 12,\\n      power: 160,\\n      topSpeed: TUNING.vehicleTopSpeed,\\n      wheelRadius: 0.42,\\n      suspension: 0.45,\\n      stiffness: 30,\\n      grip: 2.6,\\n    });\\n    this.vehicleHp = 100;\\n730→    this.vehicleKind = 'pickup';\\n    this.truckX = x;\\n    this.truckZ = z;\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(dt) {\\n    this.clock += dt;\\n    this.gameHours += (dt / (TUNING.dayMinutes * 60)) * 24;\\n    this.hour = ((this.gameHours % 24) + 24) % 24;\\n    this.stepWind(dt);\\n740→    this.fire.wind.x = Math.cos(this.windPin ? this.windPin.dir : this.windDir);\\n    this.fire.wind.z = Math.sin(this.windPin ? this.windPin.dir : this.windDir);\\n    this.fire.wind.speed = this.windPin ? this.windPin.speed : this.windSpeed;\\n    this.fire.rain = this.rain;\\n    this.fire.step(dt);\\n    if (this.game.blocksSim()) return;\\n    this.tickFever(dt);\\n    this.tickBurn(dt);\\n    this.tickRegen(dt);\\n    this.tickActors(dt);\\n750→    this.tickBuddies(dt);\\n    this.tickPosts();\\n    this.tickPlayer(dt);\\n    this.tickMission(dt);\\n    if (this.round) this.round.tick(dt);\\n    if ((this.clock * 2) % 1 < dt) this.refreshMap();\\n  }\\n\\n  stepWind(dt) {\\n    if (this.windPin) return;\\n760→    const turn = (15 * Math.PI / 180) * (dt / 60);\\n    this.windDir += (this.rng.next() - 0.5) * 2 * turn;\\n    this.windSpeed = clamp(this.windSpeed + (this.rng.next() - 0.5) * dt * 0.15, 0, 8);\\n  }\\n\\n  tickFever(dt) {\\n    if (this.game.mode !== 'play' && this.game.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.feverOn) {\\n      this.feverT -= dt;\\n      if (this.feverT <= 0) {\\n770→        this.feverOn = true;\\n        this.feverIgnore = 0;\\n        this.subtitle = line('fever');\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.feverClear > 0) {\\n      this.feverClear -= dt;\\n      if (this.feverClear <= 0) {\\n        this.feverOn = false;\\n780→        const shrink = this.flags.has('m7') ? 2 : this.flags.has('m3') ? 1 : 0;\\n        const mins = Math.max(2, TUNING.feverMinutes - shrink);\\n        this.feverT = mins * 60;\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.feverIgnore += dt;\\n    if (this.feverIgnore >= 25) this.collapse();\\n  }\\n\\n790→  collapse() {\\n    this.feverOn = false;\\n    this.feverIgnore = 0;\\n    this.feverClear = 0;\\n    const lost = this.stones * 0.2;\\n    this.stones = Math.max(0, this.stones - lost);\\n    this.hp = Math.max(this.hp, 30);\\n    const home = this.nearestSafe();\\n    this.teleport(home.x, home.z);\\n    this.dead = false;\\n800→    this.subtitle = 'YOU WAKE SHORT OF STONES.';\\n    if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'fever-fall') this.completeStep();\\n  }\\n\\n  nearestSafe() {\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    let best = { x: 12, z: 55 };\\n    let bd = Infinity;\\n    const homes = [{ x: 12, z: 55 }, ...[...this.safehouses].map((id) => siteById(id)).filter(Boolean)];\\n    for (const s of homes) {\\n810→      const d = Math.hypot(s.x - p.x, s.z - p.z);\\n      if (d < bd) {\\n        bd = d;\\n        best = s;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return best;\\n  }\\n\\n  tickBurn(dt) {\\n820→    const p = this.feet();\\n    const cell = this.fire.cellAt(p.x, p.z);\\n    const inFire = cell && this.fire.state[cell.i] === 1;\\n    const wet = nearRiver(p.x, p.z, 8);\\n    if (inFire && !wet) this.burning = 2;\\n    else if (this.burning > 0) this.burning = Math.max(0, this.burning - dt);\\n    if (this.burning > 0) this.hurt(TUNING.fireDamage * dt, 'fire', false);\\n  }\\n\\n  tickRegen(dt) {\\n830→    if (this.god || this.hp <= 0 || this.hp >= 100) return;\\n    this.regenT -= dt;\\n    if (this.regenT > 0) return;\\n    const top = Math.min(100, Math.ceil(this.hp / 20) * 20);\\n    if (this.hp < top) this.hp = Math.min(top, this.hp + 10 * dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  tickActors(dt) {\\n    const night = this.hour < 5.5 || this.hour >= 19;\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n840→    for (const a of this.actors) {\\n      if (!a.alive) continue;\\n      const cell = this.fire.cellAt(a.x, a.z);\\n      if (cell && this.fire.state[cell.i] === 1 && a.kind === 'soldier') {\\n        a.state = 'panic';\\n        a.burnT = (a.burnT || 0) + dt;\\n        a.x += Math.cos(a.burnT) * dt * 3;\\n        a.z += Math.sin(a.burnT * 1.3) * dt * 3;\\n        this.fire.ignite(a.x, a.z, 0);\\n        if (a.burnT > 5) a.alive = false;\\n850→        continue;\\n      }\\n      if (a.kind === 'civil') {\\n        if (a.fleeing) {\\n          a.x += dt * 2;\\n          a.z += dt;\\n        }\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      if (a.kind !== 'soldier') continue;\\n860→      const see = this.soldierSees(a, p, night);\\n      a.sees = see;\\n      if (see && this.hostile(a)) {\\n        a.react = (a.react || 0) + dt;\\n        a.state = 'alert';\\n        if (a.react >= TUNING.enemyReaction) {\\n          const dist = Math.hypot(a.x - p.x, a.z - p.z);\\n          this.aimError = (1.2 + (5 - 1.2) * Math.min(1, dist / 80)) / TUNING.enemyAccuracy;\\n          if (this.rng.next() < 0.5 * dt * 4) this.hurt(9, 'bullet', false);\\n        }\\n870→      } else {\\n        a.react = 0;\\n        a.state = see ? 'suspicious' : 'idle';\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  soldierSees(a, p, night) {\\n    if (this.invisible) return false;\\n    let range = TUNING.enemyVision;\\n880→    if (this.crouch) range *= 0.55;\\n    if (night) range *= 0.45;\\n    if (this.burning > 0) range *= 2;\\n    const dist = Math.hypot(a.x - p.x, a.z - p.z);\\n    if (dist > range) return false;\\n    const ang = Math.atan2(p.x - a.x, p.z - a.z);\\n    let diff = Math.abs(ang - (a.yaw || 0));\\n    while (diff > Math.PI) diff = Math.abs(diff - Math.PI * 2);\\n    return diff < (120 * Math.PI) / 360;\\n  }\\n890→\\n  hostile(a) {\\n    if (a.kind === 'civil') return false;\\n    if (this.pass && a.faction === this.pass && !this.provoked) return false;\\n    if (this.truce && this.inTown(a.x, a.z)) return false;\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  inTown(x, z) {\\n    return this.truce && Math.hypot(x, z - 40) < 70;\\n900→  }\\n\\n  tickBuddies(dt) {\\n    for (const b of this.buddies) {\\n      if (!b.alive || !b.down) continue;\\n      b.downLeft -= dt;\\n      if (b.downLeft <= 0) {\\n        b.alive = false;\\n        b.down = false;\\n        if (!this.deadBuddies.has(b.id)) {\\n910→          this.deadBuddies.add(b.id);\\n          this.ledger.friends += 1;\\n        }\\n        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'buddy-down') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (this.rescueT > 0) {\\n      this.rescueT -= dt;\\n      if (this.rescueT <= 0 && this.rescueBuddy) {\\n        const mags = this.rescueBuddy.id === 'mags';\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js\",\"offset\":720,\"limit\":200,\"raw_output\":\"      size: [0.95, 0.45, 2.2],\\n      mass: 12,\\n      power: 160,\\n      topSpeed: TUNING.vehicleTopSpeed,\\n      wheelRadius: 0.42,\\n      suspension: 0.45,\\n      stiffness: 30,\\n      grip: 2.6,\\n    });\\n    this.vehicleH