does not ignite again; a jam blocks fire and repeated reload clears it; condition 0 empties the slot; a tablet clears fever and ignoring it costs stones; surgery, rescue, and finish-it behave as in criterion 2; the map can be raised while driving and its cursor sets a waypoint; clean-storage music volume is 0.1; every balance slider changes its system and Reset restores every default; attract does not start before the 10-second boundary, does start at that boundary with no input, and exits on input without a save write; a solo round banks a case, drops it on down, revives, and finishes on time-up with every present player once in the standings; a bot finishes every shipped mission through both endings and the ledger/world assertions hold, including a run with one buddy dead; source has no `Math.random` and no TODO/FIXME/placeholder/stub/coming soon; content strings stay inside the HUD font; every shipped sound renders non-silent; `pixel-engine.js` matches the kit zip byte for byte.\\n2. gating: Launch the real built HTML from `file://` twice, in Chromium via Playwright at 1920×1080, with the WebGPU flags in PLAN.md §24. Capture `{SCRATCH}/launch-1.log` and `{SCRATCH}/launch-2.log`. Each run must show no page or console errors, `AIHub.active` false, and game state whose title string equals the RNG pick. The two runs must agree. If Playwright itself cannot start, write that failure to `{SCRATCH}/launch-env.log`; the headless suite in step 1 is then the accepted bar. A screenshot buffer that comes back blank is not proof of failure and not proof of success; the state assertion is the primary observable (this machine's software WebGPU canvas can be blank). Do not invent a stand-in page.\\n3. gating: On Playwright's iPhone 14 profile under Chromium (drop the WebKit device default), open the same file and capture `{SCRATCH}/touch.log`. Pass only if the notice text is exactly `Controller or keyboard required`, a Settings control is shown, a tap opens Settings, and attract is not blocked. A WebKit iPhone load that fails for lack of WebGPU is evidence only; record it in `{SCRATCH}/webkit-iphone.log` and do not treat it as the gate.\\n4. gating: Copy the built HTML beside the hub harness files, serve that directory with `python3 -u -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`, confirm the page title is the chosen game title, then run the four PLAN.md §24 scenarios one at a time. Pass only when each reaches `document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'` and `window.__hubCheck.pass === true`. Capture `{SCRATCH}/hub.log`, including any failed `__hubCheck.checks`. Stop only that server, by its PID. If same-computer link was not cut, also drive two `file://` pages through one shared round to matching standings and a shared fire or case, logged in `{SCRATCH}/link.log`. If link was cut, that log must show the feature is absent (no menu entry).\\n5. evidence: After the game has been rendering for at least 10 seconds, save the PLAN.md §24 screenshots under `{SCRATCH}/shots/`. Parse `exit-interview.json` and confirm the key shape. Screenshot absence or a blank WebGPU frame does not fail the goal once steps 1–4 hold.\\n\\n## Non-goals\\n- A recreation of Far Cry 2: its proper nouns, characters, plot, map, logos, music, and look stay out. Defining mechanics are already rewritten in PLAN.md (fever, jam and break, wind-driven grass fire, handheld map, hired buddies who can die, stones and a tracker, two rotten factions, safehouses, first person on foot and in vehicles).\\n- FPS targets, render optimization, and judging the game by wall-clock frame rate. Software WebGPU here is about 1 fps; tests advance with `step`.\\n- Physical DualSense, a TV, a human listener, a second human, real iOS Safari, prone, ladders, ledge grabs, on-screen touch controls, audio files, chat, emotes, or custom player names.\\n- Editing `pixel-engine.js`, or leaving a cut feature as a stub, menu entry, or map mark.\\n- Civilian targets, child soldiers, and sexual violence.\\n\",\"total_lines\":54}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-181f9692-924e-4316-b288-785d36b70be8-35","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,57,49,55,95,95,120,48,55,51,57,51,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,53,45,48,49,51,57,49,55,95,95,120,48,55,51,57,51,99,47,116,109,112,47,103,114,111,107,45,103,111,97,108,45,101,49,54,49,54,52,100,49,99,50,100,101,47,105,109,112,108,101,109,101,110,116,101,114,47,116,111,117,99,104,46,108,111,103,10,51,58,32,32,32,32,34,110,111,116,105,99,101,34,58,32,34,67,111,110,116,114,111,108,108,101,114,32,111,114,32,107,101,121,98,111,97,114,100,32,114,101,113,117,105,114,101,100,34,44,10,55,58,32,32,32,32,34,115,99,114,101,101,110,34,58,32,34,116,105,116,108,101,34,44,10,49,51,58,32,32,32,32,34,110,111,116,105,99,101,34,58,32,34,67,111,110,116,114,111,108,108,101,114,32,111,114,32,107,101,121,98,111,97,114,100,32,114,101,113,117,105,114,101,100,34,44,10,49,55,58,32,32,32,32,34,115,99,114,101,101,110,34,58,32,34,116,105,116,108,101,34,44,10,50,51,58,32,32,32,32,34,110,111,116,105,99,101,34,58,32,34,67,111,110,116,114,111,108,108,101,114,32,111,114,32,107,101,121,98,111,97,114,100,32,114,101,113,117,105,114,101,100,34,44,10,50,55,58,32,32,32,32,34,115,99,114,101,101,110,34,58,32,34,116,105,116,108,101,34,44,10,51,51,58,32,32,32,32,34,110,111,116,105,99,101,34,58,32,34,67,111,110,116,114