{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_600","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nMercs correctly skip the soldier brain because tickActors only processes soldier kinds. Round logic moves the seat and copies it to the actor, so the mesh follows.\n\nDowned mercs disappear rather than lie down. The plan did not require a downed body, so this is acceptable.\n\nBuddies have no x or z coordinates until they are downed. placeRig falls back to feet() when those values areSLIDER_KEYS contains 21 keys, plus reset missing. and back, for a total of 23 items.\n\nBuddies without x or z coordinates are pinned to the player's feet every frame. This would leave their mesh stuck in the camera constantly. I am checking mission M6 to see when buddies are created.\n\nThe stuck-buddy bug may be a pre-existing defect rather than something introduced this round. The prior gap only required instancing the rig for buddies,","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ac39a5e-d48a-4539-8ac5-b52053489856-45","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":1080,"limit":150}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ac39a5e-d48a-4539-8ac5-b52053489856-46","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TODO|FIXME|unimplemented|coming soon|placeholder|stub","glob":"**/{src,tests,game.js,index.html}/**/*.{js,mjs,html,md}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5ac39a5e-d48a-4539-8ac5-b52053489856-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/exit-interview.json","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2565,"output_tokens":478,"cache_read_input_tokens":101504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"aedcc952-6cf5-449a-8b15-56d3d988e90c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5ac39a5e-d48a-4539-8ac5-b52053489856-45","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1080→        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'syrette') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  combat(dt, input) {\\n    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (gun) gun.cooldown = Math.max(0, gun.cooldown - dt);\\n    const want = heldAction(input, 'fire') || input.isDown('MouseLeft');\\n    const tap = consumeAction(input, 'fire');\\n1090→    if (!gun || this.sprint) return;\\n    const def = WEAPON_BY_ID[gun.id];\\n    const auto = !!(def && def.auto);\\n    if (!(auto ? want : tap)) return;\\n    if (gun.cooldown > 0) return;\\n    if (this.inTown(this.feet().x, this.feet().z) && this.truce) return;\\n    if (gun.jammed) {\\n      this.prompt = 'JAMMED';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n1100→    if (gun.magSize > 0 && gun.mag <= 0) return;\\n    this.fireGun(gun, def);\\n  }\\n\\n  fireGun(gun, def) {\\n    const rate = def.rate || 1;\\n    gun.cooldown = 1 / rate;\\n    if (!this.infAmmo && gun.magSize > 0) gun.mag -= 1;\\n    gun.shots += 1;\\n    this.shotCount += 1;\\n1110→    const wear = (def.wear || 0) * TUNING.wearRate * (this.upgrades.has('clean') ? 0.6 : 1);\\n    gun.cond = Math.max(0, gun.cond - wear);\\n    if (gun.cond <= 0) {\\n      this.breakGun();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const jamP = this.noJam ? 0 : TUNING.jamRate * 0.12 * (1 - gun.cond / 100) ** 2;\\n    const script = this.jamScript && gun.shots >= this.jamScript;\\n    if (script || this.rng.next() < jamP) {\\n      gun.jammed = true;\\n1120→      gun.jamLeft = 2 + Math.floor(this.rng.next() * 3);\\n      if (script) this.jamScript = 0;\\n    }\\n    this.resolveShot(def);\\n    this.provoked = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  breakGun() {\\n    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (!gun) return;\\n1130→    this.guns.splice(this.slot, 1);\\n    this.slot = Math.max(0, this.guns.length - 1);\\n    this.subtitle = 'THE GUN COMES APART.';\\n  }\\n\\n  resolveShot(def) {\\n    const p = this.feet();\\n    const yaw = this.ctx.camera.yaw || 0;\\n    const dx = -Math.sin(yaw);\\n    const dz = -Math.cos(yaw);\\n1140→    const range = def.range || 40;\\n    if (def.ignite || def.blast) {\\n      const x = p.x + dx * Math.min(range, 18);\\n      const z = p.z + dz * Math.min(range, 18);\\n      const r = def.ignite || def.blast || 1;\\n      this.fire.ignite(x, z, r);\\n      this.linkSpark = { x, z, r };\\n      this.fire.litByPlayer += 1;\\n      this.damagePoint(x, z, def.damage * TUNING.weaponDamage, def.blast || 2);\\n      return;\\n1150→    }\\n    this.damageRay(p, dx, dz, range, (def.damage || 10) * TUNING.weaponDamage);\\n  }\\n\\n  damageRay(p, dx, dz, range, dmg) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bd = range;\\n    for (const a of this.actors) {\\n      if (!a.alive) continue;\\n      const ox = a.x - p.x;\\n1160→      const oz = a.z - p.z;\\n      const along = ox * dx + oz * dz;\\n      if (along < 0 || along > bd) continue;\\n      const lat = Math.hypot(ox - dx * along, oz - dz * along);\\n      if (lat < 0.8) {\\n        best = a;\\n        bd = along;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    for (const prop of this.props) {\\n1170→      if (!prop.alive) continue;\\n      const ox = prop.x - p.x;\\n      const oz = prop.z - p.z;\\n      const along = ox * dx + oz * dz;\\n      if (along < 0 || along > range) continue;\\n      const lat = Math.hypot(ox - dx * along, oz - dz * along);\\n      if (lat < 1.4) this.damageProp(prop, dmg);\\n    }\\n    if (best) this.damageActor(best, dmg);\\n  }\\n1180→\\n  damagePoint(x, z, dmg, r) {\\n    for (const a of this.actors) {\\n      if (!a.alive) continue;\\n      if (Math.hypot(a.x - x, a.z - z) <= r + 1) this.damageActor(a, dmg);\\n    }\\n    for (const prop of this.props) {\\n      if (!prop.alive) continue;\\n      if (Math.hypot(prop.x - x, prop.z - z) <= r + 1.5) this.damageProp(prop, dmg);\\n    }\\n1190→    if (this.vehicleHp > 0 && this.car && !this.inVehicle) {\\n      const t = this.car.body.translation();\\n      if (Math.hypot(t.x - x, t.z - z) < r + 2) this.vehicleHp = Math.max(0, this.vehicleHp - dmg / TUNING.vehicleToughness);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  damageActor(a, dmg) {\\n    if (a.kind === 'civil') {\\n      a.fleeing = true;\\n      return;\\n1200→    }\\n    if (a.kind === 'merc' && this.round) {\\n      this.round.hurtSeat(a.seat, dmg);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    a.hp -= dmg;\\n    if (a.hp <= 0 && a.alive) {\\n      a.alive = false;\\n      if (a.kind === 'soldier') this.ledger.killed += 1;\\n      const step = this.currentStep();\\n1210→      if (step && step.do === 'clear') {\\n        const left = this.actors.filter((x) => x.alive && x.post === step.tag).length;\\n        if (left <= 0) this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  damageProp(prop, dmg) {\\n    if (prop.hidden) return;\\n    prop.hp = (prop.hp || 40) - dmg;\\n1220→    const step = this.currentStep();\\n    if (prop.hp > 0 && !(step && step.do === 'destroy' && prop.tag === step.tag && (prop.tag === 'fuel-tank' || prop.tag === 'pump'))) {\\n      if (prop.tag === 'fuel-tank' || prop.tag === 'pump' || prop.tag === 'convoy') {\\n        if (prop.hp > 0) return;\\n      } else return;\\n    }\\n    if (prop.hp > 0 && prop.tag !== 'fuel-tank' && prop.tag !== 'pump' && prop.tag !== 'convoy') return;\\n    if (!prop.alive) return;\\n    if (prop.hp > 0 && step && step.do === 'destroy' && prop.tag === step.tag) {\\n      prop.alive = false;\",\"content_concise\":\"1080→        if (this.currentStep()?.do === 'syrette') this.completeStep();\\n      }\\n    } else this.holdT.heal = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  combat(dt, input) {\\n    const gun = this.weapon;\\n    if (gun) gun.cooldown = Math.max(0, gun.cooldown - dt);\\n    const want = heldAction(input, 'fire') || input.isDown('MouseLeft');\\n    const tap = consumeAction(input, 'fire');\\n1090→    if (!gun || this.sprint) return;\\n    con