es\\\",\\n    \\\"tech\\\": \\\"Pixel Engine 0.46.0, three.js r186, Rapier 0.20, esbuild 0.28.2. Original sim, fire grid, weapons, and missions.\\\",\\n    \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"Engine pixel-art toon at 480x270. Sand, orange, and red land. Slate for Concord, orange for the Harvest Front. Green only for water and regrowth.\\\",\\n    \\\"animation\\\": \\\"Engine clips on the soldier rig. First-person hands on a small rig. Mixer poses for reload, the map, and surgery.\\\",\\n    \\\"audio\\\": \\\"Code songs, code effects, and no audio files. Animalese voices. Music starts at 10 percent.\\\",\\n    \\\"online\\\": \\\"AI Hub shared-world for 1-4 players. Cash Run lasts 6 minutes. Same-computer link uses a BroadcastChannel.\\\",\\n    \\\"testing\\\": \\\"node tests/run.mjs --all. Headless Engine.step playthrough. Playwright Chromium with WebGPU flags. Hub harness, four scenarios.\\\",\\n    \\\"research\\\": \\\"Mechanics from the plan, not a port. No source maps, names, or plot.\\\",\\n    \\\"environment\\\": \\\"Grok CLI (headless); Linux\\\",\\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"xAI, grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh\\\",\\n    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"13. Listed in tests/ISSUES.md.\\\",\\n    \\\"13. Each one stopped a required path.\\\",\\n    \\\"node tests/run.mjs --all. One shared engine showed the leaks.\\\",\\n    \\\"A blank WebGPU screenshot. The state read is the proof.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"engineFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"Headless step, seeded RNG, HUD pixels, and a vehicle that stays upright.\\\",\\n    \\\"First-person yaw 0 looks down -Z. The car yaw 0 drives toward +Z. Speed is a writable field, as the plan said.\\\",\\n    \\\"The fire grid, jams, fever, map, mission runner, and the hub round.\\\",\\n    \\\"Pointer lock, timeScale pause, and keeping Pad codes off the keyboard.\\\",\\n    \\\"None. pixel-engine.js is the kit file.\\\",\\n    \\\"A first-person rig that does not steal the use key or the pointer.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"promptFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The plan names the traps and the order to cut whole features.\\\",\\n    \\\"File stem spaces, and which card the harness presses Enter on.\\\",\\n    \\\"One world that is a campaign, a 6 minute round, and a hub server.\\\",\\n    \\\"Ship the hub check before asking for every prop in the art list.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"A Cry Too Far\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Stones, fire, and a bad contract\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"A first-person survival shooter in the Kettle. Two factions pay you in stones to burn a firebreak you were not meant to see. Play the story alone, or carry diamond cases in Cash Run with up to four players.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Shooter\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Far Cry 2\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Far Cry\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Gamepad, keyboard, and mouse. First person on foot and in vehicles.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"first-person\\\", \\\"pixel art\\\", \\\"co-op\\\", \\\"versus\\\", \\\"vehicles\\\", \\\"story\\\"]\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":51}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"6882bdc0-ff8d-4d51-b4a0-e2ede05ab3d9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_601","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" not assigning them coordinates.\n\nThe stuck-buddy bug is a regression from this round. makeBuddy attaches the rig immediately, but it never assigns x or z coordinates to living buddies. placeRig then falls back to the player's feet, pinning their mesh inside the camera. Civilians, soldiers, and mercs already have positions, so only buddies are affected.\n\nThe stuck-buddy bug is severe enough to refute the fix. placeRig never writes the fallback position back to actor.x or actor.z, so every frame the mesh snaps to the player's feet. The fight screenshot shows a spawned soldier at z=50, not a buddy, but the bug still existsMercs spawned with faction 'merc' retain kind  and needs fixing.'soldier' from spawnSoldier.\n\nThe prior gap required instancing the rig and moving it with the actor. A buddy without coordinates cannot be moved; it can only be pinned to the player's\n\nIf kind remains 'soldier', damageActor reduces the actor's HP instead of its seat. The solo round test expects friendly fire to damage the merc, but it would only affect the soldier's health. feet. placeRig never hides a mesh when x or z is null, so the soldier stays visible inside the truck. This is a real defect in the shipped fix.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12bba944-e371-4ea6-9f15-cc0199ae5ce1-48","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/round.js","offset":40,"limit":140}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12bba944-e371-4ea6-9f15-cc0199ae5ce1-49","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"kind = 'merc'|kind: 'merc'|\\.seat","glob":"**/*.{js,mjs}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3287,"output_tokens":418,"cache_read_input_tokens":104064,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"42a8a383-b21a-406c-8ee2-d78565ff6786"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-12bba944-e371-4ea6-9f15-cc0199ae5ce1-48","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"40→      yaw: Math.PI,\\n      reviveT: 0,\\n      actor: null,\\n    }));\\n    this.me = session.server ? null : session.me;\\n    world.mission = null;\\n    world.dead = false;\\n    world.hp = 100;\\n    world.rescueT = 0;\\n    world.surgeryT = 0;\\n50→    world.burning = 0;\\n    world.clearBuddies();\\n    world.guns = [];\\n    world.giveGun('cane', 100);\\n    world.giveGun('flare', 100);\\n    world.giveGun('tractor', 70);\\n    world.syrettes = 2;\\n    world.tablets = 0;\\n    world.feverT = 99999;\\n    world.feverOn = false;\\n60→    world.hour = 16;\\n    world.windPin = { dir: 0.4, speed: 5 };\\n    const mine = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (mine) world.teleport(mine.x, mine.z);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\\n      world.spawnSoldier({ x: 130 + (i % 4) * 14, z: -300 - Math.floor(i / 4) * 12, faction: i % 2 ? 'harvest' : 'concord' });\\n    }\\n    for (const s of this.seats) {\\n      if (s.id === this.me) continue;\\n      const actor = world.spawnSoldier({ id: 'merc-' + s.id, x: s.x, z: s.z, faction: 'merc' });\\n70→      actor.kind = 'merc';\\n      actor.seat = s.id;\\n      actor.hp = 100;\\n      s.actor = actor;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  seat(id) {\\n    return this.seats.find((s) => s.id === id) || null;\\n  }\\n80→\\n  noteDown() {\\n    const s = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    this.downSeat(s);\\n    this.localDown = true;\\n    this.world.hp = 0;\\n    this.world.dead = false;\\n  }\\n\\n90→  downSeat(s) {\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    s.down = true;\\n    s.hp = 0;\\n    s.downs += 1;\\n    s.bleed = 25;\\n    s.reviveT = 0;\\n    if (s.carrying) this.drop(s);\\n    if (s.actor) s.actor.hp = 0;\\n  }\\n100→\\n  drop(s) {\\n    const c = this.cases.find((item) => item.id === s.carrying);\\n    if (c) {\\n      c.carrier = null;\\n      c.x = s.x;\\n      c.z = s.z;\\n    }\\n    s.carrying = null;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) this.world.carrying = null;\\n110→  }\\n\\n  hurtSeat(id, dmg) {\\n    const s = this.seat(id);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return;\\n    s.hp = Math.max(0, s.hp - dmg);\\n    if (s.actor) s.actor.hp = s.hp;\\n    if (s.hp <= 0) {\\n      this.downSeat(s);\\n      if (s.id === this.me) {\\n120→        this.localDown = true;\\n        this.world.hp = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  revive(s, by) {\\n    s.down = false;\\n    s.hp = 60;\\n    s.bleed = 25;\\n130→    s.reviveT = 0;\\n    if (s.actor) {\\n      s.actor.hp = 60;\\n      s.actor.alive = true;\\n    }\\n    if (by) by.revives += 1;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) {\\n      this.localDown = false;\\n      this.world.hp = 60;\\n      this.world.dead = false;\\n140→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  respawn(s) {\\n    const i = this.seats.indexOf(s);\\n    s.x = SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][0];\\n    s.z = SPAWNS[i % SPAWNS.length][1];\\n    this.revive(s, null);\\n    s.hp = 100;\\n    if (s.id === this.me) {\\n150→      this.world.hp = 100;\\n      this.world.teleport(s.x, s.z);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  tryUse(world) {\\n    const s = this.seat(this.me);\\n    if (!s || s.down) return false;\\n    const p = world.feet();\\n    const input = world.ctx.input;\\n160→    const held = input.isDown('KeyE') || input.isDown('PadSquare');\\n    if (s.carrying && Math.hypot(this.truck.x - p.x, this.truck.z - p.z) < 6) {\\n      const c = this.cases.find((item) => item.id === s.carrying);\\n      const stones = c ? c.stones : 1;\\n      s.stones += stones;\\n      world.stones += stones;\\n      world.ledger.stonesEarned += stones;\\n      if (c) {\\n        c.taken = true;\\n        c.carrier = null;\\n170→      }\\n      s.carrying = null;\\n      world.carrying = null;\\n      return true;\\n    }\\n    for (const other of this.seats) {\\n      if (other.id === s.id || !other.down) continue;\\n      if (Math.hypot(other.x - 