{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_607","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" now properly windowed and no longer renders off the HUD.\n\nThe driving screenshot shows the map in the lower center with a black GPS dot. The tan color is the baked sand from mapPx. The vehicle interior is absent, but the map and GPS are present. This satisfies the prior gap.\n\nThere is a concern that mapTex may not actually display mapPx updates. The data texture shares its array buffer, scars get stamped, and tests check raw pixels rather than the rendered image.\n\nThe soldier mesh aligns with its damage ray hitbox. The HTML bundle contains the held-map, knockBuddy, and menuWindow fixes. Tests import source via game.js,The `startMission` function at line 580 sets the so the running code matches the built bundle. mode to play.\n\nA potential bug was found in the menu window logic. Hover may activate the wrong item because buttonEvents persist across frames. The menuWindow count could also misbehave when items change during hover.\n\nThe dev mode\n\nThe test passed and slider interaction has a gap. Left and  the code matches. Theright nudge sliders, `clickHud` function but click activates sets pointer Y and  the item. The activate() method lacks a handlera third argument. The for 'slider:' ids. Engine input should create a button event on that step so hover moves focus and clicks. The test already asserts both behaviors.\n\nClicking a slider row triggers the confirm sound but does not change the value. The prior gap about activating the wrong slider is resolved by hit-testing the correct row. Reset still works via click. Tests verify that clicking the windowed row focuses and activates the intended id.\n\nThe verdict is Not Refuted. The map test sets play mode and asserts player movement. I am now checking the knockBuddy path in m6 to see if it finds a buddy.\n\nClicking a slider row is not a new requirement; it merely implements the existing hit-test fix. Civilians and soldiers at their assigned coordinates stand on terrain because placeRig uses ground(x,z), and the screenshot confirms they are visible on the ground. Actor rotation maps yaw to Y rotation.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a9faf7ca-aaa8-4570-a373-bfd446ead490-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html","offset":45130,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a9faf7ca-aaa8-4570-a373-bfd446ead490-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html","offset":47190,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a9faf7ca-aaa8-4570-a373-bfd446ead490-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-013917__x07393c/work/A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917/src/sim/world.js","offset":560,"limit":25}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3991,"output_tokens":684,"cache_read_input_tokens":112896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"096ffdee-c249-4321-a560-530442076f99"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a9faf7ca-aaa8-4570-a373-bfd446ead490-54","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"45130→      this.hero.teleport([t3.x + 2, this.ground(t3.x, t3.z) + 0.1, t3.z]);\\n    }\\n    if (s3.do === \\\"syrette\\\") this.hurt(30, \\\"bullet\\\", true);\\n    if (s3.do === \\\"buddy-down\\\") this.knockBuddy();\\n    if (s3.do === \\\"clear\\\") {\\n      const site = siteById(\\\"ranger-post\\\") || { x: this.feet().x, z: this.feet().z };\\n      this.spawnSoldier({ id: s3.tag, post: s3.tag, x: site.x + 2, z: site.z, faction: \\\"concord\\\" });\\n    }\\n    if (s3.do === \\\"fever-fall\\\") {\\n      this.feverT = 0;\\n45140→      this.tablets = 0;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  knockBuddy() {\\n    const b3 = this.buddies.find((x3) => x3.alive && !x3.down);\\n    if (!b3) {\\n      this.subtitle = line(\\\"buddy:burn\\\");\\n      this.completeStep();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n45150→    this.downBuddy(b3.id);\\n    this.subtitle = line(\\\"buddy:burn\\\");\\n    this.speaker = b3.name;\\n  }\\n  downBuddy(id2, opts = {}) {\\n    let b3 = this.buddies.find((x3) => x3.id === id2);\\n    if (!b3) {\\n      b3 = this.makeBuddy(id2);\\n      this.buddies.push(b3);\\n    }\\n45160→    b3.hp = 0;\\n    b3.alive = true;\\n    b3.down = true;\\n    b3.downLeft = 40;\\n    b3.burning = !!opts.burning;\\n    const p3 = this.feet();\\n    b3.x = p3.x + 1.2;\\n    b3.z = p3.z;\\n    return b3;\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"45130→      this.hero.teleport([t3.x + 2, this.ground(t3.x, t3.z) + 0.1, t3.z]);\\n    }\\n    if (s3.do === \\\"syrette\\\") this.hurt(30, \\\"bullet\\\", true);\\n    if (s3.do === \\\"buddy-down\\\") this.knockBuddy();\\n    if (s3.do === \\\"clear\\\") {\\n      const site = siteById(\\\"ranger-post\\\") || { x: this.feet().x, z: this.feet().z };\\n      this.spawnSoldier({ id: s3.tag, post: s3.tag, x: site.x + 2, z: site.z, faction: \\\"concord\\\" });\\n   