dies.find((x3) => x3.id === id2);\\n    if (!b3) {\\n      b3 = this.makeBuddy(id2);\\n      this.buddies.push(b3);\\n    }\\n    b3.hp = 0;\\n    b3.alive = true;\\n    b3.down = true;\\n    b3.downLeft = 40;\\n    b3.burning = !!opts.burning;\\n    const p3 = this.feet();\\n    b3.x = p3.x + 1.2;\\n    b3.z = p3.z;\\n    return b3;\\n  }\\n\",\"total_lines\":47673}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a9faf7ca-aaa8-4570-a373-bfd446ead490-55","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"47190→  menuInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const items = this.items();\\n    if (pressed(input, [\\\"ArrowDown\\\", \\\"KeyS\\\", \\\"PadDown\\\"])) this.focus = Math.min(items.length - 1, this.focus + 1);\\n    if (pressed(input, [\\\"ArrowUp\\\", \\\"KeyW\\\", \\\"PadUp\\\"])) this.focus = Math.max(0, this.focus - 1);\\n    if (pressed(input, [\\\"ArrowLeft\\\", \\\"KeyA\\\", \\\"PadLeft\\\"])) this.nudge(-1);\\n    if (pressed(input, [\\\"ArrowRight\\\", \\\"KeyD\\\", \\\"PadRight\\\"])) this.nudge(1);\\n    const armed = !(this.menuArm > 0);\\n    if (armed && pressed(input, [\\\"Enter\\\", \\\"Space\\\", \\\"PadCross\\\"])) this.activate(items[this.focus]);\\n    if (armed && pressed(input, [\\\"Escape\\\", \\\"PadCircle\\\"]) && this.screen !== \\\"title\\\" && this.screen !== \\\"menu\\\") this.back();\\n47200→    this.hover(ctx, items, armed);\\n  }\\n  menuWindow(items) {\\n    const top = Math.max(0, this.focus - 6);\\n    const count = Math.min(9, Math.max(0, (items?.length || 0) - top));\\n    return { top, count };\\n  }\\n  hover(ctx, items, armed = true) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const width = ctx.hud?.width || 480;\\n47210→    const height = ctx.hud?.height || 270;\\n    const px2 = (input.pointer.x + 1) / 2 * width;\\n    const py2 = (1 - input.pointer.y) / 2 * height;\\n    const { top, count } = this.menuWindow(items);\\n    for (let i3 = 0; i3 < count; i3++) {\\n      const y3 = 86 + i3 * 16;\\n      if (px2 > 36 && px2 < width - 36 && py2 > y3 - 2 && py2 < y3 + 14) this.focus = top + i3;\\n    }\\n    if (!armed) return;\\n    for (const ev2 of input.buttonEvents) {\\n47220→      if (!ev2.down) continue;\\n      if (ev2.code === \\\"MouseLeft\\\" || ev2.code === \\\"Touch\\\") this.activate(items[this.focus]);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  state() {\\n    const w3 = this.world;\\n    const p3 = w3 ? w3.feet() : { x: 0, y: 0, z: 0 };\\n    const gun = w3?.weapon;\\n    const rows = [];\\n    if (this.notice) rows.push({ action: \\\"confirm\\\", text: \\\"SETTINGS\\\" });\",\"content_concise\":\"47190→  menuInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const items = this.items();\\n    if (pressed(input, [\\\"ArrowDown\\\", \\\"KeyS\\\", \\\"PadDown\\\"])) this.focus = Math.min(items.length - 1, this.focus + 1);\\n    if (pressed(input, [\\\"ArrowUp\\\", \\\"KeyW\\\", \\\"PadUp\\\"])) this.focus = Math.max(0, this.focus - 1);\\n    if (pressed(input, [\\\"ArrowLeft\\\", \\\"KeyA\\\", \\\"PadLeft\\\"])) this.nudge(-1);\\n    if (pressed(input, [\\\"ArrowRight\\\", \\\"KeyD\\\", \\\"PadRight\\\"])) this.nudge(1);\\n    const armed = !(this.menuArm > 0);\\n    if (armed && pressed(input, [\\\"Enter\\\", \\\"Space\\\", \\\"PadCross\\\"])) this.activate(items[this.focus]);\\n    if (armed && pressed(input, [\\\"Escape\\\", \\\"PadCircle\\\"]) && this.screen !== \\\"title\\\" && this.screen !== \\\"menu\\\") this.back();\\n47200→    this.hover(ctx, items, armed);\\n  }\\n  menuWindow(items) {\\n    const top = Math.max(0, this.focus - 6);\\n    const count = Math.min(9, Math.max(0, (items?.length || 0) - top));\\n    return { top, count };\\n  }\\n  hover(ctx, items, armed = true) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const width = ctx.hud?.width || 480;\\n47210→    const height = ctx.hud?.height || 270;\\n    const px2 = (input.pointer.x + 1) / 2 * width;\\n    const py2 = (1 - input.pointer.y) / 2 * height;\\n    const { top, count } = this.menuWindow(items);\