er from a single HTML file.\n\n- Open `A Cry Too Far-Far Cry 2-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261105-013917.html` in Chrome or another WebGPU browser. `file://` works.\n- On the title screen, start New Game. Use WASD and the mouse, or a gamepad. Esc or Options pauses, and Dev Mode is in that menu.\n- Press M to hold the map. Cash Run on the main menu is solo, host or join on this computer, or AI Hub online."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":42640,"output_tokens":3685,"cache_read_input_tokens":1408,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aadc-c537-7073-8756-0b078a9e97df","uuid":"b6964c49-b320-469c-835e-940d4f9035d6"}
